<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1CH" style="id">- YAO BIBLE VERSION</book>
  <para style="h">1 Indu ya katema</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Indu ya katema</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Indu ya katema</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Indu ya katema</para>
  <para style="mt2">1 Indu ya Katema</para>
  <para style="mt1">Chitabu chaandanda cha Indu ya Katema</para>
  <para style="imt">Chilongolelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Chtabu chaandanda ni chaaŵili cha Indu ya Katema, kuundanda ko yaliji chitabu chimo chekulungwa. Yagaŵikwe pa ulendo waandanda ni kuŵa itabu iŵili ya Seputuaginti iyalembekwe kwa chiŵecheto cha Chiyunani chakalakala. Liloŵe lyekulu lya chitabu cha Indu ya Katema mu Chiebulania lyasagamukulikwe kuti “Indu yaikukopochela pa katema fulani.” Ŵasyomile ŵajinji akukulupilila kuti che Esila ni juŵasongangenye ngani ni kulemba nkati indu yaili mu chitabu chaandanda ni chaaŵili cha Indu ya Katema pamo ni chitabu cha Esila ni chitabu cha Nehemia. Mundu ŵalembile sooni ngani kutyochela mu chitabu cha Samweli ni chitabu cha Mamwenye, paŵasongangenye ngani sya itabu yi. Sooni ŵasyomile ŵajinji akukulupilila kuti chitabu chi chalembekwe pa katema kaaŵili ka kaline jansano akanaŵe kwika Kilisto, ŵandu ŵajinji ŵaakusalikwa mwelemo paŵaliji ŵajumi, katema che Esila nombe paŵaliji ŵajumi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu chaandanda ni chaaŵili cha Indu yakate ikutanda kwa kugakolanga meena ga ŵachekulwipe kutyochela ku che Adamu mpaka ku che Ibulahimu, ni kutanda kwa chilambo cha ŵandu ŵa ku Isilaeli mpaka katema ŵandu ŵa ku Isilaeli paŵausile ku usami kuŵaliji achikapolo, pakumala kukamulikwa ni kwajausya kweleko. Kutandilila pelepo itabu ya Indu yakatema ikusala ngani syankati chilambo cha Isilaeli kutandilila kuumbesi kwa utawala wa mwenye che Sauli mpaka kugumulikwa kwa musi wa ku Yelusalemu ni musi wa ku Babeloni. Mu itabu yose ya Indu ya Katema akusala indu yamunkati ya Nyuumba ja Akunnungu kwele ku Yelusalemu ko. Che Daudi ŵapanganyisye indu yejinji kukamuchisya utaŵe wa Nyuumba ja Akunnungu (1 Indu ya Katema 28:29), nipele che Selemani mwanache jwakwe ŵajitaŵile nyuumba jo (2 Indu ya Katema 2:7). Sooni mundu jwalembile itabu ya Indu ya Katema akusala ngani syankati kugumulikwa kwa Nyuumba ja Akunnungu, ni kujigalikwa kwa indu yose iyaliji mwelemo (2 Indu ya Katema 36:15-21). Kwa kumalichisya, msitali waambesi mu chitabu cha (2 Indu ya Katema 36:23), ukusala ngani syankati kujitaŵa sooni Nyuumba ja Akunnungu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yaili mu chitabu chaandanda cha Indu ya Katema</para>
  <para style="io">Ngani sya meena ga achachekulu kutyochela ku che Adamu mpaka kwa ŵandu ŵa ku Isilaeli paŵausile kutyochela ku usami kuŵajigalikwe (Sula ja 1 mpaka sula ja 9)</para>
  <para style="io">Ngani si che Daudi ni utawala wakwe (Sula ja 10 mpaka sula ja 29).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CH 1" />
  <para style="s1">Uŵelesi kutandilila che Adamu mpaka che Ibulahimu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="GEN 5:1-32">Ndandililo 5:1-32</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 10:1-32">10:1-32</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 11:10-26">11:10-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 1:1" />Che Adamu ŵammeleche che Seti, che Seti ŵammeleche che Enoshi, che Enoshi ŵammeleche che Kenani, <verse eid="1CH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 1:2" />che Kenani ŵammeleche che Mahalaleli, che Mahalaleli ŵammeleche che Yaledi, <verse eid="1CH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 1:3" />che Yaledi ŵammeleche che Henoki, che Henoki ŵammeleche che Metusela. Che Metusela ŵammeleche che Lameki, <verse eid="1CH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 1:4" />che Lameki ŵammeleche che Nuhu. Che Nuhu ŵakwete ŵanache ŵachilume ŵatatu, ŵanache wo ali che Shemu ni che Hamu ni che Yafeti.<verse eid="1CH 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 1:5" />Ŵanache ŵachilume ŵa che Yafeti ŵaliji che Gomeli ni che Magogu ni che Madai ni che Yavani ni che Tubali ni che Mesheki ni che Tilasi. <verse eid="1CH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 1:6" />Ŵanache ŵachilume ŵa che Gomeli ŵaliji che Ashikenazi, ni che Difati ni che Togama. <verse eid="1CH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 1:7" />Ŵanache ŵachilume ŵa che Yavani ŵaliji che Elisha ni che Talishishi ni che Kitimu ni che Lodanimu.<verse eid="1CH 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 1:8" />Ŵanache ŵachilume ŵa che Hamu ŵaliji che Kushi ni che Misili ni che Puti ni che Kanaani. <verse eid="1CH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 1:9" />Ŵanache ŵachilume ŵa che Kushi ŵaliji che Seba ni che Havila ni che Sabuta ni che Raama ni che Sabuteka. Ŵanache ŵa che Laama ŵaliji che Sheba ni che Dedani. <verse eid="1CH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 1:10" />Che Kushi ŵammeleche che Nimulodi, juŵatandite kukola ntima wangajogopa pachilambo liji mundu jwaandanda pachilambo. <verse eid="1CH 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 1:11" />Che Misili ŵaŵeleche Ŵaludi ni Ŵaanamu, Ŵalehabi ni Ŵanafutui, <verse eid="1CH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 1:12" />ni Ŵapatulusi, ni Ŵakafutoli ni Ŵakasilui. Ŵanyao ni uŵaliji ndandililo ja ŵafilisiti. <verse eid="1CH 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 1:13" />Ŵanache ŵachilume ŵa che Kanaani ŵaliji che Sidoni, jwakwitiwo jwakwe ni che Heti, <verse eid="1CH 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 1:14" />sooni che Kanaani ŵaliji ambuje jwa Ŵayebusi ni Ŵaamoli ni Ŵagiligashi, <verse eid="1CH 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 1:15" />ni Ŵahivi ni Ŵaaliki ni Ŵasini, <verse eid="1CH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 1:16" />ni Ŵaalivadi ni Ŵasemali ni Ŵaamati.<verse eid="1CH 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 1:17" />Ŵanache ŵachilume ŵa che Shemu ŵaliji che Elamu ni che Ashuli ni che Alifakisadi ni che Ludi ni che Alamu ni che Usi ni che Huli ni che Geteli ni che Mesheki. <verse eid="1CH 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 1:18" />Che Alifakisadi ŵammeleche che Shela, che Shela ŵammeleche che Ebeli. <verse eid="1CH 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 1:19" />Che Ebeli ŵakwete ŵanache ŵachilume ŵaŵili; jumo lina lyakwe ŵaliji che Pelegi, ligongo katema ka kupagwa kwakwe chilambo chagaŵanyiche, ni mpwakwe jwaŵilanjikwe che Yokitani. <verse eid="1CH 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 1:20" />Ŵanache ŵachilume ŵa che Yokitani ŵaaliji che Alimodadi, ni che Shelefu ni che Hasalimaweti ni che Yela, <verse eid="1CH 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 1:21" />ni che Hadolamu ni che Uzali ni che Dikila, <verse eid="1CH 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 1:22" />ni che Obali ni che Abimaeli ni che Sheba, <verse eid="1CH 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 1:23" />ni che Ofili ni che Havila ni che Yobabu.<verse eid="1CH 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 1:24" />Ntundu wa che Ibulahimu kutyochela kwa che Shemu waliji yeleyi, che Shemu ŵammeleche che Alifakisadi ni che Alifakisadi ŵammeleche che Shela. <verse eid="1CH 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 1:25" />Che Shela ŵammeleche che Ebeli, ni che Ebeli ŵammeleche che Pelegi, ni che Pelegi ŵammeleche che Leu; <verse eid="1CH 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 1:26" />ni che Leu ŵammeleche che Selugi, ni che Selugi ŵammeleche che Naoli, ni che Naoli ŵammeleche che Tela, <verse eid="1CH 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 1:27" />ni che Tela ŵammeleche che Abulamu, jujojo kanyuma jwaŵilanjikwe Ibulahimu.<verse eid="1CH 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uŵelesi u che Ishumaeli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="GEN 25:12-16">Ndandililo 25:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 1:28" />Che Ibulahimu ŵaliji ni ŵanache ŵaŵili ŵachilume, ŵanache wo ali che Isaka ni che Ishumaeli. <verse eid="1CH 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 1:29" />Awu ni uŵelesi wao che Ishumaeli. Jwakwitiwo jwa Ishumaeli ŵaliji che Nebayoti, ŵane ŵaliji che Kedali ni che Adibeeli ni che Mibusamu, <verse eid="1CH 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 1:30" />ni che Mishima ni che Duma ni che Hadadi ni che Tema, <verse eid="1CH 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 1:31" />ni che Yetuli ni che Nafishi ni che Kedema. Ŵanyawo ni ŵanache ŵa che Ishumaeli.<verse eid="1CH 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 1:32" />Paŵawile che Sala che Ibulahimu ŵalombele jwankongwe jwine lina lakwe che Ketula. Che Ketula ŵaŵeleechele che Ibulahimu ŵanacheŵa sita, ŵanache wo ali che Simulani ni che Yokishani ni che Medani ni che Midiani ni che Isibaki ni che Shua. Ŵanache ŵa che Yokishani ŵaliji che Sheba ni che Dedani. <verse eid="1CH 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 1:33" />Ŵanache ŵachilume ŵa che Midiani ŵaliji che Efa ni che Efeli ni che Henoki ni che Abida ni che Helidaa. Ŵoseŵa ŵaliji uŵelesi u che Ketula.<verse eid="1CH 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uŵelesi u che Esau</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="GEN 36:1-19">Ndandililo 36:1-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 1:34" />Che Ibulahimu ŵammeleche che Isaka, ni che Isaka ŵakwete ŵanache ŵaŵili ŵachilume, ŵanache wo ali che Esau ni che Yakobo lina lyakwe lina ŵaŵilanjikwe Isilaeli. <verse eid="1CH 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 1:35" />Ŵanache ŵa che Esau ŵaliji che Elifazi ni che Leueli ni che Yeushi ni che Yalamu ni che Kola. <verse eid="1CH 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 1:36" />Ŵanache ŵa che Elifazi ŵaliji che Temani ni che Omali, ni che Sefo ni che Gatamu ni che Kenazi, ni kwa che Timuna juŵaliji jwamasengo jwakwe ŵammeleche che Amaleki. <verse eid="1CH 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 1:37" />Ŵanache ŵa che Leueli, ŵaliji che Naati ni che Zela ni che Shama ni che Miza.<verse eid="1CH 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chipago cha ŵandu ŵa ku Edomu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="GEN 36:20-30">Ndandililo 36:20-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 1:38" />Ŵanache ŵachilume ŵa che Seili ŵaliji che Lotani ni che Shobali ni che Sibeoni ni che Ana ni che Dishoni ni che Eseli ni che Dishani. <verse eid="1CH 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 1:39" />Ŵanache ŵa che Lotani ŵaliji ŵaŵili, ŵanache wo ali che Holi ni che Homamu. Che Lotani ŵakwete alumbugwe lina lyao lyaliji che Timuna. <verse eid="1CH 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 1:40" />Ŵanache ŵa che Shobali ŵaliji che Alivani ni che Manaati ni che Ebali ni che Shefi ni che Onamu. Ŵanache ŵachilume ŵa che Sibeoni ŵaliji che Aya ni che Anaha. <verse eid="1CH 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 1:41" />Mwanache ju che Anaha jwaliji che Dishoni; ni Ŵanache ŵa che Dishoni ŵaliji che Amulani ni che Eshibani ni che Isilani ni che Kelani. <verse eid="1CH 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 1:42" />Ŵanache ŵachilume ŵa che Eseli ŵaliji che Bilihani ni che Zaawani ni che Akani; ni ŵanache ŵa che Dishoni ŵaliji che Usi ni che Alani.<verse eid="1CH 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mamweye ŵa ku Edomu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="GEN 36:31-43">Ndandililo 36:31-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 1:43" />Ŵanyaŵa ni mamwenye uŵachitawele chilambo cha ku Edomu akanaŵe mundu jwalijose kwatawala Ŵaisilaeli: Che Bela mwanache ju che Beoli ŵatawele chilambo cha ku Edomu, ni lina lya musi uŵaatamaga waaliji Diniaba. <verse eid="1CH 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 1:44" />Mwenye che Bela paŵawile, che Yobabu mwanache ju che Zela kutyochela ku Bosila ŵatawele pamalo pao. <verse eid="1CH 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CH 1:45" />Pakumala kuwa mwenye che Yobabu, che Ushamu jwa chilambo cha Ŵaatemi ŵatawele pamalo pa che Yobabu. <verse eid="1CH 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CH 1:46" />Paŵawile mwenye che Hushamu, mwenye che Hadadi mwana jwa che Bedadi ŵatawele pamalo pao ni likome lyao lyaliji kumusi wa Avisi. Ŵeleŵa ni uŵaputile ni kwapunda ŵandu ŵa kumidiani ku chilambo cha ku Moabu. <verse eid="1CH 1:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CH 1:47" />Paŵawile mwenye che Hadadi, mwenye che Samula kutyochela ku Masileka ŵatawele pamalo pao. <verse eid="1CH 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CH 1:48" />Mwenye che Samula paŵawile, mwenye che Shauli ŵa kutyochela ku Lehoboti ŵatawele pamalo pao. <verse eid="1CH 1:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CH 1:49" />Paŵawile mwenye che Shauli, mwenye che Baali Hanani mwanagwao che Akiboli ŵatawele pamalo pao. <verse eid="1CH 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CH 1:50" />Paŵawile mwenye che Baali Hanani, mwenye che Hadadi kutyochela ku Pai ŵatawele pamalo pao, ni ŵankwao che Akiboli lina lyao lyaliji che Meetabeli, mwali jwa che Matiledi ni mwali jwa che Mezaabu.<verse eid="1CH 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CH 1:51" />Nombe mwenye che Hadadi ŵawile.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 1:51">Achakulu ŵa ngosyo sya Ŵaedomu ŵaliji che Timuna ni che Aliva ni che Yeteti, <verse eid="1CH 1:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CH 1:52" />ni che Oholibama ni che Ela ni che Pinoni, <verse eid="1CH 1:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CH 1:53" />ni che Kenazi ni che Temani ni che Mebusali, <verse eid="1CH 1:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CH 1:54" />ni che Magidieli ni che Ilamu. Ŵanyawo ni achakulu ŵa ngosyo sya Ŵaedomu.<verse eid="1CH 1:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CH 2" />
  <para style="s">Iŵelesi i che Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 2:1" />Che Isilaeli ŵaliji ni ŵanache kumi na mbili ŵa chilume, ŵanache wo ali che Lobeni ni che Simeoni ni che Lawi ni che Yuda ni che Isakali ni che Zebuloni, <verse eid="1CH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 2:2" />ni che Dani ni che Yosefu ni che Benyamini ni che Nafutali ni che Gadi ni che Asheli.<verse eid="1CH 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 2:3" />Ŵanache ŵachilume ŵa che Yuda uŵaŵelechele ku che Besishua, ŵankwawo ŵa lukosyo lwa Kanaani, ŵaliji che Eli ni che Onani ni che Shela. Che Eli, jwakwitiwo ju che Yuda, ŵaleŵa ŵaliji jwachigongomalo paujo pa Akunnungu, nipele Ambuje Akunnungu ŵammuleje. <verse eid="1CH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 2:4" />Che Tamali, akwegwao che Yuda, ŵaŵelechele che Yuda ŵanache ŵaŵili maŵila, che Pelesi ni che Sela. Kwayele ŵanache wose ŵa che Yuda ŵaliji nsano.<verse eid="1CH 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 2:5" />Ŵanache ŵachilume ŵa che Pelesi ŵaliji ŵaŵili, che Esiloni ni che Amuli. <verse eid="1CH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 2:6" />Che Sela mpwakwe ŵakwete ŵanache nsano, ŵanache wo ali che Simuli ni che Esani, ni che Emani ni che Kalikoli ni che Dala. <verse eid="1CH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 2:7" />Mwanache ju che Kalimi, ŵaliji che Akani, Jweleju jwaichisye malagasyo kwa Ŵaisilaeli ligongo nganagachimbichisya makanyo gakuti ngasyajigala indu yaityosekwe kwa Ambuje Akunnungu.<verse eid="1CH 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 2:8" />Che Esani ŵakwete mwanache jwachilume, lina lakwe Asalia.<verse eid="1CH 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uŵelesi wa mwenye che Daudi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 2:9" />Ŵanache ŵachilume ŵa che Esiloni ŵaliji che Yelameeli, ni che Lamu ni che Kalebu.<verse eid="1CH 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 2:10" />Che Lamu ŵammeleche che Aminadabu, che Aminadabu ŵammeleche che Nashoni, juŵaliji chilongola jwa lukosyo lwa Yuda. <verse eid="1CH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 2:11" />Che Nashoni ŵammeleche che Salumoni, che Salumoni ŵammeleche che Boasi, <verse eid="1CH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 2:12" />Che Boasi ŵammeleche che Obedi, che Obedi ŵammeleche che Yese.<verse eid="1CH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 2:13" />Che Yese ŵaŵeleche ŵanache achalume saba. Ŵanache wo ali che Eliabu jwakwitiwo jwakwe, ni che Abinadabu ni che Shimea, <verse eid="1CH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 2:14" />ni che Netaneli ni che Ladai, <verse eid="1CH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 2:15" />ni che Osemu ni che Daudi. <verse eid="1CH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 2:16" />Sooni ŵakwete achiŵali ŵaŵili, achiŵali wo ali che Seluya ni che Abigaili.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 2:16">Ŵanache ŵachilume ŵa che seluya ŵaliji ŵatatu, che Abishani ni che Yoabu ni che Asaeli. <verse eid="1CH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 2:17" />Che Abigaili ŵammeleche che Amasa ni atati ŵa che Amasa ŵaliji che Yeseli, jwa uŵelesi wa che Ishumaili.<verse eid="1CH 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uŵelesi wa che Esiloni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 2:18" />Che Kalebu mwanache ju che Esiloni, ŵalombele achakongwe ŵaŵili. Jwankongwe jumo liina lyakwe che Asuba, ŵammelechele ŵanache ŵatatu, ŵanace wo ali che Yesheli, ni che Shobabu ni che Alidoni. <verse eid="1CH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 2:19" />Paŵawile che Asuba, che Kalebu ŵaalombile che Efulata juŵammelechele mwanache jwannume juŵaŵilanjikwe che Huli. <verse eid="1CH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 2:20" />Che Huli ŵammeleche che Uli, che Uli ŵammeleche che Besaleli.<verse eid="1CH 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 2:21" />Che Hesiloni paŵaliji ni yaka sitini, ŵanlombile mwali ju che Makili, nnumbu gwao che Gileadi. Ni ŵaŵeleche mwanache jwannume lina lyakwe che Segubu. <verse eid="1CH 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 2:22" />Che Segubu ŵammeleche che Yaili juŵatawele misi jekulungwa ishilini na tatu ku chilambo cha ku Gileadi. <verse eid="1CH 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 2:23" />Nambo mwenye sya ku Geshuli ni ku Alamu syaagunguchile ni kwasumula misi ja ku Haloti Yaili, ni ku Kenati ni misinda jakwe, misi jose jaliji sitini. Wose ŵaŵatamaga mu misi jo ŵaliji uŵelesi u che Makili, atatigwe che Gileadi. <verse eid="1CH 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 2:24" />Che Hesiloni Paŵawile, che Kalebu ŵajinjile majumba ku che Efulata juŵaliji ŵankwakwe che Hesiloni, atati ŵao. Che Efulata ŵaaŵelechele che Kalebu mwanache lina lyakwe che Ashuli, ni juŵautandisye musi wa Tekoa.<verse eid="1CH 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŵanache ŵa che Yelameeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 2:25" />Che Yelameeli jwakwitiwo jwa che Heziloni, ŵakwete ŵanache nsano ŵachilume, ŵanache wo ali che Lamu, jwakwitiwo jwakwe, ni che Buna ni che Oleni ni che Osemu ni che Aiya. <verse eid="1CH 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 2:26" />Che Yelameeli ŵaliji ni liŵasa lina lyao che Atala. Ŵeleŵa ŵammelechele che Yelameeli mwanache jwannume lina lyakwe che Onamu. <verse eid="1CH 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 2:27" />Ŵanache ŵachilume ŵa che Lamu, juŵaliji jwakwitiwo ju che Yelameeli, ŵaliji che Maasi ni che Yamini ni che Ekali. <verse eid="1CH 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 2:28" />Ŵanache ŵachilume ŵa che Onamu ŵaliji che Shamai ni che Yada. Nombe ŵanache ŵa che Shamai ŵaliji che Nadabu ni che Abishuli.<verse eid="1CH 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 2:29" />Che Abishuli ŵalombele, lina lya ŵankwawo lyaliji che Abihaili, nombejo ŵammelechele ŵanache ŵaŵili ŵachilume, ŵanache wo ali che Abani ni che Molidi. <verse eid="1CH 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 2:30" />Ŵanache ŵachilume ŵa che Nadabu ŵaliji che Seledi ni che Apaimu; Nambo che Seledi ŵawile pangakola mwanache. <verse eid="1CH 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 2:31" />Che Apaimu ŵaliji ni mwanache jumo lina lyakwe che Ishi. Che Ishi ŵammeleche che Sheshani, ni che Sheshani ŵammeleche che Alai.<verse eid="1CH 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 2:32" />Che Yada, apwao che Shamai, ŵakwete ŵanache ŵaŵili ŵachilume, ŵanache wo ali che Yeseli ni che Yonatani. Nambo che Yeseli ŵawile pangakola ŵanache. <verse eid="1CH 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 2:33" />Che Yonatani ŵakwete ŵanache ŵaŵili: Che Pelesi ni che Zaza. Welewo ni uwaliji uŵelesi u che Yelameeli.<verse eid="1CH 2:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 2:34" />Che Sheshani nganakola ŵanache ŵachilume; ŵakwete achiŵalipe. Namose yeleyo, ŵaliji ni kapolo jwanchanda jwa kutyochela ku Misili liina lyakwe che Yalia, <verse eid="1CH 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 2:35" />Kwayele, che Sheshani ŵampele che Yalia mwali jwakwe jumo aŵe ŵankwakwe, nombejo ŵammelechele mwanache jwachilume liina lyakwe che Atai. <verse eid="1CH 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 2:36" />Che Atai ŵammeleche che Natani, ni che Natani ŵammeleche che Zabadi. <verse eid="1CH 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 2:37" />Che Zabadi ŵammeleche che Efulali, che Efulali ŵammeleche che Obedi, <verse eid="1CH 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 2:38" />che Obedi ŵammeleche che Yehu, che Yehu ŵammeleche che Azalia, <verse eid="1CH 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 2:39" />che Azalia ŵammeleche che Helesi, che Helesi ŵammeleche che Eleasa, <verse eid="1CH 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 2:40" />che Eleasa ŵammeleche che Sisimai, ni che Sisimai ŵammeleche che Shalumu, <verse eid="1CH 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 2:41" />che Shalumu ŵammeleche che Yekamia, ni che Yekamia ŵammeleche che Elishama.<verse eid="1CH 2:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uŵelesi wine u che Kalebu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 2:42" />Jwakwitiwo jwa che Kalebu, mpwakwe che Yelameeli, ŵaŵilanjikwe che Mesha. Che Mesha ŵammeleche che Zifu, ni che Zifu ŵammeleche che Malesha ni che Malesha ŵammeleche che Hebuloni. <verse eid="1CH 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 2:43" />Che Hebuloni ŵakwete ŵanache ncheche, che Kola ni che Tapua ni che Lekemu ni che Shema. <verse eid="1CH 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 2:44" />Che Shema ŵammeleche che Lahamu ni che Lahamu ŵammeleche che Yokeamu, nombe che Lekemu nkulugwe che Shema ŵammeleche che Shamai. <verse eid="1CH 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CH 2:45" />Che Shamai ŵammeleche che Maoni, ni Maoni ŵammeleche che Beti Suli.<verse eid="1CH 2:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CH 2:46" />Che Kalebu ŵakwete jwamasengo jwakwe lina lyao che Efa. Che Efa ŵammelechele che Kalebu ŵanache ŵatatu ŵachilume, ŵanache wo ali che Halani, che Mosa ni che Gazezi. Che Halani ŵakwete mwanache, nombejo ŵammilasile che Gazezi.<verse eid="1CH 2:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CH 2:47" />Che Yadai ŵakwete ŵanache sita, che Legemu ni che Yotamu ni che Geshani ni che Peleti, ni che Efa ni che Shaafu.<verse eid="1CH 2:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CH 2:48" />Che Kalebu ŵakwete jwamasengo jwine lina lyakwe che Maaka. Che Maaka ŵammelechele che Kalebu ŵanache ŵaŵili: Che Shebeli ni che Tiliana. <verse eid="1CH 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CH 2:49" />Sooni che Maaka ŵammelechele che Kalebu ŵanache ŵane, Che Shaafu juŵautandisye musi wa ku Madimana, ni che Sheva juŵatandisye misi ja ku Makibena ni ku Gibea.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 2:49">Nombe che Kalebu ŵakwete mwali, liina lyakwe che Akisa.<verse eid="1CH 2:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CH 2:50" />Yelei ni iŵelesi i che Kalebu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 2:50">Ŵanache ŵa che Huli jwakwitiwo jwao ŵaŵaŵelechele ku che Efulata, ŵakwete ŵanache ŵatatu, Che Shobali, juŵautandisye musi wa ku Kiliasi Yealimu, <verse eid="1CH 2:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CH 2:51" />ni che Salima, juŵautandisye musi wa ku Beselehemu, ni che Helefu, juŵautandisye musi wa ku Beti Gadeli.<verse eid="1CH 2:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CH 2:52" />Iŵelesi i che Shobali, juŵautandisye musi wa Kiliati Yealimu yaliji, ku Haloe, ni nusu ja ŵandu ŵakutama kumusi wa ku Menuhoti, <verse eid="1CH 2:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CH 2:53" />pamo ni mitundu ja ku Kiliati Yealimu, yaani, Ŵaitili ni Ŵaputi, ni Ŵashumati ni Ŵamishilai. Kutyochela ni ŵandu ŵa japagwilwe mitundu ja Ŵasolati ni Ŵaeshitaoli ŵatyochele nkati ŵanduo.<verse eid="1CH 2:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CH 2:54" />Iŵelesi i che Salima, juŵatandisye musi wa ku Beselehemu yaliji, Ŵanetofati, ni Ŵaatiloti Beti Yoabu ni nusu ja Ŵamenahati yaani Ŵasoli.<verse eid="1CH 2:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CH 2:55" />Pamo ni aji mitundu ja ŵakulemba jijatamaga musi wa ku Yabesi, yaani, Ŵatilati ni Ŵashimeati ni Ŵasukati. Ŵanyao ni Ŵakeni uŵatyochele mu uŵelesi u che Amasi, ŵaŵautandisye musi wa ku Beti Lekabu.<verse eid="1CH 2:55" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CH 3" />
  <para style="s">Iŵelesi i che Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 3:1" />Ŵeleŵa ni ŵanache ŵa mwenye che Daudi ŵaŵapagwile katema kaŵaliji ku Ebuloni ko. Jwakwitio jwao ŵaliji che Amunoni, achikulugwe ŵaŵilanjikwe che Ahinoamu jwa ku Yezileeli, jwaaŵili jwakwe ŵaliji che Danieli, achikulugwe ŵaliji che Abigaili, jwa ku Kalimeli; <verse eid="1CH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 3:2" />jwaatatu ŵaliji che Abusalomu, achikulugwe ŵaliji che Maaka, mwali ju che Talimai, mwenye ŵa ku Geshuli; jwancheche ŵaliji che Adoniya, achikulugwe ŵaaliji che Hagiti. <verse eid="1CH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 3:3" />Mwanache jwansano ŵaliji che Shefatia, achikulugwe ŵaliji che Abitali, ni mwanache jwasita ŵaliji che Itileamu, achikulugwe ŵaliji che Egila.<verse eid="1CH 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 3:4" />Ŵanache wose sita ŵapagwilwe ku Ebuloni kuŵatawalaga che Daudi kwa yaka saba ni nusu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 3:4">Ku Yelusalemu ko ŵatawele yaka selasini na tatu. <verse eid="1CH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 3:5" />Ŵeleŵa ni ŵanache ŵa mwenye che Daudi ŵaŵapagwilwe paŵaliji ku Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 3:5">Che Betisheba, mwali ju che Amieli, ŵammelechele che Daudi ŵankwakwe ŵanache ncheche, che Shimea ni che Shobabu ni che Nasani ni che Selemani.<verse eid="1CH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 3:6" />Pamo ni ŵanyawo ŵakwete ŵanache ŵane tisa. Ŵanache wo ali che Ibuali ni che Elishua ni che Elifaleti, <verse eid="1CH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 3:7" />ni che Noga ni che Nefegi ni che Yafia, <verse eid="1CH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 3:8" />ni che Elishama ni che Eliada ni che Elifeleti. <verse eid="1CH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 3:9" />Ŵanawose wo ŵaliji ŵanache ŵa che Daudi, pangaaŵalanjila aŵala ŵane ŵaŵapagwilwe ni ŵamasengo ŵakwe. Che Daudi ŵakwete nombe mwali juŵaŵilanjikwe che Tamali.<verse eid="1CH 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iŵelesi ya mwenye che Selemani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 3:10" />Welewu uli uŵelesi wa mwenye che Selemani. Mwenye che Selemani ŵaŵeleche che Leoboamu, ni che Leoboamu ŵammeleche che Abiya, ni Abiya ŵammeleche che Asa, ni che Asa ŵammeleche che Yehoshafati, <verse eid="1CH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 3:11" />ni che Yehoshafati ŵammeleeche che Yeolamu, ni che Yeolamu ŵammeleche che Ahazia, ni che Ahazia ŵammeleche che Yoashi, <verse eid="1CH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 3:12" />che Yoashi ŵammeleche che Amazia, ni che Amazia ŵammeleche che Uzia, ni che Uzi ŵammeleche che Yosamu, <verse eid="1CH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 3:13" />ni che Yosamu ŵammeleche che Ahazi, ni che Ahazi ŵammeleche che Ezekia, ni che Ezekia ŵammeleche che Manase, <verse eid="1CH 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 3:14" />ni che Manase ŵammeleche che Amoni, ni che Amoni ŵammeleche che Yosia. <verse eid="1CH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 3:15" />Che Yosia ŵakwete ŵanache ncheche ŵachilume. Ŵanache wo ali che Yohanani, jwakwitiwo jwakwe, ni che Yehoyakimu, ni che Sedekia ni che Shalumu. <verse eid="1CH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 3:16" />Che Yehoyakimu ŵakwete ŵanache ŵaŵili ŵachilume, ŵanache wo ali che Yekonia ni che Sedekia.<verse eid="1CH 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iŵelesi ya mwenye che Yehoyakini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 3:17" />Ŵanache ŵa mwenye che Yekonia juŵajigalikwe mateka ni Ŵabebuloni ŵaliji saba, ŵanache wo ali che Shealitieli, <verse eid="1CH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 3:18" />ni che Malikilamu ni che Pedaya ni che Shenazali ni che Yekamia ni che Hoshama ni che Nedabia. <verse eid="1CH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 3:19" />Ŵanache ŵa che Pedaya ŵaliji che Zelubabeli ni che Shimei. Che Zelubabeli ŵakwete ŵanache ŵachilume ŵaŵili, che Meshulamu ni che Anania, pamo ni mwali jumo, lina lyakwe che Shelomisi. <verse eid="1CH 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 3:20" />Che Zelubabeli ŵakwete sooni ŵanache ŵane nsano, ŵanache wo ali che Ashuba ni che Oheli ni che Belekia ni che Asadia ni che Yushabu Hesedi.<verse eid="1CH 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 3:21" />Ŵanache ŵachilume ŵa che Hanania ŵaliji che Pelatia ni che Yeshaya. Che Yeshaya ŵammeleche che Lefaya, ni che Lefaya ŵammeleche che Alinani, ni che Alinani ŵammeleche che Obadia, ni che Obadia ŵammeleche che Shekania. <verse eid="1CH 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 3:22" />Che Shekania ŵammeleche che Shemaya. Che Shemaya ŵakwete ŵanache nsano, che Atushi ni che Igali ni che Balia ni che Nealia ni che Shefati. <verse eid="1CH 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 3:23" />Che Nealia ŵakwete ŵanache ŵachilume ŵatatu, ŵanace wo ali che Elieonai ni che Izikia ni che Azilikamu. <verse eid="1CH 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 3:24" />Che Elieonai ŵakwete ŵanache ŵachilume saba, ŵanache wo ali che Hodavia ni che Eliashibu ni che Pelaya ni che Akubu ni che Yoanani ni che Delaya ni che Anani.<verse eid="1CH 3:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CH 4" />
  <para style="s">Iŵelesi i che Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 4:1" />Ŵanache ŵachilume ŵa che Yuda ŵaliji che Pelesi ni che Hesiloni ni che Kalimi ni che Uli ni che Shobali. <verse eid="1CH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 4:2" />Che Shobabu ŵammeleche che Leaya, ni che Leaya ŵammeleche che Yahasi, ni che Yahasi ŵaŵeleche che Aumai ni che Lahadi, jelejo ni mitundu ja Ŵasolasi.<verse eid="1CH 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 4:3" />Che Huli ŵaliji jwakwitiwo jwa che Efulata juŵaŵelechele kwa che Kalebu ŵankwakwe, ni iŵelesi yakwe ni iŵautandisye musi wa ku Beselehemu. Che Huli ŵakwete ŵanache ŵachilume ŵatatu, ŵanache wo ali che Etamu ni che Penueli ni che Ezeli. Che Etamu ŵakwete ŵanache ŵachilume ŵatatu, ŵanache wo ali che Yesileeli ni che Ishima ni che Idibashi, ni sooni ŵakwete mwali liina lyakwe che Haseleliponi. <verse eid="1CH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 4:4" />Che Penueli ni juŵautandisye musi wa ku Gedoli ni che Ezeli ni juŵautandisye musi wa ku Usha.<verse eid="1CH 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 4:5" />Che Ashulu, juŵautandisye musi wa ku Tekoa, ŵalombele maŵasa, che Ela ni che Naala. <verse eid="1CH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 4:6" />Che Naala ŵammelecheele che Ashulu ŵanache ŵachilume ncheche. Ŵanache wo ali che Ahuzamu ni che Efeli ni che Temeni ni che Haahashitali. <verse eid="1CH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 4:7" />Che Ela ŵammelechele che Ashulu ŵanache ŵachilume ŵatatu, ŵanache wo ali che Seleti ni che Ishali ni che Etinani.<verse eid="1CH 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 4:8" />Che Hakosi ŵaaŵeleche che Anubi ni che Sobeba, che Hakosi ni juŵaliji atati ŵa mitundu ja Ahaliheli, mwanache ju che Alumu.<verse eid="1CH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 4:9" />Jwapali mundu jumo liina lyakwe che Yabesi, mundu jwa kuchimbichikwa nnope kwapunda achapwakwe wose. Achikulugwe ŵampele lina che Yabesi ligongo ŵammeleeche kwa kulagasika. <verse eid="1CH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 4:10" />Pa lyuŵa limo, che Yabesi ŵaapopelele Akunnungu ŵa ku Isilaeli achitiji, “Alakwe Akunnungu, chonde mumbe upile ni kujikusya mipika ja malo jangu. Mme ni uneji, nkakunda kuti yangalumbana ikambata ni ŵammagongo akaamulasya. Iŵaga tintende yeleyo ngasupuka kwakulikose.” Nombe Akunnungu ŵampele yele iŵaŵendile yo.<verse eid="1CH 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iŵelesi ine</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 4:11" />Che Kelubu, mpwakwe che Shuha, ŵammeleche che Mehili, nombe che Mehili ŵammeleche che Eshitoni. <verse eid="1CH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 4:12" />Nombe che Eshitoni ŵakwete ŵanache ŵachilume ŵatatu, ŵanache wo ali che Beti Lafa ni che Pasea ni che Tehina. Che Tehina ni juŵautandisye musi wa ku Ili Nahashi. Uŵelesi wa ŵandu ŵaŵatamaga ku Leka.<verse eid="1CH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 4:13" />Ŵanache ŵachilume che Kenazi ŵaliji che Otinieli ni che Selaya, ni ŵanache ŵa che Otinieli ŵaliji che Hatati ni che Meonotai. <verse eid="1CH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 4:14" />Che Meonotai ŵammeleche che Ofula.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 4:14">Che Selaya ŵammeleche che Yoabu, juŵandandisye Lichemba lya Ŵakulinganya, lyaŵilanjikwe yeleyo ligongo ŵandu ŵaŵatamaga mwelemo ŵaliji ŵandu ŵakulinganya indu uchenene.<verse eid="1CH 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 4:15" />Che Kalebu mwanagwao che Yefune ŵakwete ŵanache ŵachilume ŵatatu, ŵanache wo ali che Ilu ni che Ela, ni che Naamu. Mwanache jwa che Ela jwaliji che Kenazi.<verse eid="1CH 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 4:16" />Ŵanache ŵa che Yaalaleli ŵaliji che Zifu ni che Zifa, ni che Tilia ni che Asaleli.<verse eid="1CH 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 4:17" />Che Ezila ŵakwete ŵanache ŵachilume ncheche, ŵanache wo ali che Yeteli, ni che Meledi, ni che Efeli ni che Yaloni. Che Meledi ŵalombele che Bitia, mwali jwa mwenye jwa ku Misili ni ŵakwete mwali liina lyakwe che Miliamu, ni ŵanache ŵachilume ŵaŵili, ŵanache wo ali che Shamai ni che Ishiba. Che Ishiba ni juŵautandisye musi wa ku Eshitemoa. <verse eid="1CH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 4:18" />Che Meledi nombe ŵalombele jwankongwe Myahudi, ni ŵakete ŵanache ŵachilume ŵatatu, ŵanache wo ali che Yaledi, juŵautandisye musi wa ku Gedoli, ni che Ebeli juŵautandisye musi wa ku Soko, ni che Yekusieli juŵautandisye musi wa ku Zanoa.<verse eid="1CH 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 4:19" />Che Hodia ŵaalombile alumbugwe che Nahamu. Iŵelesi yao ni iyaliji ndande ja ntundu wa Galimi uwatamaga musi wa ku Keila, ni ntundu wa Maakasi uwatamaga musi wa ku Eshitemoa.<verse eid="1CH 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 4:20" />Ŵanache ŵachilume ŵa che Shimoni ŵaliji che Amnoni ni che Lina ni che Benianani ni che Tiloni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 4:20">Che Ishi ŵakwete ŵanache ŵaŵili, che Zoeti ni che Beni Zoeti.<verse eid="1CH 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uwelesi u che Shela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 4:21" />Ŵanache ŵa che Shela, mwana ju che Yuda ŵaliji che Eli, juŵautandisye musi wa ku Leka, ni che Laada juŵautandisye musi wa ku Malesha, ntundu wa ŵandu ŵakutota iwalo yeswela mbee, uŵatamaga ku musi wa ku Beti Ashibea, <verse eid="1CH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 4:22" />ni che Yokimu ni ŵandu uŵatamaga mmusi wa ku Kozeba; ni che Yoashi ni che Salafi ŵaŵalombele achakongwe ŵa ku Moabu ni kuuja tama ku Beselehemu. Utenga u uli wakalakala nnope. <verse eid="1CH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 4:23" />Ŵanyaŵa ni ŵandu ŵakugumba malongo ŵaŵatamaga misi ja ku Netaimu ni ku Gedela. Ŵatemi kweleko alinkwatumichila mwenye.<verse eid="1CH 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uŵelesi u che Simeoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 4:24" />Che Simeoni ŵakwete ŵanache nsano ŵa chilume, che Nemueli ni che Yamini ni che Yalibu ni che Zela ni che Shauli. <verse eid="1CH 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 4:25" />Mwanache ju che Shauli ŵaliji che Shalumu, che Shalumu ŵammeleche che Mibisamu ni che Mibisamu ŵammeleche che Mishima. <verse eid="1CH 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 4:26" />Che Mishima ŵammeleche che Amueli, ni che Amueli ŵammeleche che Zakuli, ni che Zakuli ŵammeleche che Shimei. <verse eid="1CH 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 4:27" />Che Shimei ŵakwete ŵanache ŵachilume kumi na sita na achiŵali sita, nambo achapwakwe nganakola ŵanache achajinji, kwayele uŵelesi wa che Simeoni nganiuŵa ni ŵanache achajinji mpela iyaliji mu uŵelesi wa che Yuda.<verse eid="1CH 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 4:28" />Misi jiŵatamaga jaliji ku Beli Sheba ni ku Molada ni ku Hasali Shuali, <verse eid="1CH 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 4:29" />ni ku Bilia ni ku Ezemu ni ku Toladi; <verse eid="1CH 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 4:30" />ni ku Betueli ni ku Holima ni ku Sikilagi, <verse eid="1CH 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 4:31" />ni ku Beti Malikaboti, ni ku Hazali Susimu ni ku Betibili ni ku Shaalaimu. Jeleji ni misi jiŵatemi mpaka katema kaŵatandite kutawala mwenye che Daudi. <verse eid="1CH 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 4:32" />Sooni, ŵaatemi ku misinda jine nsano, misinda jo jili ku Etamu ni ku Aini ni ku Limoni ni ku Tokeni ni ku Ashani, <verse eid="1CH 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 4:33" />Pamo ni misinda jijasyungwile misi jo mpaka ku Baalati. Mwelemo ni muŵatamaga nombe mwelemo ŵaŵisile chikumbuchisyo cha ntundu wao.<verse eid="1CH 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 4:34" />Ŵandu ŵa ni uŵaliji achakulu ŵa mitundu jao: Che Meshobabu ni che Yamuleki ni che Yosha mwanache ju che Amazia, <verse eid="1CH 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 4:35" />ni che Yoeli ni che Yehu mwanache ju che Yoshibia, juŵaliji mwanache ju che Selaya, mwanagwao che Asieli, <verse eid="1CH 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 4:36" />ni che Eliehonai ni che Yaakoba ni che Yeshohaya ni che Asaya ni che Adieli ni che Yesimieli ni che Benaya, <verse eid="1CH 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 4:37" />ni che Ziza mwanache ju che Shifi, juŵaliji mwanache ju che Aloni, mwanache ju che Yedaya, mwanache jwa che Shimili mwanagwawo che Shemaya. <verse eid="1CH 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 4:38" />Ŵandu ŵagalembekwe meena gao ni uŵaliji ilongola ŵa mitundu jao, ni ulongo wao wapundile konjechesyeka ni kuŵa achajinji nnope. <verse eid="1CH 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 4:39" />Ŵajenele mpaka ku Gedoli chakungopochelo lyuŵa kwa lichemba, achisosaga mwakulisisya ilango yao. <verse eid="1CH 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 4:40" />Kweleko, ŵapatile malo gambone pakulisisya ilango papagumbele manyasi gamajinji, ni malo jaliji jekulungwa jangali ŵandu, papatulele ni papali ni chitendewele. Kuundanda ko Ŵahamu ŵatamaga mwelemo.<verse eid="1CH 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 4:41" />Katema che Ezekia paŵaliji mwenye jwa ku Yuda ŵandu ŵaŵalembekwe meena gao ŵaiche kuchilambo cha ku Gedoli. Ŵaauleje Ŵahamu ni Ŵameuni ŵaŵatamaga mwelemo, ni kugajonanga masakasa gawo ni kwaŵinga mpaka lelo jino. Nipele ŵatami pelepo pamalo pao, pakuŵa malo go gagumbele manyasi kwaligongo lya ilango yao. <verse eid="1CH 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 4:42" />Ŵandu miatano ŵa lukosyo lwa che Simeoni, achilongoswaga ni che Pelatia ni che Nealia ni che Lefaya ni che Uzieli ŵanache ŵa che Ishi, ŵagungumuchile chilambo cha matumbi ga ku Seili. <verse eid="1CH 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 4:43" />Pelepo ŵaauleje Ŵaamaleki uŵasigele uŵatisile ku ngondo ŵala, ni ŵatemi kweleko pamalo pao mpaka lelo jino.<verse eid="1CH 4:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CH 5" />
  <para style="s">Uŵelesi u che Lobeni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 5:1" />Ŵanache ŵa che Lobeni, jwakwitio jwa che Isilaeli. Nachiŵamuno che Lobeni ŵaliji jwakwitiwo nambo chigolochelo chakwe cha jwakwitiwo ŵapegwilwe che Yusufu mpwakwe ligongo che Lobeni ŵagonile ni chilanga cha atatigwe. Kwayele, nganalembekwa mu ntundu wao malinga ni kuŵa mwanache jwa kwitiwo. <verse eid="1CH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 5:2" />Atamuno ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Yuda ni ŵaŵaliji ni machili nnope kupunda achapwakwe wose, ni ilongola ŵatyochele mwa ŵeleo, nambo upile wa kuŵa mwanache jwakwitio waliji u che Yosefu. <verse eid="1CH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 5:3" />Ŵanache ŵachilume ŵa che Lobeni, jwakwitio ju che Isilaeli, ŵaliji che Hanoki ni che Palu, ni che Esiloni ni che Kalimi.<verse eid="1CH 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 5:4" />Uŵelesi wine wa che Lobeni waliji che Yoeli. Che Yoeli ŵammeleche che Shemaya ni che Shemaya ŵammeleche che Gogi ni che Gogi ŵammeleche che Shimei, <verse eid="1CH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 5:5" />ni che Shimei ŵammeleche che Mika ni che Mika ŵammeleche che Leaiya ni che Leaiya ŵammeleche che Baali, <verse eid="1CH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 5:6" />ni che Baali ŵammeleche che Beela. Che Beela ŵaliji chilongola jwa lukosyo lwa Lobeni. Nambo che Tigilasi Pileseli mwenye jwa ku Ashulu ŵankamwile ni kunjigala kunjausya ku usami ku Ashulu.<verse eid="1CH 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 5:7" />Achakulu ŵa mitundu ŵaŵalembekwe mu meena ga chikumbuchisyo cha lukosyo lwa che Lobeni ŵaliji che Yeieli ni che Zekalia, <verse eid="1CH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 5:8" />ni che Bela, mwanache jwa che Azazi mwanache ju che Shema, mwanagwawo che Yoeli. Ŵelewo ŵatemi ku musi wa ku Aloeli wauli chakumpoto kwa musi wa ku Nebo ni ku Baali Meoni. <verse eid="1CH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 5:9" />Ilango yao yaŵelekene kwannope ni kuŵa yejinji, kwayele ŵanyao ŵajenele chakungopochelo lyuŵa mpaka mungulugulu mwa chipululu, chakumpoto kwa lusulo lwa Eufulate.<verse eid="1CH 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 5:10" />Katema mwenye che Sauli paŵaliji nkutawala, lukosyo lwa che Lobeni ŵaputene ngondo ni uŵelesi ŵa Hajili, ŵauleje kungondo ni kwasumula malo jao jose chakungopochelo lyuŵa kwa chilambo cha ku Gileadi, ni ŵatemi mwelemo.<verse eid="1CH 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uwelesi u che Gadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 5:11" />Lukosyo lwa Gadi lwatemi chiŵandi ni lukokosyo lwa Lobeni chakumpoto ku chilambo cha ku Bashani, chachijenele chakungopochelo lyuŵa mpaka ku Saleka. <verse eid="1CH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 5:12" />Che Yoeli ni juŵaliji chilongola jwa ntundu waandanda, che Shafamu ŵaliji chilongola jwa ntuundu waaŵili. Che Yanai ni che Shefati ŵaliji ilongola ŵa mitundu jine kwele ku Bashaniko. <verse eid="1CH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 5:13" />Ni achalongo ŵao malinga ni mitundu jao ŵaliji saba: Che Mikaeli ni che Meshulamu ni che Sheba ni che Yolai ni che Yaakani ni che Zia ni che Ebeli. <verse eid="1CH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 5:14" />Woseŵa ŵaliji ŵanache ŵa che Abihaili, juŵaliji mwanache ju che Huli, mwanache ju che Yaloa, mwanache ju che Yeshishai, mwanache ju che Yado, mwanagwao che Buzi. <verse eid="1CH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 5:15" />Che Ahi, juŵaliji mwanache ju che Abdieli ni chisukulu chi che Guni, ŵaliji chilongola jwa mitundu ji. <verse eid="1CH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 5:16" />Ŵagadi ŵatamaga ku Gileadi, kwele ku Bashani ko pamo ni misinda jakwe jijasyungulile, sooni ku chilambo chose mwakulisisya inyama ku Shaloni kose, ŵajenele. <verse eid="1CH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 5:17" />Yele yose yalembekwe mu chikumbuchisyo cha ntundu, katema che Yotamu paŵatawele ku Yuda, ni che Yeloboamu pŵatawele ku Isilaeli.<verse eid="1CH 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŵakuputana ngondo ŵa ngosyo sya kungopochelo lyuŵa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 5:18" />Ŵandu ŵa ngosyo sya Lobeni, Gadi ni nusu ja lukosyo lwa Manase ŵa kungopochelo lyuŵa, ŵakwete ŵa ngondo ŵajiganyikwe yambone kuputana ngondo ŵaali ni chakulisiŵila pantima na mapanga, ni ŵakukuta maukunje, ŵaliji elufu alubaini na nne ni mia saba ni sitini. <verse eid="1CH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 5:19" />Ŵaputene ngondo ni ngosyo sya uŵelesi wa Hajili, Ŵayetuli, Ŵanafishi, Ŵanodabu. <verse eid="1CH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 5:20" />Ŵaakulupalile Akunnungu ni ŵaapopelele kuti ŵakamuchisye, nombe Akunnungu ŵaajitichisye ni ŵaaputile ngosyo sya uŵelesi wa Hajili ni achambusanga ŵao. <verse eid="1CH 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 5:21" />Ŵaasumwile inyama yaikuŵilanjikwa ngamia elufu hansini, ngondolo laki mbili ni elufu hansini, mbunda elufu mbili, ni ŵandu uŵakamwilwe mateka laki moja. <verse eid="1CH 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 5:22" />Ŵaauleje ŵammagongo achajinji nnope ligongo Akunnungu ŵaputene kwaligongo lyao. Ni ŵanyao ŵajendelechele kutama muchilambo mo, mpaka katema ka kwajausya ku usami.<verse eid="1CH 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŵandu nusu ja lukoso lwa Manase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 5:23" />Ŵandu nusu ja lukosyo lwa Manase ŵaliji achajinji nnope, ŵatemi kutandilila ku Bashani mpaka ku Baali Helimoni, yaani ku Senili ni ku chitumbi cha Helimoni. <verse eid="1CH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 5:24" />Ni ŵanyaŵa ni uŵaliji ilongola ŵa ngosyo syo: Che Efeli ni che Ishi ni che Elieli ni che Azilieli ni che Yelemia ni che Odavia ni che Yadieli. Wose ŵaliji ŵandu ŵangondo ŵajiganyikwe yambone kuputana ngondo, ni ŵandu ŵakumanyika kwannope ni sooni ŵaliji ilongola ŵa mitundu jao.<verse eid="1CH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngosyo sya kungopochelo lyuŵa gakukamulwa kungondo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 5:25" />Nambo ŵandu nganiŵajitichisya Akunnungu juŵapopelelwagwa ni achambuje ŵao. Ŵatandite kujipopelela minungu jine ja ŵandu ŵa ilambo, yati Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaijonasile paujo pao. <verse eid="1CH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 5:26" />Nipele, Ambuje Akunnungu ŵa ku Isilaeli ŵantesile che Pulu, mwenye jwa ku Ashulu, mwenye ju liina lyakwe liine ŵaŵilanjikwe che Tigilasi Pileseli, achigungumuchile chilambo chao ni kwajigala mateka Ŵalobeni ni Ŵagadi ni nusu ja ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Manase, kwajausya ku usami. Ŵaajawisye kwele ku Alaa kula ni ku Aboli ni ku Hala, mungulugulu lusulo lwa Gozani, kuŵatemi mpaka lelo jino.<verse eid="1CH 5:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CH 6" />
  <para style="s">Iŵelesi ya che Lawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 6:1" />Che Lawi ŵakwete ŵanache ŵachilume ŵatatu, ŵananche wo ali che Gelishomu ni che Koasi ni che Melali.<verse eid="1CH 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 6:2" />Che Koasi ŵakwete ŵanache ŵachilume ncheche, che Amulamu ni che Ishali ni che Ebuloni ni che Uzieli.<verse eid="1CH 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 6:3" />Che Amulamu ŵakwete ŵanache ŵachilume ŵaŵili, che Aloni ni che Musa, ni mwali jumo lina lyake che Miliamu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 6:3">Che Aloni ŵakwete ŵanache ŵachilume ncheche, che Nadabu ni che Abihu ni che Eleazali ni che Itamali.<verse eid="1CH 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 6:4" />Che Eleazali ŵammeleche che Finehasi ni che Finehasi ŵammeleche che Abishua, <verse eid="1CH 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 6:5" />ni che Abishua ŵammeleche che Buki ni che Buki ŵammeleche che Usi, <verse eid="1CH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 6:6" />ni che Usi ŵammeleche che Zelahia ni che Zelahia ŵammeleche che Melayoti, <verse eid="1CH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 6:7" />che Melayoti ŵammeleche che Amalia ni che Amalia ŵammeleche che Ahitubu, <verse eid="1CH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 6:8" />che Ahitubu ŵammeleche che Sadoki ni che Sadoki ŵammeleche che Ahimaasi, <verse eid="1CH 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 6:9" />che Ahimaasi ŵammeleche che Azalia ni che Azalia ŵammeleche che Yohanani, <verse eid="1CH 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 6:10" />ni che Yohanani ŵammeleche che Asalia. Che Asalia ni juŵapanganyisye masengo ga chimbopesi mu Nyuumba ja Akunnungu jiŵajitaŵile mwenye che Selemani ku Yelusalemu ko. <verse eid="1CH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 6:11" />Che Asalia ŵammeleche che Amalia ni che Amalia ŵammeleche che Ahitubu, <verse eid="1CH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 6:12" />ni che Ahitubu ŵammeleche che Sadoki, che Sadoki ŵammeleche che Meshulamu, <verse eid="1CH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 6:13" />che Meshulamu ŵammeleche che Ilikia, che Ilikia ŵammeleche che Asalia, <verse eid="1CH 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 6:14" />che Asalia ŵammeleche che Selaya, ni che Selaya ŵammeleche che Yehosadaki, <verse eid="1CH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 6:15" />Che Yehosadaki ŵajigalikwe ku usami katema Ambuje Akunnungu paŵaajawisye ku usami kwa litala lya mwenye Nebukadinesa.<verse eid="1CH 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iŵelesi ine i che Lawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 6:16" />Che Lawi ŵakwete ŵanache ŵachilume ŵatatu, ŵanache wo ali che Gelishoni ni che Koasi ni che Melali. <verse eid="1CH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 6:17" />Kila jumo jwawo ŵakwete ŵanache ŵachilume. Che Gelishoni ŵaaŵeleche che Libuni ni che Shimei; <verse eid="1CH 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 6:18" />che Koasi ŵaaŵeleche che Amulamu ni che Ishali ni che Hebuloni ni che Usieli; <verse eid="1CH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 6:19" />Nombe che Melali ŵaaŵeleche che Mahili ni che Mushi. Aga ni mena ga mitundu ja Ŵalawi gagalambekwe malinga ni achatati ŵao.<verse eid="1CH 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 6:20" />Auno ni uŵelesi wa che Gelishoni juŵammeleche che Libini, che Libini ŵammeleche che Yahati, ni che Yahati ŵammeleche che Sima, <verse eid="1CH 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 6:21" />che Sima ŵammeleche che Yoha, che Yoha ŵammeleche che Ido, che Ido ŵammeleche che Sela, ni che Sela ŵammeleche che Yeatelai.<verse eid="1CH 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 6:22" />Auno ni uŵelesi u che Kohati juŵammeleche che Aminadabu, che Aminadabu ŵammeleche che Kola, ni che Kola ŵammeleche che Asili, <verse eid="1CH 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 6:23" />che Asili ŵammeleche che Elikana, ni che Elikana ŵammeleche che Ebiasafu, ni che Ebiasafu ŵammeleche che Asili, <verse eid="1CH 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 6:24" />che Asili ŵammeleche che Tahati, ni che Tahati ŵammeleche che Ulieli, ni che Ulieli ŵammeleche che Usia, ni che Usia ŵammeleche che Shauli.<verse eid="1CH 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 6:25" />Che Elikana ŵakwete ŵanache ŵachilume ŵaŵili, ŵanawo ali che Amasai ni che Ahimoti. <verse eid="1CH 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 6:26" />Uŵelesi wa che Ahimoti waliji, che Elikana, ni che Elikana ŵammeleche che Sofai, che Sofai ŵammeleche che Nahati <verse eid="1CH 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 6:27" />che Nahati ŵammeleche che Eliabu, ni che Eliabu ŵammeleche che Yelohamu, ni che Yelohamu ŵammeleche che Elikana.<verse eid="1CH 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 6:28" />Che Samueli ŵakwete ŵanache ŵachilume ŵaŵili, ŵanache wo ali che Yoeli, jwakwitio jwakwe, ni che Abiya mpwake.<verse eid="1CH 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 6:29" />Auno ni uŵelesi wa che Melali juŵammeleche che Mali, che Mali ŵammeleche che Libini, che Libini ŵammeleche che Shimei, ni che Shimei ŵammeleche che Usa, <verse eid="1CH 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 6:30" />Che Usa ŵammeleche che Shimea, ni che Shimea ŵammeleche che Hagia, ni che Hagia ŵammeleche che Asaya.<verse eid="1CH 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŵandu ŵakwimba mu Nyuumba ja Ambuje Akunnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 6:31" />Ŵanduŵa ni uŵaŵichikwe ni mwenye che Daudi kuti aŵe ilongola ŵa ŵakwimba mu Nyuumba ja Ambuje Akunnungu, paŵamasile kuliŵika Lisanduku lya Lilangano nkati. <verse eid="1CH 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 6:32" />Ŵajimbaga paujo pa lisakasa lyakusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu mpaka mwenye che Selemani paŵataŵile Nyuumba ja Ambuje Akunnungu ku Yelusalemu ko. Ŵagatesile masengo gao mpela iŵatite kupanjilwa. <verse eid="1CH 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 6:33" />Ŵanyaŵa ni ŵandu uŵapanganyisye masengo pamo ŵanache ŵao.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 6:33">Kutyochela mu ntundu wa Ŵakohati, jwapali che Hemani, juŵaliji chilongola jwa mpingo waandanda wa ŵandu ŵakwimba, ŵaliji mwanache ju che Yoeli ni che Yoeli ŵaliji mwanache ju che Samweli, <verse eid="1CH 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 6:34" />ni che Samweli ŵaliji mwanache ju che Elikana, ni che Elikana ŵaliji mwanache ju che Yelohamu, ni che Yelohamu ŵaliji mwanache ju che Elieli, ni che Elieli ŵaliji mwanache ju che Toa, <verse eid="1CH 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 6:35" />ni che Toa ŵaliji mwanache ju che Zufu, ni che Zufu ŵaliji mwanache ju che Elikana, ni che Elikana ŵaliji mwanache ju che Mahati, ni che Mahati ŵaliji mwanache ju che Amasai, <verse eid="1CH 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 6:36" />ni che Amasai ŵaliji mwanache ju che Elikana, ni che Elikana ŵaliji mwanache ju che Yoeli, ni che Yoeli ŵaliji mwanache ju che Asalia, ni che Asalia ŵaliji mwanache ju che Sefania, <verse eid="1CH 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 6:37" />ni che Sefania ŵaliji mwanache ju che Tahati, ni che Tahati ŵaliji mwanache ju che Asili, ni che Asili ŵaliji mwanache ju che Ebiasafu, ni che Ebiasafu ŵaliji mwanache ju che Kola, <verse eid="1CH 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 6:38" />ni che Kola ŵaliji mwanache ju che Ishali, ni che Ishali ŵaliji mwanache ju che Kohati, ni che Kohati ŵaliji mwanache ju che Lawi, che Lawi ŵaliji mwanache ju che Yakobo.<verse eid="1CH 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 6:39" />Che Asafu ŵaliji nkamusi jwa che Helimani ni mpingo wakwe wajimi kunlyo kwa che Helimani. Che Asafu ŵa ŵaliji mwanache jwa che Belekea, ni che Belekia ŵaliji mwanache ju che Shimea, <verse eid="1CH 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 6:40" />ni che Shimea ŵaliji mwanache ju che Mikaeli, ni che Mikaeli ŵaliji mwanache ju che Baaseya, ni che Baaseya ŵaliji mwanache ju che Malikia, <verse eid="1CH 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 6:41" />ni che Malikia ŵaliji mwanache ju che Esini, ni che Esini ŵaliji mwanache ju che Sela, ni che Sela ŵaliji mwanache ju che Adaya, <verse eid="1CH 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 6:42" />ni che Adaya ŵaliji mwanache ju che Esani, ni che Esani ŵaliji mwanache ju che Zima, ni che Zima ŵaliji mwanache ju che Shimei, <verse eid="1CH 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 6:43" />ni che Shimei ŵaliji mwanache ju che Yaasi, ni che Yaasi ŵaliji mwanache ju che Gelishoni, ni che Gelishoni ŵaliji mwanache ju che Lawi.<verse eid="1CH 6:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 6:44" />Mpingo wa ŵandu ŵakwimba kutyochela mu ntundu wa Melali waakamuchisye che Helimani ni che Asafu. Wajimi kunchiji ku che Helimani. Chilongola jwa mpingo wo ŵaliji che Esani, mwanache ju che Kishi. Che Kishi ŵaliji mwanache ju che Abudi, ni che Abudi ŵaliji mwanache ju che Maluki, <verse eid="1CH 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CH 6:45" />che Maluki ŵaliji mwanache ju che Hashabia, ni che Hashabia ŵaliji mwanache ju che Amazia, ni Amazia ŵaliji mwanache ju che Hilikia, <verse eid="1CH 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CH 6:46" />ni che Hilikia ŵaliji mwanache ju che Amusi, ni che Amusi ŵaliji mwanache ju che Bani, ni che Bani ŵaliji mwanache ju che Shemeli, <verse eid="1CH 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CH 6:47" />ni che Shemeli ŵaliji mwanache ju che Maili, ni che Maili ŵaliji mwanache ju che Mushi, ni che Mushi ŵaliji mwanache ju che Melali, ni che Melali ŵaliji mwanache ju che Lawi.<verse eid="1CH 6:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CH 6:48" />Walawi ŵane ŵapegwilwe masengo gane gakupanganya pa lisakasa lyakusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu.<verse eid="1CH 6:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uŵelesi u che Aloni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CH 6:49" />Che Aloni ni uŵelesi ŵakwe ni uŵapelekaga mbombesi pachanya chilisa cha mbombesi sya kutinisya sooni ni pachanya chilisa cha kututumisisya ubani. Ŵapanganyisye masengo gose ga peuto papakukundikwa kwa kwapopelela Akunnungu, kuti ŵapanganyichisye ujilanyo Ŵaisilaeli yalumo ni malajisyo ga che Musa, jwakutumichila jwa Akunnungu. <verse eid="1CH 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CH 6:50" />Ŵanyaŵa ni uŵelesi wakwe che Aloni. Che Aloni ŵammeleche che Eleazali, che Eleazali ŵammeleche che Fineasi, ni che Fineasi ŵammeleche che Abishua, <verse eid="1CH 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CH 6:51" />che Abishua ŵammeleche che Buki ni che Buki ŵammeleche che Usi ni che Usi ŵammeleche che Selahia, <verse eid="1CH 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CH 6:52" />che Selahia ŵammeleche che Melaioti, ni che Melaioti ŵammeleche che Amalia, ni che Amalia ŵammeleche che Ahitubu, <verse eid="1CH 6:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CH 6:53" />che Ahitubu ŵammeleche che Sadoki, ni che Sadoki ŵammeleche che Ahimaasi.<verse eid="1CH 6:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malo jiŵatamaga Ŵalawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CH 6:54" />Gelega ni malo gaŵapegwilwe ŵanache ŵa che Haluni ŵa mu ntundu wa Ŵakohati, ligongo ŵele ŵanyawo ŵaliji ŵaandanda kupegwa malo gakutama. <verse eid="1CH 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CH 6:55" />Ŵanyawo ŵapegwilwe musi wa ku Hebuloni ku chilambo cha ku Yuda ni malo sisyasungwile ligongo lya kulisisya ilango yao. <verse eid="1CH 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CH 6:56" />Nambo migunda pamo ni misinda jijasyungwile musiwo ŵapegwilwe che Kalebu mwanagwao che Yefune. <verse eid="1CH 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CH 6:57" />Iŵelesi ya che Aloni ŵapegwilwe misi ja kuutuchila katema ka masausyo pamo ni malo gakulisisya ilango. Misi jo ni aji, ku Hebuloni, musi wa chitendewele, ku Libina, ni ku Yatili ni ku Eshitemoa, <verse eid="1CH 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CH 6:58" />ku Hileni, ni ku Debili, <verse eid="1CH 6:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="1CH 6:59" />ni ku Ashani ni ku Beti Shemashi. <verse eid="1CH 6:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="1CH 6:60" />Malo ja lukosyo lwa Benyamini ŵapegwilwe ŵandu ŵa musi wa ku Geba, ni ku Alemesi ni ku Anasosi pamo ni malo sya kulisisya inyama sya nkati misi jo. Misi jose jiŵapegwilwe ngosyo sya Ŵakoati jaliji kumi na tatu yalumo ni mitundu jao. <verse eid="1CH 6:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="1CH 6:61" />Uŵelesi wa Ŵakoasi uŵasigele ŵapegwilwe misi kumi kutyochela kwa ŵandu ŵane ŵa lukosyo lwa Manase.<verse eid="1CH 6:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="1CH 6:62" />Lukosyo lwa Gelishomu, yalumo ni yatite kuŵa ŵandu ŵa nlukosyo lo ŵapegwile misi kumi na tatu kutyochela nlukosyo lwa Isakali ni Asheli ni Nafutali kutyochela mmalo mwa lukosyo lwa Manase juŵatamaga ku Bashani. <verse eid="1CH 6:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="1CH 6:63" />Iyoyo peyo misi kumi na mbili kutyochela ku lukosyo lwa Lobeni, ni nkati ngosyo sya Gadi ni Sabuloni syapegwilwe lukosyo lwa Melali yalumo ni uŵalanjikwe wa achalongo ŵao. <verse eid="1CH 6:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="1CH 6:64" />Kwayele Ŵaisilaeli ŵapele Ŵalawi misi pamo ni malo jakulisisya ilango kuti atame mwelemo. <verse eid="1CH 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="1CH 6:65" />Kutyochela mu ngosyo sya Yuda, ni Simeoni ni Benyamini ŵapegwilwe jele misi jajisasikwe jo kwa kutenda gudugudu.<verse eid="1CH 6:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="1CH 6:66" />Achalongo ŵane ŵa ngosyo sya Koasi syapegwilwe misi pamo ni malo sya kulisisya ilango syakwe ku lukosyo lwa che Efulaimu. <verse eid="1CH 6:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="1CH 6:67" />Nipele ŵapegwilwe, ku chilambo cha matumbi ga Efulaimu ni ku Geseli, <verse eid="1CH 6:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="1CH 6:68" />ni ku Yokimeamu ni ku Betioloni, misi jambone pamo ni malo jakwe ja kulisisya ilango jajili ku Shekemu, <verse eid="1CH 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="1CH 6:69" />ni ku Aiyaloni ni ku Gati Limoni, pamo ni malo jakwe ja kulisisya ilango. <verse eid="1CH 6:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="1CH 6:70" />Nusu ja lukosyo lwa Manase ŵapegwilwe misi ja ku Aneli, ni ku Bileamu pamo ni malo jakulisisya ilango yao. Aji ni misi jiŵapegwilwe lukosyo lwa Ŵakoati.<verse eid="1CH 6:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="1CH 6:71" />Ntundu wa Ŵagelishomu ŵapegwilwe misi ji pamo ni malo syakulisisya ilango.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 6:71">Ŵandu ŵane mu lukosyo lwa che Manase ŵapegwilwe ku Golani ni ku Bashani ni ku Ashitalosi pamo ni malo sya kulisisya ilango yakwe.<verse eid="1CH 6:71" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="1CH 6:72" />Lukosyo lwa Isakali ŵapegwilwe misi ja ku Kadeshi ni ku Debelasi, <verse eid="1CH 6:72" /><verse number="73" style="v" sid="1CH 6:73" />ku Lamoti ni ku Anemu pamo ni malo jakulisisya ilango yao.<verse eid="1CH 6:73" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="1CH 6:74" />Lukosyo lwa Asheli ŵapegwilwe misi ja ku Mashali ni ku Abudoni, <verse eid="1CH 6:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="1CH 6:75" />ku Ukoki ni ku Leobu pamo ni malo jakulisisya ilango yao.<verse eid="1CH 6:75" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="1CH 6:76" />Ni kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Nafutali ŵapegwilwe musi wa ku Kadeshi wauli ku Galilaya pamo ni malo jakwe jakulisisya ilango, ni ku Amunoni ni ku Kiliataimu pamo ni malo jakwe jakulisisya ilango.<verse eid="1CH 6:76" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="1CH 6:77" />Ŵalawi ŵaŵasigele, ŵanache ŵa che Melali ŵapegwilwe aji misi ji pamo ni malo jakwe jakulisisya ilango.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 6:77">Lukosyo lwa Sabuluni ŵapegwilwe musi wa ku Limono ni ku Taboli pamo ni malo sya kulisisya ilango iyaliji ngulugulu misijo.<verse eid="1CH 6:77" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="1CH 6:78" />Kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Lobeni lwalukutama pesi lusulo lwa Yolodani lwaluli cha kungopochelo lyuŵa kwa musi wa ku Yeliko ŵapegwilwe musi wa ku Beseli wauli mu chiŵata mwa ku Yahisa pamo ni malo sya kulisisya ilango. <verse eid="1CH 6:78" /><verse number="79" style="v" sid="1CH 6:79" />Kedemosi ni Mefaali pamo ni malo sya kulisisya ilango.<verse eid="1CH 6:79" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="1CH 6:80" />Ni lukosyo lwa Gadi ŵapegwilwe musi wa ku Lamoti Gileadi pamo ni malo jakwe jakulisisya pamo ilango, ni ku Mahanaimu pamo ni malo jakwe jakulisisya ilango, <verse eid="1CH 6:80" /><verse number="81" style="v" sid="1CH 6:81" />ku Heshiboni pamo ni malo jakwe jakulisisya ilango ni ku Yaseli pamo ni malo jakwe jakulisisya ilango.<verse eid="1CH 6:81" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CH 7" />
  <para style="s">Iwelesi i che Isakali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 7:1" />Che Isakali ŵakwete ŵanache ŵachilume ncheche, ŵanache wo ali che Tala ni che Pua ni che Yashubu ni che Shimuloni.<verse eid="1CH 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 7:2" />Ŵanache ŵa che Tola ŵaliji, che Usi, ni che Lefaya, ni che Yelieli ni che Yamai, Ibisamu ni che Shemueli. Ŵanyawo ŵaliji achakulu ŵa mitundu ja che Tola ni ŵandu ŵangajogopa pa kuputana ngondo. Katema che Daudi paŵaliji mwenye, ŵalembekwe ŵandu elufu ishilini na mbili na mia sita.<verse eid="1CH 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 7:3" />Che Usi ŵakwete mwanache jumo liina lyakwe che Isilahia. Ni Isilahia ŵakwete ŵanache ŵachilume ncheche, che Mikaeli, ni che Obadia, ni che Yoeli ni che Ishia, ni ŵanache woseŵa ŵaliji achakulu ŵa mitundu jao. <verse eid="1CH 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 7:4" />Malinga ni mitundu jao, kwaliji ni achalume ŵaŵalembekwe elufu selasini na sita ŵakuŵajilwa kwaula ku ngondo, ligongo ŵalombele achakongwe ŵajinji ni sooni ŵakwete ŵanache achajinji.<verse eid="1CH 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 7:5" />Ni achalongo ŵao kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Isakali, ŵandu ŵajiganyikwe yambone kuputana ngondo, uŵalembekwe ŵaliji ŵandu elufu semanini na saba.<verse eid="1CH 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iŵelesi ya che Benjamini ni che Dani.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 7:6" />Che Benjamini ŵakwete ŵanache ŵachilume ŵatatu, ŵanache wo ali che Bela, che Bekeli ni che Yediaeli.<verse eid="1CH 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 7:7" />Che Bela ŵakwete ŵanache nsano, ŵanache wo ali che Esiboni, ni che Usi, ni che Usieli, ni che Yelemosi ni che Ili. Ŵanyaŵa wose nsano ŵaliji ilongola ŵa mitundu jao ni ŵakwete ukombole wakwaula ku ngondo. Uŵelesi wao waliji ni ŵandu elufu ishilini na mbili na selasini na nne.<verse eid="1CH 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 7:8" />Che Bekeli ŵakwete ŵanache tisa. Ŵanache wo ali che Semila ni che Yoashi, ni che Elieseli, ni che Eliehonai, ni che Omuli, ni che Yelemoti, ni che Abiya, ni che Anasosi ni che Alemeti, woseŵa ŵaliji uŵelesi u che Bekeli. <verse eid="1CH 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 7:9" />Ŵalembekwe kwa ntundu malinga ni iŵelele yao nti ilongola wa mitundu jao, ni ŵandu ŵaŵalembekwe ŵaliji ŵandu elufu ishilini na mbili na mia mbili, wose ŵaliji ŵajiganyikwe yambone kupata ngondo.<verse eid="1CH 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 7:10" />Che Yediaeli ŵakwete mwanache jumo, lina lyakwe che Biliani. Ni ŵanache ŵa che Bilihani ŵaliji, che Yeushi ni che Benyamini ni che Eudi ni che Kenaana ni che Zesani ni che Talishishi ni che Aishaali. <verse eid="1CH 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 7:11" />Wose ŵa ŵaliji ilongola ŵa mitundu jao ni ŵandu ŵangajogopa kuputana ngondo. Ŵandu ŵaŵaŵalembekwe ŵaali ni ukombole wakwaula ku ngondo ŵaliji ŵandu elufu kumi na saba na mia mbili. <verse eid="1CH 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 7:12" />Che Shupimu ni che Hupimu nombe ŵaliji ŵandu ŵa uŵelesi u che Ili. Che Hushimu ŵaliji jwa uŵelesi u che Aheli.<verse eid="1CH 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iŵelesi i che Nafutali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 7:13" />Che Nafutali ŵakwete ŵanache ŵachilume ncheche, ŵanache wo ali che Yaasieli ni che Guni, ni che Yeseli ni che Shalumu. Ŵanyao ŵaliji uŵelesi u che Biliha juŵaliji sulia jwa che Yakubu.<verse eid="1CH 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iŵelesi i che Manase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 7:14" />Ŵeleŵa ni ŵanache ŵa che Manase. Che Manase ŵakwete sulia jwao juŵatyochele ku Alamu, ni ŵaaŵelechele ŵanache ŵaŵili ŵachilume, ŵanache wo ali che Asilieli ni che Makili. Che Makili ŵaliji atati ŵa che Gileadi. <verse eid="1CH 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 7:15" />Che Makili ŵalombele maŵasa kutyochela ku mitundu ja Hupimu ni Shupimu. Jumo mwa achiŵankwakwe wo jwaŵilanjikwe che Maaka ni jwine ŵaŵilanjikwe che Selofeadi. Che Selofeadi nganakola mwanache jwachilume, ŵakwete ŵanache ŵachikongwepe.<verse eid="1CH 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 7:16" />Che Maaka ŵankwakwe che Makili, ŵammeleche mwanache lina lakwe che Peleshi. Mpwakwe che Peleshi ŵaŵilanjikwe che Sheleshi. Ŵanache ŵa che Peleshi ŵaliji che Ulamu ni che Lakemu. <verse eid="1CH 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 7:17" />Che Ulamu ŵammeleche che Bedani. Woseŵa ali uŵelesi u che Gileadi, mwanagwao che Makili, mwanache ju che Manase.<verse eid="1CH 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 7:18" />Che Hamoleketi, alumbugwe che Gileadi, ŵakwete ŵanache ŵatatu, ŵanache wo ali che Ishiodi, ni che Abieseli ni che Mala. <verse eid="1CH 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 7:19" />Ŵanache ŵa che Shemida ŵaliji che Ahiani, ni che Shekemu, ni che Liki ni che Aniamu.<verse eid="1CH 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iŵelesi i che Efulaimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 7:20" />Au ni uŵelesi u che Efulaimu, che Efulaimu ŵammeleche che Shutela ni che Shutela ŵammeleche che Beledi ni che Beledi ŵammeleche che Tahati ni che Tahati ŵammeleche che Eleada, ni che Eleada ŵammeleche che Tahati, <verse eid="1CH 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 7:21" />che Tahati ŵammeleche che Sabadi ni che Sabadi ŵammeleche che Shutela. Che Efulaimu ŵakwete ŵanache ŵane ŵaŵili, Che Eseli ni che Eleadi ŵaŵaulajikwe ni ŵandu ŵa musi wa ku Gati ligongo ŵajawile kweleko kukukwiŵa ilango yao. <verse eid="1CH 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 7:22" />Che Efulaimu atati ŵao ŵalisile kwa malumbo kwa moŵa gamajinji, ni ŵaiche achalongo ŵakwe kukuntulasya ntima. <verse eid="1CH 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 7:23" />Pelepo che Efulaimu ŵagonile sooni ni ŵankwawo, nombewo ŵakwete chitumbo ni ŵammeleche mwanache. Che Efulaimu ŵampele mwanache jo liina lyakwe che Belia, malumbo gakwe masauko, ligongo lya iwa iyaapatile.<verse eid="1CH 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 7:24" />Che Efulaimu ŵakwete mwali lina lyakwe che Sheela. Jweleju ni juŵajitaŵile misi ja ku Beti Holoni ja kulutando ni ja kwichela, ni ku Useni Sheela.<verse eid="1CH 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 7:25" />Che Efulaimu ŵammeleche che Lefa, ni che Lefa ŵammeleche che Leshefu, ni che Leshefu ŵammeleche che Tela, ni che Tela ŵammeleche che Taani, <verse eid="1CH 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 7:26" />che Taani ŵammeleche che Ladani, ni che Ladani ŵammeleche che Amihudi, ni che Amihudi ŵammeleche che Elishana, <verse eid="1CH 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 7:27" />che Elishana ŵammeleche che Nuni, ni che Nuni ŵammeleche che Yoshua mundu juŵalongwesye Ŵaisilaeli paŵawile che Yoshua.<verse eid="1CH 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 7:28" />Ilambo yao ni malo muŵatamaga yaliji, ku Beseli ni misinda jijasyungulile, ni ku Nalaani kukwaliji cha kungopochelo lyuŵa, ni ku Geseli kukwaliji cha kumaswelo lyuŵa pamo ni misinda jijasyungulile, ni ku Shekemu ni misinda jakwe ni ku Aya ni misinda jakwe.<verse eid="1CH 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 7:29" />Sooni misi jammipika ni chilambo cha Manase jaliji, musi wa ku Beti Shani ni misinda jakwe ni musi wa ku Taanaki ni misinda jakwe ni musi wa ku Megido ni misinda jakwe ni musi wa ku Doli ni misinda jakwe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 7:29">Jeleji ni misi jiŵatemi iŵelesi i che Yusufu, mwanache ju che Isilaeli.<verse eid="1CH 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iŵelesi i che Asheli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 7:30" />Yelei ni iŵelesi i che Asheli. Che Asheli ŵakwete ŵanache ŵachilume ncheche, ŵanache wo ali che Imuna ni che Ishiva ni che Ishivi ni che Belia ni mwali jumo lina lakwe che Sela.<verse eid="1CH 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 7:31" />Che Belia ŵakwete ŵanache ŵaŵili, che Ebeli ni che Malikieli, juŵaliji atati jwa che Bilisaiti.<verse eid="1CH 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 7:32" />Che Ebeli ŵakwete ŵanache ŵachilume ŵatatu, ŵanache wo ali che Yafuleti, ni che Shomeli ni che Hotamu, ni mwali jumo lina lyakwe che Shua.<verse eid="1CH 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 7:33" />Nombe che Yafuleti ŵakwete ŵanacheŵachilume ŵatatu, ŵanache wo ali che Pasaki ni che Bimuhali ni che Ashivati.<verse eid="1CH 7:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 7:34" />Ni che Shomeli ŵakwete ŵanache ŵachilume ŵatatu, ŵanache wo ali che Loga ni che Yehuba ni che Alamu.<verse eid="1CH 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 7:35" />Ni che Hotamu ŵakwete ŵanache ŵachilume ncheche, ŵanache wo ali che Sofa ni che Imuna ni che Sheleshi ni che Amali.<verse eid="1CH 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 7:36" />Ŵanache ŵachilume ŵa che Sofa ŵaliji che Sua ni che Halinefeli ni che Shuali ni che Beli ni che Imula, <verse eid="1CH 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 7:37" />ni che Beseli, ni che Hodu, ni che Shama, ni che Shilisha, ni che Itilani ni che Beela.<verse eid="1CH 7:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 7:38" />Ŵanache ŵachilume ŵa che Yeseli ŵaliji che Yefune, ni che Pisipa ni che Ala. <verse eid="1CH 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 7:39" />Ŵanache ŵachilume ŵa che Ula ŵaliji che Ala ni che Anieli ni che Lisia.<verse eid="1CH 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 7:40" />Wosewo ŵaliji iŵelesi ya che Asheli. Ŵelewo ŵaliji ilongola ŵa achalongo ŵao, ŵandu ŵakulungamika, ŵangondo ŵaŵalijiganyisye yambone kuputana ngondo ni ŵangajogopa ni ŵakumanyika chenene. Ŵandu wose ŵaŵalembekwe, ŵakusachilwa kuinjila mu mpingo wa ŵangondo, mu lukosyo lwao lwa Asheli ŵaliji ŵandu elufu ishilini na sita.<verse eid="1CH 7:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CH 8" />
  <para style="s">Iŵelesi i che Benjamini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 8:1" />Che Benjamini ŵakwete ŵanache ŵachilume nsano. Che Bela, jwakwitiwo jwakwe, ni che Ashibeli ni che Ahala, <verse eid="1CH 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 8:2" />ni che Noha ni che Lafa.<verse eid="1CH 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 8:3" />Ŵanache ŵachilume ŵa che Bela ŵaliji, che Adali ni che Gela ni che Abihudi, <verse eid="1CH 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 8:4" />ni che Abishua ni che Namaani ni che Ahoa, <verse eid="1CH 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 8:5" />ni che Gela ni che Shufani ni che Hulamu.<verse eid="1CH 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 8:6" />Yelei ni iŵelesi i che Ehudi, ŵanyaŵa ŵaliji ilongola ŵa aŵala achalongo uŵatamaga kwele ku Geba, nambo ŵajigalikwe mateka ni kwajausya ku Manahati, <verse eid="1CH 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 8:7" />che Naamani, ni che Ahiya ni che Gela. Che Gela ŵaaŵeleche che Usa ni che Ahihudi, ni jweleju ni juŵalongwesye kwaula ku usami.<verse eid="1CH 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 8:8" />Che Shahalaimu ŵaŵeleche ŵanache ŵaŵili ŵachilume chilambo cha ku Moabu, ni kukoko ku Moabu ko che Shahalaimu ŵapele talaka achiŵankwakwe ŵaŵili, che Ushimu ni che Baala, ni kaanyuma. <verse eid="1CH 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 8:9" />Ŵanlombile che Hodeshi, nombejo ŵammelechele ŵanache saba, ŵanache wo ali che Yoabu ni che Sibia, ni che Mesha, ni che Malikamu, <verse eid="1CH 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 8:10" />ni che Yeusi, ni che Sakia, ni che Milima. Ŵanache woseŵa ŵaliji ilongola ŵa mitundu jao.<verse eid="1CH 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 8:11" />Ŵakwete sooni ŵanache ŵaŵili ŵaŵaŵeleche ni che Hushimu, meena gawo galiji, che Abitubu ni che Elipaali.<verse eid="1CH 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 8:12" />Ŵanache ŵa che Elipaali ŵaliji ŵatatu, ŵanache wo ali che Ebeli, ni che Mishamu ni che Shemedi, juŵajitaŵile misi ja ku Ono ni ku Lodi, pamo ni misinda jijasyungwile.<verse eid="1CH 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŵabenyamini ŵaŵatemi ku Gati ni ku Aiyaloni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 8:13" />Che Belia ni che Shema, uŵaliji ilongola ŵa achalongo uŵatamaga ku musi wa ku Aiyaloni ni uŵatopwele ŵandu ŵa ku Gasi. <verse eid="1CH 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 8:14" />Ŵanache ŵachilume ŵa che Belia ŵaliji che Ahio, ni che Shashaki, ni che Yelimoti, <verse eid="1CH 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 8:15" />ni che Zebadia, ni che Aladi, ni che Edeli, <verse eid="1CH 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 8:16" />ni che Mikaeli, ni che Ishipa ni che Yoha.<verse eid="1CH 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŵabenjamini uŵatamaga ku Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 8:17" />Ŵanache ŵa che Elipali ŵaliji che Sebadia, ni che Meshulamu, ni che Isiki, ni che Hebeli, <verse eid="1CH 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 8:18" />ni che Ishinelai, ni che Isilia ni che Yobabu.<verse eid="1CH 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 8:19" />Ŵanache ŵa che Shimei ŵaliji che Yakimu ni che Sikili ni che Sabudi, <verse eid="1CH 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 8:20" />ni che Elienai, ni che Siletai, ni che Elieli, <verse eid="1CH 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 8:21" />ni che Adaya, ni che Belaya ni che Shimulati.<verse eid="1CH 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 8:22" />Ŵanache ŵa che Shashaki ŵaliji che Ishipani, ni che Ebeli, ni che Elieli, <verse eid="1CH 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 8:23" />ni che Abudoni, ni che Sikili, ni che Hanani, <verse eid="1CH 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 8:24" />ni che Hanania, ni che Elamu, ni che Anatotiya, <verse eid="1CH 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 8:25" />ni che Ifudeya ni che Penueli.<verse eid="1CH 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 8:26" />Ŵanache ŵa che Yelohanu ŵaliji che Shamshelai, ni che Shehalia, ni che Atalia, <verse eid="1CH 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 8:27" />ni che Yaaleshia, ni che Elia ni che Sikili.<verse eid="1CH 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 8:28" />Ŵanyawo ni uŵaliji ilongola ŵa mitundu jao malinga ni iŵelesi yao. Ŵanyawo ŵaliji achakulu ni ŵatemi ku Yelusalemu.<verse eid="1CH 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŵabenyamini ŵaŵatemi ku Gibeoni ni ku Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 8:29" />Che Yeieli, ni uŵautandisye musi wa ku Gibeoni. Ŵankwakwe ŵaŵilanjikwe che Maaka. <verse eid="1CH 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 8:30" />Jwakwitiwo jwakwe ŵaliji che Abudoni. Ŵanache ŵakwe ŵane ŵaliji che Zuli, ni che Kishi, ni che Baali, ni che Nadabu, <verse eid="1CH 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 8:31" />ni che Gedoli, ni che Ahio, ni che Zekeli, <verse eid="1CH 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 8:32" />ni che Mikiloti juŵaliji atati jwa che Shimea. Ŵanyaŵa nombe ŵatemi ku Yelusalemu chiŵandi ni ŵandu ŵane ŵa ntundu wao.<verse eid="1CH 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ntundu wa mwenye che Shauli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 8:33" />Che Neli ŵammeleche che Kishi, ni che Kishi ŵammeleche che Shauli. Che Shauli ŵakwete ŵanache ncheche ŵanache wo ali che Yonatani, ni che Maliki Shua, ni che Abinadabu ni che Eshibaali. <verse eid="1CH 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 8:34" />Che Yonatani ŵammeleche che Melibu Baali ni che Melibu Baali ŵammeleche che Mika.<verse eid="1CH 8:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 8:35" />Che Mika ŵakwete ŵanache ncheche, ŵanache wo ali che Pitoni, ni che Meleki, ni che Telea ni che Ahasi. <verse eid="1CH 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 8:36" />Che Ahasi ŵammeleche che Yehoada, nombe che Yehoada ŵaaŵeleche che Alemeti, ni che Asimaweti ni che Simili. Che Simili ŵammeleche che Mosa. <verse eid="1CH 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 8:37" />Che Mosa ŵammeleche che Binea, Che Binea ŵammeleche che Lafa, ni che Lafa ŵammeleche che Eleasa, nombe che Eleasa ŵammeleche che Aseli.<verse eid="1CH 8:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 8:38" />Ŵanache ŵa che Aseli ŵaliji sita, meena gao ni aga, che Asilikamu ni che Bokelu ni che Ishimaeli ni che Shealia ni che Obadia, ni che Hanani. Woseŵa ŵaliji ŵanache ŵao che Aseli. <verse eid="1CH 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 8:39" />Nombe ŵanache ŵa che Esheki, mpwakwe che Aseli ŵaliji ŵatatu. Ŵanache wo ali che Ulamu, jwakwitiwo jwakwe, ni che Yeushi ni che Elifeleti.<verse eid="1CH 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 8:40" />Ŵanache ŵa che Ulamu ŵaliji ŵandu ŵaali ni ukombole wa gakuputana ngondo, ni kukutisya mikunje yambone. Ŵakwete ŵanache ni isukulu yejinji ŵa kuichila mia moja na hansini. Wosepe wo ŵaliji uŵelesi wa Benyamini.<verse eid="1CH 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CH 9" />
  <para style="s">Ŵandu ŵaŵausile kutyochela ku usami ni kutama ku Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 9:1" />Kwayele, Ŵaisilaeli wose ŵalembekwe nlukosyo, ni ŵanduwo ŵalembekwe mu chitabu cha Mamwenye ŵa ku Isilaeli.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 9:1">Ŵandu ŵa ku Yuda ŵajigalikwe mateka mpaka ku Babuloni ligongo nganaŵa ŵandu ŵakukulupilichika. <verse eid="1CH 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 9:2" />Ŵandu ŵaandanda kuja ku misi jao jiŵatamaga, ŵaliji Ŵaisilaeli ni ŵambopesi ni Ŵalawi ni ŵakutumichila ŵa pa Nyuumba ja Akunnungu. <verse eid="1CH 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 9:3" />Ŵandu ŵane ŵa ngosyo sya Yuda, ni Benjamini ni Efulaimu ni Manase ŵajawile kutama musi wa ku Yelusalemu.<verse eid="1CH 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 9:4" />Kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Yuda, che Utai ŵaliji mwana ju che Amihudi ni che Amihudi ŵaliji mwana ju che Omuli ni che Omuli ŵaliji mwana ju che Imuli ni che Imuli ŵaliji mwana ju che Bani, jwa uŵelesi u che Pelesi, mwanache ju che Yuda. <verse eid="1CH 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 9:5" />Iŵelesi ya Ŵashiloni ŵaŵausile ali che Asaya jwakwitiwo jwakwe ni ŵanache ŵakwe. <verse eid="1CH 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 9:6" />Iŵelesi ya che Zela ŵaliji che Yeueli ni achapwakwe. Wosepe ŵaliji ŵandu mia sita na tisini.<verse eid="1CH 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 9:7" />Kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Benyamini jwapali che Salu mwanache jwa che Meshulamu. Che Meshuali ŵaliji mwanache ju che Odavia ni che Odavia ŵaliji mwanache ju che Hasenua, <verse eid="1CH 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 9:8" />ni che Hasenua ŵaliji mwanache ju che Ibuneya ni che Ibuneya ŵaliji mwanache ju che Yeloamu ni che Ela ŵaliji mwanche ju che Usi, ni che Usi ŵaliji mwanache ju che Mikili ni che Meshulamu ŵaliji mwanache ju che Shefatia ni che Shefatia ŵaliji mwanache ju che Leueli, ni che Leueli ŵaliji mwanache ju che Ibuniya.<verse eid="1CH 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 9:9" />Ŵandu kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Benjamini mpela yatite kulembekwa mu mitundu jao ŵaliji ŵandu mia tisa hansini na sita. Wosewo ŵaliji ilongola ŵa mitundu jao.<verse eid="1CH 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŵambopesi uŵatemi ku Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 9:10" />Ŵanyaŵa ni ŵambopesi uŵatemi ku Yelusalemu, che Yedaya ni che Yehoyalibu ni che Yakini, <verse eid="1CH 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 9:11" />ni che Asalia ŵaliji mwana jwa che Hilikia ni che Hilikia ŵaliji mwana jwa che Meshulamu ni che Meshulamu ŵaliji mwana jwa che Sadoki ni che Sadoki ŵaliji mwana jwa che Melayosi ni che Melayosi ŵaliji mwana ju che Aitubu, jwakwimilila Nyuumba ja Akunnungu, <verse eid="1CH 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 9:12" />ni che Adaya, mwana jwa che Yelohamu, ni che Yelohamu mwana jwa che Pashuli, ni che Pashuli mwana jwa che Malikiya; ni che Malikiya mwana jwa che Maasai, ni che Maasai mwana jwa che Adieli ni che Adieli mwana ju che Yasela, ni che Yasela mwana ju che Meshulamu ni che Meshulamu mwana ju che Meshilemiti ni che Meshilemiti mwana ju che Imeli.<verse eid="1CH 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 9:13" />Ŵambopesi uŵaliji ilongola ŵa mitundu jawo ŵaliji ŵandu elufu moja mia saba sitini. Ŵaliji ni ukombole ŵa kupanganya masengo ga umbopesi ga mu Nyumba ja Akunnungu.<verse eid="1CH 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŵalawi uŵatemi ku Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 9:14" />Ŵanyaŵa ni ŵalawi uŵatemi ku Yelusalemu, che Shemaya mwana ju che Ashubu ni Ashubu mwana ju che Asilikamu ni che Asilikamu mwana ju che Ashabia, ni che Ashabia jwa uŵelesi u che Melali, <verse eid="1CH 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 9:15" />ni che Bakibakali ni che Heleshi, ni che Galali, ni che Matania, ŵanache ŵa che Mika, ni che Mika mwana ju che Sikili, ni che Sikili mwanache ju che Asafu; <verse eid="1CH 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 9:16" />ni che Obadia, mwana jwa che Shemaya, ni che Shemaya mwana ju che Galali, ni che Galali mwana ju che Yedusuni; ni che Belekia, mwana ju che Asa, ni che Asa mwana ju che Elikana, juŵatamaga ku misinda ja Ŵanetofati.<verse eid="1CH 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŵakulindilila Nyuumba ja Akunnungu uŵatemi ku Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 9:17" />Ŵanyaŵa ni ŵakulindilila Nyuumba ja Akunnungu uŵatemi ku Yelusalemu, che Shalumu ni che Akubu ni che Talimoni ni che Ahimani ni Ŵalawi achinjawo. Che Shalumu ni ŵaliji jwankulu jwao. <verse eid="1CH 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 9:18" />Mpaka katema ko, ŵakulindilila kutyochela mmitundu jawo ni uŵalindililaga pannango wa mwenye wauli chakungopochelo lyuŵa. Kuundanda ko, ŵalindililaga nnango wakwinjilila mu igono ya Ŵalawi.<verse eid="1CH 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 9:19" />Che Shalumu ŵaliji mwana jwa che Kole ni che Kole ŵaliji mwana ju che Ebiasafu ni che Ebiasafu ŵaliji mwana ju che Kola, pamo ni ŵakulindilila achinjawo ŵa kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa che Kola.Ŵanyawo masengo gawo galiji kupalindilila pannango wakwinjilila pa Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu, mpela achachekulu iŵalindililaga Nyuumba ja Akunnungu. <verse eid="1CH 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 9:20" />Che Finehasi ŵaliji mwanache jwa che Eleasali, kalakala ŵaliji chilongola jwa ŵakulindilila, nombe Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaliji pamo nawo.<verse eid="1CH 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 9:21" />Che Zakalia mwana che Meshelemia, ŵaliji jwakulindilila pannango wakwinjilila pa Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana kwa ligongo lya Akunnungu.<verse eid="1CH 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 9:22" />Ŵandu wose ŵaŵasagulikwe kulindilila pannango wekulungwa ŵaliji mia mbili kumi na mbili. Ŵalembekwe malinga misinda jiŵatamaga. Mwenye che Daudi ni jwakulondola jwa Akunnungu che Samweli ŵaŵisile ŵandu wo mmasengo gamakulu ga kulindilila. <verse eid="1CH 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 9:23" />Nipele, ŵanduwo ni iŵelesi yao, ŵajendelechele kulindilila pannango wakwinjilila mu Nyuumba ja Ambuje Akunnungu pane jikuŵilanjikwa Lisakasa lya Kusimanilana kwa ligongo lya Akunnungu. <verse eid="1CH 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 9:24" />Ŵakulindilila wo waliji mu mbande syose ncheche, kungombochelo lyuŵa, kumaswelo lyuŵa, kumpoto ni chakulujenda. <verse eid="1CH 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 9:25" />Ni Ŵalawi achinjawo ŵaŵatamaga mmisinda ŵakamusyaga kulindilila ŵakulindilila mu samu syawo kwa mowa saba, <verse eid="1CH 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 9:26" />pakuŵa ŵakulindilila achakulu ncheche ŵala, uŵaliji Ŵalawi, ŵaasachilwe kwimilila yuumba ni mbiko syasili mu Nyuumba ja Akunnungu. <verse eid="1CH 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 9:27" />Ŵanyawo ŵatamaga mungulugulu Nyuumba ja Akunnungu pakuŵa masengo gawo galiji kulindilila ni kuugula minango ja Nyuumba kila kundaŵi.<verse eid="1CH 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŵalawi ŵane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 9:28" />Ŵalaŵi ŵane ŵajimilile yombo iŵatendelaga mbopesi. Yasachilwaga kuiŵalanga pakuityosya ni katema kakuusya. <verse eid="1CH 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 9:29" />Ŵane ŵasagulikwe aŵe ŵa kwimilila yombo ya pa Nyuumba ja Akunnungu, ni yombo yose yaikundikwe kwa mapopelo, ni utandi wambone ni divai ni mauta ga seituni ni ubani ni mauta gakununjila. <verse eid="1CH 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 9:30" />Nambo ŵambopesi ŵane ŵatesile masengo ga kuwanganya yakununjila.<verse eid="1CH 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 9:31" />Che Metitia, ali jumo mwa Ŵalaŵi juŵaliji mwanache jwakwitio jwa che Shalumu, jwa lukosyo lwa Kola, ŵajimilile masengo ga kuteleka mikate ja mbombesi. <verse eid="1CH 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 9:32" />Achalongo ŵao ŵane ŵa lukosyo lwa Koasi ŵaliji ni masengo gane gakukolosya mikate jajikukundikwa kwa kwapopelela Akunnungu kwaligongo lya kila lyuŵa lya Kupumulila. Mikate jo jikuŵichikwa pameza kuti jiŵe jakulosya ŵandu nti mbopesi jakwapelechela Akunnungu.<verse eid="1CH 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 9:33" />Achalongo ŵane ŵa Ŵalawi ŵajimilile masengo ga kwimba pa Nyuumba ja Akunnungu, ŵatemi mu nyumba sine syasili pa Nyuumba ja Akunnungu ni nganasachilwa kupanganya masengo gane galigose ligongo ŵapanganyisye masengo gao chilo ni musi.<verse eid="1CH 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 9:34" />Ŵandu wose ŵasasikwe ŵa ŵaliji achakulu ŵa lukosyo lwa ŵalawi, mpela yaitite ngosyo syao, ŵanyawo ni achakulu uŵatamaga ku Yelusalemu.<verse eid="1CH 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ntundu wa mwenye che Sauli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1CH 8:29-38">1 Indu ya katema 8:29-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 9:35" />Che Yeieli ni juŵautandisye musi wa ku Gibeoni, asyene wo ni ŵankwawo ŵatamaga mwelemo. Ŵankwawo wo, lina lyao lyaliji che Maaka. <verse eid="1CH 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 9:36" />Ŵakwete ŵanache likumi, jwakwitio jwakwe ŵaliji che Abudoni, ni ŵakuiye che Suli ni che Kishi ni che Baali ni che Neli ni che Nadabu, <verse eid="1CH 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 9:37" />ni che Gedoli ni che Ahio ni che Sekalia ni che Mikiloti. <verse eid="1CH 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 9:38" />Che Mikiloti ŵammeleche che Shimeamu, ŵanyawo nombe ŵatemi ku Yelusalemu kuŵandikana ni achalongo ŵane ŵa ntundu wao.<verse eid="1CH 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 9:39" />Che Neli ŵammeleche che Kishi, ni che Kishi nombe ŵammeleche che Shauli. Che Shauli ŵakwete ŵanache ŵachilume ncheche, ŵanache wo ali che Yonatani ni che Maliki Shua ni che Abinadabu ni che Eshibaali. <verse eid="1CH 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 9:40" />Che Yonatani ŵammeleche che Melibi Baali ni che Melibi Baali ŵammeleche che Mika. <verse eid="1CH 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 9:41" />Che Mika ŵakwete ŵanache ŵachilume ncheche, ŵanache wo ali che Pitoni ni che Meleki ni che Talea ni che Ahazi. <verse eid="1CH 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 9:42" />Che Ahazi ŵammeleche che Yala, ni che Yala ŵaaŵeleche che Alemeti ni che Asimaweti ni che Simli. Che Simuli nombe ŵammeleche che Mosa. <verse eid="1CH 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 9:43" />Che Mosa ŵammeleche che Binea, che Binea ŵammeleche che Lefaya ni che Lefaya ŵammeleche che Eleasa, nombe che Eleasa ŵammeleche che Aseli.<verse eid="1CH 9:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 9:44" />Che Aseli ŵakwete ŵanache ŵachilume sita, ŵanache wo ali che Asilikamu ni che Bokelu, ni che Ishimaeli ni che Shealia ni che Obadia ni che Hamani. Woseŵa ŵaliji ŵanache ŵa che Aseli.<verse eid="1CH 9:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CH 10" />
  <para style="s">Chiwa cha mwenye che Sauli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="1SA 31:1-13">1 Samweli 31:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 10:1" />Nipele, Ŵafilisiti ŵaputene ngondo ni Ŵaisilaeli. Ŵaisilaeli ŵatisile paujo pa Ŵafilisiti, ni Ŵaisilaeli achajinji ŵaulajikwe ku chitumbi cha Giliboa. <verse eid="1CH 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 10:2" />Nambo Ŵafilisiti ŵaakuilichisye kwannope che Sauli ni achiŵanagwe, ni ŵaauleje che Yonatani ni che Abinadabu ni che Malikishua ŵanache ŵa che Sauli. <verse eid="1CH 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 10:3" />Ngondo ku che Sauli jaliji jakulimba nnope. Ŵandu ŵali ni mipamba ŵansimene che Sauli ni ŵansomile ni ŵammulesye kwannope. <verse eid="1CH 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 10:4" />Nipele che Sauli ŵansalile mundu juŵanjigalile yakumenyanilana, “Nsolomole lipanga lyenu musome une, kuti ŵandu ŵangaumbala ngasaika kundendela yachipongwe.” Nambo mundu juŵanjigalile yakumenyenilana jula ŵajogwepe kwannope, namose nganalinga kutenda yeleyo. Nipele, che Sauli ŵajigele lipanga lyakwe ŵalisomile nsyene. <verse eid="1CH 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 10:5" />Ni mundu juŵanjigalile yakumenyanilana jula paŵaiweni kuti che Sauli awile, nombejo ŵalisomile lipanga lyakwe ŵawile. <verse eid="1CH 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 10:6" />Kwayele che Sauli ni achiŵanagwe ŵatatu ŵawile, ni nganapagwa jwajuli jose mu uŵelesi wakwe juŵaliji mwenye. <verse eid="1CH 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 10:7" />Ni Ŵaisilaeli wose uŵatemi ku chiŵata cha Yesileeli paŵaweni ŵangondo ŵaatisile ŵammagongo, ni kuti che Sauli ni achiŵanagwe awile, ŵajilesile misi jao ŵatisile. Nombe Ŵafilisti ŵaiche ni kutama mmisi jo.<verse eid="1CH 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 10:8" />Kundaŵi kwakwe, Ŵafilisiti paŵapite kukujigala indu ya ŵandu ŵawilewo, ŵagasimene malilo ga che Sauli ni malilo ga achiŵagwe kulitumbi lya Giliboa. <verse eid="1CH 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 10:9" />Ŵambusile che Sauli yakuwala yakwe, ŵaukatile ntwe wakwe ni kuujigala pamo ni yakumenyanilana yakwe, nipele ŵaatumile ŵandu ajaule kuchilambo chose cha ku Filisiti kukusala ngani ji ku nyuumba syose siŵapopelaga inyago yao ni ŵandu ŵao. <verse eid="1CH 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 10:10" />Ŵaiŵisile yakumenyanilana ya che Sauli mu nyuumba jakupopelela minungu jao, nipele ŵaukoleche ntwe wakwe mu nyuumba ja nnungu jwao jwakuŵilanjikwa Dagoni. <verse eid="1CH 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 10:11" />Nambo ŵandu ŵa ku Yabeshi Gileadi paŵapikene yose yati Ŵafilisiti ŵaatendele che Shauli, <verse eid="1CH 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 10:12" />ŵandu ŵajiganyikwe yambone ngondo ŵapite kukugajigala malilo ga che Sauli ni achiŵanagwe, ŵagaichisye ku Yabeshi. Ŵaasichile kusi chitela cha mwaloni kwele ku Yabeshiko, ni ŵatemi moŵa saba pangalya chilichose atamuno nganaang'wa chindu.<verse eid="1CH 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 10:13" />Che Sauli ŵawile ligongo nganaŵa mundu jwakukulupilichika kwa Ambuje Akunnungu. Nganalijitichisya liloŵe lya Ambuje Akunnungu, ni ŵalinjile kuŵenda ushauli kwa mundu jwachisango, <verse eid="1CH 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 10:14" />pamalo pa kwausya Ambuje Akunnungu. Kwayele Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaatendekasisye aulajikwe, ni umwenye wakwe ŵampele che Daudi mwana jwa che Yese.<verse eid="1CH 10:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CH 11" />
  <para style="s">Che Daudi akuŵa mwenye jwa ku Isilaeli ni ku Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 5:1-10">2 Samweli 5:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 11:1" />Nipele Ŵaisilaeli wose ŵasongangene pamo ku che Daudi kwele ku Ebuloniko, ni ŵasalile, “Uweji tuli achalongo ŵenu. <verse eid="1CH 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 11:2" />Kalakala, che Shauli paŵaliji mwenye, alakwejo ni umwalongwesye Ŵaisilaeli kungondo, ni Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu ŵansalile, ‘Chimwalongosye ni kwalela ŵandu ŵangu Ŵaisilaeli, sooni chimme chilongola jwa ŵandu ŵangu Ŵaisilaeli.’ <verse eid="1CH 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 11:3" />Nipele, achachekulu wose ŵa Ŵaisilaeli ŵanjaulile mwenye che Daudi ku Ebuloni ko, nombe che Daudi ŵatesile lilangano nao paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu, sooni ŵantasile mauta che Daudi kuti aŵe mwenye jwa Ŵaisilaeli mpela Ambuje Akunnungu iŵasasile kwa litala lya jwakulondola che Samweli.”<verse eid="1CH 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 11:4" />Pakumala yeleyo, che Daudi ni Ŵaisilaeli wose ŵapite ku Yelusalemu musi uwamanyikaga nti Yebusi. Ŵandu uŵatamaga mwelemo ŵaliji Ŵayebusi. <verse eid="1CH 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 11:5" />Ŵandu ŵa ku Yebusi ŵansalile che Daudi, “Nganjinjila mmusi mu.” Namose yeleyo, che Daudi ŵasumwile likome lya Siyoni, yaani Musi wa che Daudi. <verse eid="1CH 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 11:6" />Nipele che Daudi ŵatite, “Mundu jwachalongolele kwaputa Ŵayebusi, chaŵe jwankulu ni chilongola jwa ŵakuputana ngondo.” Che Yoabu, mwananche ju che Seluya, ŵaliji jwandanda kwaputa, kwayele ŵaliji jwankulu. <verse eid="1CH 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 11:7" />Che Daudi ŵatemi mu likome mo, kwayele musiwo waŵilanjikwe “Musi wa che Daudi.” <verse eid="1CH 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 11:8" />Che Daudi ŵautawile musiwo mbande syose, achitandililaga ku Milo, ni kuusyungula musi wose, nombe che Yoabu ŵamalichisye kutaŵa malo jijasigalile. <verse eid="1CH 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 11:9" />Nombe che Daudi ŵajendelechele kukola machili kwannope, pakuŵa Ambuje Akunnungu ŵa machili gose ŵaliji pamo nawo.<verse eid="1CH 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŵangondo ŵajiganyikwe yambone kuputana ngondo ŵa che Daudi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 23:8-39">2 Samweli 23:8-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 11:10" />Ŵanyaŵa ni ŵaŵaliji achakulu ŵa ŵangondo ŵamachili ŵa che Daudi, ŵanyawo pamo ni Ŵaisilaeli wose, ŵaulimbisye umwenye wakwe kuti ujenele ku chilambo chose, mpela Ambuje Akunnungu iŵatite pakulanga.<verse eid="1CH 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 11:11" />Gelega gali meena ga ŵangondo ŵamachili ŵa che Daudi, che Yashobeamu jwa ntundu wa Hakimoni juŵaliji chilongola jwa aŵala ŵandu ŵatatu. Jweleju ŵaputene ni mpamba wakwe, ŵauleje ŵandu mia tatu pa lyuŵa limo kungondo. <verse eid="1CH 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 11:12" />Sooni juŵakuiye pa aŵala ŵandu ŵatatu ŵamachili jwaliji che Eleasali mwanache ju che Dodo, jwa ntundu wa Ahohi. <verse eid="1CH 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 11:13" />Jweleju jwaliji pamo ni che Daudi kwele ku Pasi Damimu, katema Ŵafilisiti paŵasongangene kuti aputane ngondo ni Ŵaisilaeli. Kweleko kwaliji ni ngunda waupandikwe shayili, nombe Ŵaisilaeli ŵatisile Ŵafilisiti. <verse eid="1CH 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 11:14" />Nambo che Daudi ni che Eliasali ŵajimi mwakulimbangana pasikati ja ngunda wo, ŵaputene nao kuti akasumulwa, ŵauleje Ŵafilisiti. Ambuje Akunnungu ŵapundisye kwakukulungwa.<verse eid="1CH 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 11:15" />Nipele ŵangondo ŵamachili ŵatatu pasikati ja ŵangondo salasini ŵala ŵanjaulile che Daudi ku lwala kujili mbugu ja Adulamu. Katema ko ŵangondo ŵa Ŵafilisiti ŵaŵisile chigono ku Lichemba lya Lefaimu. <verse eid="1CH 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 11:16" />Katema ko che Daudi ŵaliji mu likome, ni ŵangondo ŵa Ŵafilisiti ŵaliji ku musi wa ku Beselehemu. <verse eid="1CH 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 11:17" />Che Daudi ŵatite kwalung'wanu nnope kuti, “Ngulajila kuti mundu akambele meesi ga kung'wa gakutyochela ku chisima chachili chiŵandi ni nnango wekulungwa wakwinjilila musi wa ku Beselehemu!” <verse eid="1CH 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 11:18" />Kwayele aŵala ŵandu ŵatatu ŵamachili ŵala ŵatyosile, ŵapelete pasikati pa chigono cha ŵangondo ŵa Ŵafilisiti, ŵajawile ni ŵatechile meesi ku chisima chachili chiŵandi ni nnango ŵekulungwa ŵakwinjilila mmusi ŵa ku Beselehemu, ŵampelechele che Daudi. Nambo che Daudi ŵakanile kugang'wa, ŵagajitilile pasi kuti gaŵe mbopesi kwa Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="1CH 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 11:19" />Ŵatite, “Ngang'wa aga mesi ga, Ili mpela kung'wa miasi ja aŵa ŵandu ŵautyosisye umi wao.” Kwayele che Daudi nganaang'wa meesi gala. Yele ni iŵaipanganyisye ŵandu ŵamachili ŵatatu ŵala.<verse eid="1CH 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 11:20" />Che Abishai mpwakwe che Yoabu, ŵaliji jwankulu jwa ŵangondo ŵamachili salasini ŵala. Jwelejo ŵamenyene kwa mpamba wakwe ni ŵandu mia tatu, ni ŵauleje, kwayele ŵapikaniche pasikati ja aŵala ŵangondo ŵamachili ŵatatu ŵala. <verse eid="1CH 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 11:21" />Nipele, ŵaliji mundu jwakuchimbichikwa kwapunda ŵangondo ŵamachili salasini, ni ŵaliji chilongola jwao, nambo nganaŵa jwangondo jwamachili mpela ŵangondo ŵamachili ŵatatu ŵala.<verse eid="1CH 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 11:22" />Nombe che Benaya, mwanache jwa che Yehoyada, kutyochela ku Kabuseeli, ŵaliji jwangondo jwamachili juŵatesile indu yejinji yakusimosya. Ŵauleje ŵangondo ŵamachili ŵaŵili kutyochela ku Moabu, sooni lyuŵa limpepe katema ka mbepo nnope, ŵatumbuchile mwisimbo ni kuliulaga lisimba. <verse eid="1CH 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 11:23" />Soni ŵammuleje Mmisili, jwalewipe nnope, uleu wakwe waliji mita siŵili ni nusu, ŵajigele mpamba wekulungwa nnope mmakono mpela mpini. Nambo che Benaya ŵanjaulile ali ajigele chimbonga, ŵansumwile mpambawo, ŵammuleje Mmisili jo kwa mpamba wakwe nsyene. <verse eid="1CH 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 11:24" />Yeleyi ni iŵaitesile che Benaya mwanache jwa che Yehoyada, jweleju nombe ŵamanyiche mpela aŵala ŵangondo ŵamachili ŵatatu ŵala. <verse eid="1CH 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 11:25" />Nipele, ŵachimbichikwe kwannope kwapunda ŵangondo salasili ŵala, nambo nganaŵa pasikati ja aŵala ŵangondo ŵamachili ŵatatu ŵala. Che Daudi ŵammisile kuŵa chilongola jwa mpingo wa ŵakulindilila ŵakwe.<verse eid="1CH 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 11:26" />Ŵangondo ŵamachili ŵa che Daudi ŵaliji, che Asaheli mpwakwe che Yoabu, ni che Elihanani mwanache jwa che Dodo jwa ku Beselehemu, <verse eid="1CH 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 11:27" />ni che Shamoti jwa ku Alodi, ni che Elesi jwa ku Peloni, <verse eid="1CH 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 11:28" />ni che Ila, mwanache ju che Ikeshi jwa ku Tekoa, ni che Abieseli jwa ku Anatoti, <verse eid="1CH 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 11:29" />ni che Sibekai jwa ntundu wa Muhushati ni che Ilai jwa ntundu wa Ahohi, <verse eid="1CH 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 11:30" />ni che Mahalai jwa ku Netofati ni che Heledi, mwanache jwa che Baana jwa ku Netofati, <verse eid="1CH 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 11:31" />ni che Itai, mwanache ju che Libai, kutyochela ku Gibea, jwa lukosyo lwao che Benyamini ni che Benaya mundu jwa ku Pilatoni; <verse eid="1CH 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 11:32" />ni che Hulai kutyochela tusulo twa Gaashi, ni che Abieli kutyochela ntundu wa Alaba, <verse eid="1CH 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 11:33" />ni che Asimaweti jwa ku Bahalumu ni che Eliaba jwa ku Shaaliboni, <verse eid="1CH 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 11:34" />ŵanache ŵa che Yasheni mundu jwa ku Giloni, ni che Yonatani, mwanache jwa che Shagee mundu jwa ku Halali, <verse eid="1CH 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 11:35" />ni che Ahiamu, mwanache ju che Sakali mundu jwa ku Halali, ni che Elifali, mwanache ju che Uli, <verse eid="1CH 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 11:36" />ni che Efeli mundu jwa ku Mekelati, ni che Ahiya jwa ku Peloni, <verse eid="1CH 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 11:37" />ni che Esilo jwa ku Kalimeli ni che Naalai, mwanache jwa che Esibai, <verse eid="1CH 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 11:38" />ni che Yoeli, mpwakwe che Natani, ni che Mibihali, mwanache ju che Hagili, <verse eid="1CH 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 11:39" />ni che Seleki mundu jwa ku Moni ni che Nahalai mundu jwa ku Beeloti, juŵajigalaga yakumenyanila ya che Yoabu, mwanache ju che Seluya, <verse eid="1CH 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 11:40" />che Ila ni che Galebu, ŵaŵaliji ŵandu ŵa ku Itili, <verse eid="1CH 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 11:41" />che Ulia, jwa ku Hiti; ni che Sabadi mwanache ju che Ahilai, <verse eid="1CH 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 11:42" />ni che Adina, mwanache ju che Shisa jwa ntundu wa Lobeni, jwankulu jwa lukosyo lwa Lobeni ni ŵandu ŵakwe salasini, <verse eid="1CH 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 11:43" />che Hanani, mwanache ju che Maaka, ni che Yoshafati jwa ku Mitini, <verse eid="1CH 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 11:44" />ni che Uzia jwa ku Ashitelati, ni che Shama ni che Yeieli, ŵanache ŵa che Hotamu jwa musi wa ku Aloeli, <verse eid="1CH 11:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CH 11:45" />che Yediaeli ni che Yoha mpwakwe, ŵanache ŵa che Shimili mundu jwa ku Tisi, <verse eid="1CH 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CH 11:46" />che Elieli jwa ku Mahawi, ni che Yeliba ni che Yoshavia, ŵanache ŵa che Elinaamu, ni che Itima jwa ku Moabu, <verse eid="1CH 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CH 11:47" />che Elieli ni che Obedi, ni che Yaasieli mundu jwa ku Mesobai.<verse eid="1CH 11:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CH 12" />
  <para style="s">Ŵangondo ŵamachili ŵaŵalumbikene ni che Daudi ku Sikilagi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 12:1" />Ŵanyaŵa ni ŵangondo ŵaŵalumbikene ni che Daudi ku Sikilagi ko, katema paŵaŵinjikwe paujo pa che Sauli mwanache ju che Kishi. Ŵandu ŵa ŵaliji mu mpingo mwa ŵangondo ŵamachili ŵaŵankamuchisyaga che Daudi ku ngondo. <verse eid="1CH 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 12:2" />Ŵanyawo ŵaliji ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa che Benyamini kuŵatyochelaga mwenye che Sauli. Ŵandu ŵa ŵaliji ŵakombola kuputa maukunje ni ŵakuponya maganga ni manati kwa makono gose ganagaŵili, wakunchiji ni wakunlyo. <verse eid="1CH 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 12:3" />Chilongola jwao ŵaliji che Ahieseli, nkamusi jwao ŵaliji che Yoashi, wose ŵanache u che Shemaa kutyochela ku Gibea. Ŵane ŵaliji che Yesieli ni che Peleti, ŵanache ŵa che Asimaweti, ni che Belaka, ni che Yehu kutyochela ku Anatoti, <verse eid="1CH 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 12:4" />ni che Ishimaya kutyochela ku Gibeoni, mundu jwamachili jumo jwa aŵala ŵandu salasini ni chilongola jwao pamo ni che Yelemia, ni che Yahasieli, ni che Yohanani, ni che Yosabadi kutyochela ku Gedela, <verse eid="1CH 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 12:5" />ni che Elusai ni che Yelemoti ni che Bealia ni che Shemalia ni che Shefatia ni che Muhalufi, <verse eid="1CH 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 12:6" />ni che Elikana, ni che Ishia ni che Asaleli ni che Yoeseli, ni che Yashobeamu kutyochela ntundu wa Kola <verse eid="1CH 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 12:7" />ni che Yoela ni che Sebadia, ŵanache ŵa che Yelohamu, kutyochela ku Gedoli.<verse eid="1CH 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŵandu ŵaŵankuiye che Daudi kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Gadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 12:8" />Sooni, ŵandu kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Gadi ŵalilumbikenye ni che Daudi ali ku likome, akula ku ukweti kula. Ŵanyaŵa ŵaliji ŵangondo ŵaali ni machili ni ŵaŵasyoŵelele kuputana ngondo, ŵaakumanyilila kutumia chindu cha kulichinga pantima ni mpamba. Ŵandu ŵali ni ngope syakogoya mpela lisimba ni sooni ali ŵandu ŵakwaluka mpela ngolombwe mmatumbi. <verse eid="1CH 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 12:9" />Chilongola jwao jwankulu ŵaliji che Eseli, jwaaŵili che Obadia, jwaatatu che Eliabu, <verse eid="1CH 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 12:10" />jwancheeche che Mishimana, jwansano che Yelemia, <verse eid="1CH 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 12:11" />jwasita che Atai, jwa saba che Elieli, <verse eid="1CH 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 12:12" />jwanane che Yohanani, ni jwatisa che Elisabadi, <verse eid="1CH 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 12:13" />jwakumi che Yelemia, jwakumi na moja che Makibanai.<verse eid="1CH 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 12:14" />Ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Gadi, ŵajili ilongola ŵa ŵangondo. Malinga ni yeo yao, jwannondi ŵajimilile liunjili lya ŵangondo mia moja, ni jwankulu ŵajimilile liunjili lya ŵangondo elufu moja. <verse eid="1CH 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 12:15" />Ŵanyaŵa ni ŵandu uŵajombweche lusulo lwa Yolodani pa mwesi waandanda, palwagumbele lusulo mpaka muumbali mwakwe ni kwatesya ŵandu ŵaŵatamaga kulutando autuchile chakungopochelo lyuŵa ni ŵane chakumaswelo lyuŵa kwa lusulo lo.<verse eid="1CH 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŵandu ŵaŵankuiye che Daudi kutyochela mu ngosyo sya Benyamini ni Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 12:16" />Ŵandu ŵane kutyochela ngosyo sya Benyamini ni Yuda ŵaiche ku che Daudi pa likome lyakwe. <verse eid="1CH 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 12:17" />Che Daudi ŵakopweche paasa kukwachingamila, ŵaasalile, “Naga nnyiche kukwangu mpela achaambusanga kuti muungamuchisye nipele ngumpochelanga kwa ntima wose, nambo naga nnyiche kukwakamuchisya ŵammagongo ŵangu kuti aangamule, nachiŵamuno nganineŵa chachilichose, Akunnungu ŵa achatati ŵetu annole ni kunjamuka.”<verse eid="1CH 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 12:18" />Pelepo mbumu jwa Akunnungu ŵaichilile che Abishai, jwankulu jwa ŵandu salasini wo, nombewo ŵatite,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 12:18">“Uweji tuli ŵandu ŵenu alakwe che Daudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 12:18">uwe tuli pamo ni alakwe mwanache ju che Yese!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 12:18">Chitendewele, elo chitendewele chiŵe kukwenu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 12:18">ni chitendewele aŵenacho jwalijose jwakunkamusa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 12:18">pakuŵa Akunnungu ŵenu ni ŵaakunkaumusya.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1CH 12:18">Nipele che Daudi ŵaapochele ni kwatenda aŵe achakulu ŵa ŵangondo ŵakwe.<verse eid="1CH 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŵandu ŵaŵankuiye che Daudi kutyochela ku lukosyo lwa Manase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 12:19" />Ŵandu ŵampepe kutyochela lukosyo lwa Manase, ŵalilumbikenye ni che Daudi, katema kaŵatyokaga pamo ni ŵafilisiti kwaula kukuputana ni mwenye che Shauli. Nambo che Daudi ni ŵandu ŵakwe, nganiŵakamusya ŵafilisiti pakuŵa ilongola ya ŵafilisiti ŵajilene ŵaŵinje auje ku Sikilagi achitiji, “Twakamulanganaga ni che Daudi chatugalauche ni kuuja kwa che Sauli mwenye jwakwe, uweji ŵanawose tutuulajikwe.” <verse eid="1CH 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 12:20" />Nipele, che Daudi paŵaliji ku Sikilagi, aŵa ni ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Manase ŵalumbikene nawo, che Adina ni che Yosabadi ni che Yediaeli ni che Mikaeli ni che Yosabadi ni che Elihu ni che Siletai. Mundu jwalijose mwa ŵanyawo ŵaliji chilongola jwa mpingo wa ŵandu elufu moja mu lukosyo lwa Manase. <verse eid="1CH 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 12:21" />Ŵakamwisye che Daudi kuputana ni mipingo ja ŵandu uŵagungumuchilaga, pakuŵa wose ŵaliji ŵangondo ŵaali ni machili ni ilongola. <verse eid="1CH 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 12:22" />Lyuŵa ni lyuŵa, ŵandu ŵalilumbikenye ni che Daudi kwakamusya, kuumbesi ŵakwete ŵangondo ŵajinji, mpela ŵangondo ŵa Ambuje Akunnungu.<verse eid="1CH 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŵangondo ŵaŵalumbikene ni che Daudi kwele ku Hebuloni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 12:23" />Ajiji ni mipingo ja ŵangondo ŵakwete yakumenyanilana ŵaŵalumbikene ni che Daudi ku Hebuloni ko kuti ŵaasumule che Sauli umwenye ni kwapa che Daudi, mpela Ambuje Akunnungu iŵatite kusala. <verse eid="1CH 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 12:24" />Ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Yuda ŵaliji elufu sita na mia nane ŵaŵaliji ni mipamba ni indu yakulisiŵila pantima, wose ŵaliji ni yakumenyanilana yao ya pangondo. <verse eid="1CH 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 12:25" />Kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Simeoni, kwaliji ni ŵangondo elufu saba na mia moja ŵamachili ni ŵaali ni umanyilisi nnope wa kuputana ngondo. <verse eid="1CH 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 12:26" />Kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Lawi kwaliji ni ŵangondo elufu nne na mia sita. <verse eid="1CH 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 12:27" />Pamo ni che Yehoyada, chilongola jwa ulongo u che Haluni juŵaliji pamo ni ŵandu elufu tatu na mia saba, <verse eid="1CH 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 12:28" />ni che Sadoki, jwangondo jwanchanda jwali ni machili gakuputana ngondo, juŵaliji pamo ni ilongola ŵane ishilini na mbili kutyochela mu ntundu wakwe. <verse eid="1CH 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 12:29" />Kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Benyamini, lukosyo luŵatyochele che Sauli, ŵandu elufu tatu. Achajinji ŵajendelechele kuŵa ŵandu ŵakukulupilichika kwa che Sauli mpaka pa kele katema ko. <verse eid="1CH 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 12:30" />Kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Efulaimu kwaliji ni ŵangondo elufu ishilini na mia nane, ŵandu ŵaŵachimbichikwe kwannope mu mitundu jawo. <verse eid="1CH 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 12:31" />Ŵandu nusu ja lukosyo lwa Manase ŵaŵasagulikwe kuti aiche kukwatendekasya che Daudi aŵe mwenye ŵaliji ŵangondo elufu kumi na nane, <verse eid="1CH 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 12:32" />Kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Isakali, ilongola mia mbili pamo ni ŵandu ŵao ŵaŵalongosyaga. Ilongola wo ŵaliji ni umanyilisi wakwimanyilila Ŵaisilaeli atende chichi ni kwa katema chi. <verse eid="1CH 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 12:33" />Kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Sabuloni kwaliji ni ŵangondo elufu hansini ŵakukulupilichika ni ŵasyoŵelele kuputana ngondo. Ŵaliŵisile chile kuputana ngondo achiŵaga ni yakumenyanilana yakupisyangana, kuti ŵakamuchisye che Daudi. <verse eid="1CH 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 12:34" />Kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Nafutali kwaliji ni ilongola elufu moja pamo ni ŵangondo elufu salasini na saba ali ajigele mipamba ni indu ya kulisiŵila pantima. <verse eid="1CH 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 12:35" />Kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Dani kwaliji ni ŵangondo elufu ishilini na nane na mia sita ŵaŵaliji ni yakumenyanilana, chile kuputana ngondo. <verse eid="1CH 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 12:36" />Kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Asheli kwaliji ni ŵangondo elufu alobaini ŵasyoŵelele kuputana ngondo, ŵaliji chile kwa ngondo. <verse eid="1CH 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 12:37" />Kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Lobeni, ni Gadi ni nusu ja lukosyo lwa Manase kutyochela pesi lusulo lwa Yolodani, kwaliji ni ŵangondo laki moja na elufu ishilini ŵaŵaliji ni yakumenyanilana yakupisyangana ya pangondo.<verse eid="1CH 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 12:38" />Ŵangondo wose wo, ŵaliŵisile chile kuputana ngondo, ŵajawile ku Hebuloni miningwa jao jaliji kwatendekasya che Daudi aŵe mwenye jwa Isilaeli jose. Ni Ŵaislaeli wose, ŵalumbikene ali ni nningwa umo wakuti ŵaatende che Daudi aŵe mwenye jwa ŵandu ŵa ku Isilaeli.<verse eid="1CH 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 12:39" />Nipele, ŵatemi ni che Daudi kwa moŵa gatatu, achilyaga ni kung'wa pakuŵa achalongo ŵao ŵaamasile kwaŵichila chile yaakulya. <verse eid="1CH 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 12:40" />Ni sooni, Ŵaisilaeli achinjawo ŵaiche mpela iŵatite kwika ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Isakali, ni Sabuloni ni Nafutali, ŵaaichenayo yaakulya iŵaitwiichile mbunda ni ngamia ni nyumbu ni ng'ombe. Kwayele ŵakwete utandi wejinji ni mikate ja tini ni isagwa yejumu ya sabibu pamo ni divai ni mauta ga seituni. Sooni ŵaaichisye ng'ombe ni ngondolo syejinji, kwayele Ŵaisilaeli ŵasangalele.<verse eid="1CH 12:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CH 13" />
  <para style="s">Lisanduku lya Lilangano akuliusya ku Kiliati Yealimu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 6:1-11">2 Samweli 6:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 13:1" />Che Daudi ŵaŵechetesyene ni achakulu ŵa ŵangondo ŵa mipingo ja ŵandu elufu moja ni mipingo ja ŵandu mia moja pamo ni ilongola yose. <verse eid="1CH 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 13:2" />Nipele ŵaasalile Ŵaisilaeli wose uŵasongangene, “Naga nyiwonaga kuti ili yambone, ni iŵaga uli usache wa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵetu, nipele tupeleche utenga kwa achalongo ŵetu ŵane ŵaali kwatalika ni mwakuŵandichila mu chilambo chose cha ku Isilaeli. Sooni tupeleche kwa ŵambopesi ni Ŵalawi ŵaali pamo nao mmisi jao ni mmalo syao sya kulisisya ilango yawo, aiche kukamulangana pamo ni uwe. <verse eid="1CH 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 13:3" />Nipele tujaule tukalijigale Lisanduku lya Lilangano lya Akunnungu ŵetu, pakuŵa nganitujaula kwausya Akunnungu tupanganye ichichi katema ka umwenye u che Sauli.” <verse eid="1CH 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 13:4" />Ŵandu wose ŵajitichisyene kutenda yeleyo pakuŵa yawoneche kuti chili chindu chambone kwa ŵandu wose.<verse eid="1CH 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 13:5" />Kwayele, che Daudi ŵaasongangenye Ŵaisilaeli wose, kutandilila ku kasulo ka Shiholi kakali ku Misili, mpaka kundago ja Lebo Hamati kuti aiche nalyo Lisanduku lya Lilangano lya Akunnungu kutyochela ku Kiliati Yealimu mpaka ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="1CH 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 13:6" />Che Daudi, pamo ni Ŵaisilaeli wose ŵapite mpaka musi wa ku Baala, yaani ku Kiliasi Yealimu, ku chilambo cha ku Yuda, kuti kutyochela kweleko akalijigale Lisanduku lya Lilangano lya Akunnungu lyalikuŵilanjikwa kwa lina lya Ambuje Akunnungu jwakutama pachitengu chakwe cha umwenye chachili pasikati ja yepanganyikwe yaili ni mapapiko. <verse eid="1CH 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 13:7" />Nipele, ŵalijigele Lisanduku lya Lilangano lya Akunnungu ni mutuka jajikukwekwelemwa ni ng'ombe jampya kutyochela mu nyuumba ja che Abinadabu. Che Usa ni che Ahio ni uŵajendesyaga mutuka jo. <verse eid="1CH 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 13:8" />Che Daudi ni ŵandu wose ŵa ku Isilaeli ŵatyasile kwa machili gao gose, paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu. Ŵajimbile ni kugomba ing'wenyegw'enye ni inanda ni tugoma twamwana ni matoasi ni mapenenga.<verse eid="1CH 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 13:9" />Paŵaiche pa luŵala lwa kukung'undila magungulo wauli ku Kidoni, che Usa ŵatambalukwile nkono ŵao kulikamulila Lisanduku lya Lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu likagwa ligongo mikambaku ja ng'ombe ŵalikuŵele. <verse eid="1CH 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 13:10" />Nipele Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaatumbilile che Usa ligongo lya kulikamula lisandukulyo, ni ŵamputile. Che Usa ŵawile papopo paujo pa Akunnungu. <verse eid="1CH 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 13:11" />Che Daudi ŵatumbile ligongo Ambuje Akunnungu ammuleje che Usa ali ni chisongolo. Kwaligongo lyo pamalo po pakuŵilanjikwa Pelesi Usa mpaka lelo jino.<verse eid="1CH 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 13:12" />Lyele lyuŵa lyo che Daudi ŵaajogwepe Akunnungu, ŵatite, “Sambano ching'ombole chinauli kulijigala Lisanduku lya Akunnungu kumangwangu?” <verse eid="1CH 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 13:13" />Nipele, che Daudi nganalijigala Lisanduku lya Lilangano lya Akunnungu lyo kulijausya ku Musi wa che Daudi, nambo ŵalipeleche kunyuumba ji che Obedi Edomu ŵa kutyochela ku Gati. <verse eid="1CH 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 13:14" />Lisanduku lya Lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu lyatemi ku che Obedi Edomu kwa miesi jitatu, nombe Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaajipele upile nyumba ji che Obedi Edomu pamo ni yose yakwete.<verse eid="1CH 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CH 14" />
  <para style="s">Masengo ga che Daudi ku Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 5:11-16">2 Samweli 5:11-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 14:1" />Nipele mwenye che Hilamu jwa ku Tilo ŵaatumile ŵantenga ku che Daudi, nombe ali ajigele mitambala ja itele ya Mielesi, ni ŵandu ŵa kutaŵa majumba ni maselemala, kuti akaataŵile nyuumba che Daudi. <verse eid="1CH 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 14:2" />Nipele che Daudi ŵaimanyilile kuti Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaatesile aŵe mwenye jwa Ŵaisilaeli ni kuti autesile umwenye wakwe uŵe wakulimbangana kwaligongo lya ŵandu ŵakwe Ŵaisilaeli.<verse eid="1CH 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 14:3" />Ku Yelusalemu ko, che Daudi ŵalombele achakongwe achajinji, ni ŵakwete ŵanache ŵachilume ni achiŵali achajinji. <verse eid="1CH 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 14:4" />Gele ni mena ga ŵanache ŵaŵaŵeleche ku Yelusalemu ko, che Shamua ni che Shobabu ni che Natani ni che Selemani, <verse eid="1CH 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 14:5" />ni che Ibihali ni che Elishua ni che Elipeleti, <verse eid="1CH 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 14:6" />ni che Noga ni che Nefegi ni che Yafia, <verse eid="1CH 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 14:7" />che Elishama ni che Beeeliada ni che Elifeleti.<verse eid="1CH 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Daudi akwapunda Ŵafilisiti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 5:17-25">2 Samweli 5:17-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 14:8" />Ŵafilisiti paŵapilikene kuti che Daudi akamulikwe umwenye wa chilambo chose cha Isilaeli, ŵatyosile ni ŵangondo ŵao wose ŵajawile kukwasosa. Nambo che Daudi paŵapilikene ngani syo ŵatyosile kwaula kukuputana nawo. <verse eid="1CH 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 14:9" />Ŵafilisiti ŵaiche ni kutanda kwagungumuchila ŵandu ŵa ku Lichemba lya ku Lefaimu. <verse eid="1CH 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 14:10" />Nipele, che Daudi ŵausisye Akunnungu, “Uli, nyaule kukwaagungumuchila Ŵafilisiti? Uli chimundendasye naapunde?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 14:10">Nombe Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaasalile, “Njaule, chinantendekasye mwapunde.”<verse eid="1CH 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 14:11" />Nipele, che Daudi ŵapite ku Baali Pelasimu ni ŵaapundile kweleko, ŵatite, “Akunnungu ŵaakumbile ŵammagongo ŵangu kwa machili gangu, nti chikumba meesi.” Nipele, ŵapaŵilasile pamalo po Baali Pelasimu malumbo gakwe “Akunnungu ŵakulosya litala.” <verse eid="1CH 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 14:12" />Ŵafilisti paŵatisile, ŵailesile inyago ya minungu jawo ni che Daudi ŵalamwile inyago yose ichomekwe mooto.<verse eid="1CH 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 14:13" />Nipele, Ŵafilisiti ŵaagunguluchile ŵandu ŵa ku chiŵata cho kaaŵili. <verse eid="1CH 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 14:14" />Katema ko che Daudi ŵausisye soni Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵajanjile, “Ngasimwagunguluchila kutyochela apano, nambo nsyungule njaule chiŵandi ni itela yaikuŵilanjikwa Misolofaji, ni nkaagunguluchile kutyochela kweleko. <verse eid="1CH 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 14:15" />Nipele pachimpilikane misindo ja kwenda kwa ŵangondo jilinkutyochela ku jili misolofaji, pelepo ntyoche nkaputane ngondo. None chinongolele kwaputa ŵangondo ŵa Ŵafilisiti.” <verse eid="1CH 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 14:16" />Che Daudi ŵatesile mpela yatite kulamulikwa ni Akunnungu. Ŵaaputile ŵangondo ŵa Ŵafilisiti kutandulila ku Gibeoni mpaka ku Geseli. <verse eid="1CH 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 14:17" />Che Daudi ŵapikaniche ku chilambo chosope, nombe Ambuje Akunnungu ŵatendekasisye ŵandu ŵa ilambo yose ŵaajogope che Daudi.<verse eid="1CH 14:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CH 15" />
  <para style="s">Che Daudi akuliichisya Lisanduku lya Lilangano ku Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 15:1" />Che Daudi paŵamasile kusitaŵa nyuumba syakwe ku musi wa che Daudi, ŵaakolosisye Lisanduku lya Akunnungu, nipele ŵaalijimiche lisakasa. <verse eid="1CH 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 15:2" />Nipele ŵatite, “Ngapagwa mundu jwalijose jwachalijigale Lisanduku lya Akunnungu ikaŵe Ŵalawi, pakuŵa Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaasagwile ŵanyawo kulijigala ni kwatumichila moŵa gose pangali mbesi.” <verse eid="1CH 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 15:3" />Nipele, che Daudi ŵasongangenye Ŵaisilaeli wose aiche ku Yelusalemu, kuti aliichisye Lisanduku lya Ambuje Akunnungu pamalo paŵapakolochesye. <verse eid="1CH 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 15:4" />Nipele che Daudi ŵaŵilasile iŵelesi ya che Haluni ni ya Ŵalawi. <verse eid="1CH 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 15:5" />Kutyochela mu ntundu wa che Kohati, ŵaiche che Ulieli chilongola pamo ni achapwao mia moja na ishilini. <verse eid="1CH 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 15:6" />Kutyochela mu ntundu u che Melali ŵaiche che Asaya chilongola pamo ni achapwao mia mbili na ishilini. <verse eid="1CH 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 15:7" />Kutyochela mu ntundu u che Gelishomu, ŵaiche che Yoeli chilongola pamo ni achapwao mia moja na selasini. <verse eid="1CH 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 15:8" />Kutyochela mu ntundu u che Elisafani, ŵaiche che Shemaya chilongola pamo ni achapwao mia mbili. <verse eid="1CH 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 15:9" />Kutyochela mu ntundu wa che Hebuloni, ŵaiche che Elieli chilongola pamo ni achapwao semanini. <verse eid="1CH 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 15:10" />Kutyochela mu ntundu u che Usieli, ŵaiche che Aminadamu chilongola pamo na achapwao mia moja kumi na mbili.<verse eid="1CH 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 15:11" />Nipele, che Dauli ŵaŵilasile ŵambopesi ŵaŵili, ŵambopesi wo ali che Sadoki ni che Abiasali. Sooni ŵaaŵilasile Ŵalawi sita, che Ulieli ni che Asaya ni che Yoeli ni che Shemaya ni che Elieli ni che Abinadamu, <verse eid="1CH 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 15:12" />Ŵaasalalilenje, “Ŵanyamwe ndinji ilongola wa mitundu ja Ŵalawi. Ŵanyamwe pamo ni Ŵalawi achinjenu, nlijosye kuti mme ŵakukundikwa kwa kwapopelela Akunnungu nkaliiche nalyo Lisanduku lya Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵa Isilaeli, mpaka pamalo pangolosisye kwa ligongo lya Lisanduku lyo. <verse eid="1CH 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 15:13" />Pakuŵa ulendo waandanda nganinlijigala, Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnugu ŵetu ŵaatujamwiche pakuŵa nganituwausya yakuti kutenda kuti tukombole kuliichisya mpela iŵatite pakutulajisya.”<verse eid="1CH 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 15:14" />Nipele, ŵambopesi ni ŵalawi ŵalityosisye kwa ligongo lya Ambuje kuti aliichenalyo Lisanduku lya Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵa ku Isilaeli. <verse eid="1CH 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 15:15" />Ŵalawi ŵalijigele Lisanduku kwa chisanyasanya mmakoyo mwao mpela iŵatite kulajisya che Musa, malinga liloŵe lya Ambuje Akunnungu.<verse eid="1CH 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 15:16" />Che Daudi ŵaasalile ilongolo ŵa Ŵalawi kuti ŵaasalile achalongo achinjao ŵakwimba kuti ajimbeje nyimbo sya kusangalala ni kugomba ing'wenyegw'enye ni imbeta ni tugoma twamwana. <verse eid="1CH 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 15:17" />Kwayele ŵeleŵa ni Ŵalawi ŵaŵasagulikwe kutyochela kwa ŵakwimba, che Hemani mwana ju che Yoeli kutyochela pasikati ja achapwakwe, ni che Asafu mwana jwa che Belekia kutyochela pasikati ja achalongo achinjakwe Ŵamelali, ni che Etani mwana ju che Kushaia. <verse eid="1CH 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 15:18" />Nipele ŵasagwile Ŵalawi ŵane aŵe ŵakamusi ŵao kwa kukamula nafasi jaaŵili, che Sekalia ni che Yaasieli ni che Shemilamoti ni che Yehieli ni che Uni ni che Eliabu ni che Benaya ni che Maaseya ni che Matitia ni che Elifelehu ni che Mikineya. Sooni ŵaasagwile ŵakulindilila pannango, che Obedi Edomu ni che Yeieli. <verse eid="1CH 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 15:19" />Che Hemani ni che Asafu ni che Etani ŵasagulikwe kuti agombeje ing'wenyeng'wenye yaikolesekwe kwa madini ga shaba. <verse eid="1CH 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 15:20" />Che Sekalia ni che Asieli ni che Shemilamoti ni che Yeieli ni che Uni ni che Eliabu ni che Maaseya ni che Benaya, ŵaalinji ŵakugomba imbeta ya liloŵe lya Alamoti. <verse eid="1CH 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 15:21" />Nambo che Matitia ni che Elifelehu ni che Mikineya ni che Obedi Edomu ni che Yeieli ni che Asasia ŵasagulikwe kuti agombeje ing'wenyeng'wenye achilongoswagwa ni liloŵe lya Sheminiti.<verse eid="1CH 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 15:22" />Nombe che Kenani ligongo lya umanyilisi wakugombela ung'asi uŵaliji nao, ŵaŵichikwe aŵe chilongola jwa ŵakwimba wose. <verse eid="1CH 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 15:23" />Che Belekia ni che Elikana ŵaliji ŵakulilindilila Lisanduku lya Lilangano. <verse eid="1CH 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 15:24" />Che Shebania ni che Yoshafati ni che Netaneli ni che Amasai ni che Sekalia ni che Benaya ni che Eliezeli, uŵaliji ŵambopesi, ŵasagulikwe aŵeje ŵakugomba mapenenga paujo pa lisanduku lya Akunnungu. Che Obedi Edomu ni che Yehiya ŵaŵichikwe aŵe ŵakulindilila Lisanduku lya lilangano lya Akunnungu.<verse eid="1CH 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulijausya Lisanduku lya Lilangano ku Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 6:12-22">2 Samweli 6:12-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 15:25" />Nipele, che Daudi ni ilongola ŵa Ŵaisilaeli ni achakulu ŵa ŵangondo ŵa mipingo ja ŵandu elufu moja, ŵajawile kulijigala Lisanduku lya Lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu kutyochela ku nyuumba ji che Obedi Edomu alinkusengwa. <verse eid="1CH 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 15:26" />Ŵaatyochesye Akunnungu mbopesi sya mikambaku ja ng'ombe saba ni ngondolo tonde saba, ligongo Akunnungu ŵakamusisye Ŵalawi uŵajigele Lisanduku lya Lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu ŵala. <verse eid="1CH 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 15:27" />Che Daudi ŵaŵalile mwinjilo ŵeswela mbee, nti yatite kuwala Ŵalawi wose ŵaŵajigele Lisanduku lya lilangano lya Akunnungu, ni ŵakwimba ŵaŵalile iyoyo pamo ni che Kenania chilongola juŵalongosyaga nyimbo sya ŵakwimba. Che Daudi ŵaawete nombe chisibao cheswela mbee. <verse eid="1CH 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 15:28" />Kwayele, Ŵaisilaeli wose ŵalijigele Lisanduku lya Lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu kwa kusengwa achiputaga misengo ja ngondolo tonde ni mapenenga ni tugoma twamwana ni kugomba ing'wenyeng'wenye ni imbeta.<verse eid="1CH 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 15:29" />Katema Lisanduku lya Lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu palyajinjilaga mmusi u che Daudi, che Mikali mwali ju che Sauli ŵalingulilaga pedilisha, paŵammweni mwenye che Daudi alinkung'anda ni kusangalala, nipele ŵaanyelwisye chamuntima.<verse eid="1CH 15:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CH 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 16:1" />Pakumala yeleyo ŵalijinjisye Lisanduku lya Lilangano lya Akunnungu, ni kuliŵika mu lisakasa liŵalikolosisye che Daudi. Sooni ŵatyosisye mbopesi sya kutinisya ni sya chitendewele paujo pa Akunnungu. <verse eid="1CH 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 16:2" />Che Daudi paŵamasile kutyosya mbopesi sya kutinisya ni sya chitendewele syo, ŵapele upile ŵandu kwa lina lya Ambuje Akunnungu, <verse eid="1CH 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 16:3" />ni ŵagaŵile Ŵaisilaeli wose, achalume ni achakongwe, kila mundu ŵapatile nkate ni chipande cha nyama jejoche ni nkate wakuwanganya ni sabibu.<verse eid="1CH 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 16:4" />Soni ŵasagwile Ŵalawi ŵane aŵe ŵakutumichila paujo pa Lisanduku lya Ambuje Akunnungu kuti ŵaapopelele ni kwaatogolela ni kwaalapa Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵa Isilaeli. <verse eid="1CH 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 16:5" />Ŵaasagwile che Asafu kuŵa chilongola ŵao, achikamuswagwa ni che Sekalia, ni che Yeieli ni che Shemilamoti, che Yehieli, che Metitia ni che Eliabu ni che Benaya ni che Obedi Edomu ni che Yehieli, ŵaasagwile aŵe ŵakugomba inanda ni ing'wenyengw'enye. Che Asafu ŵagombile tugoma twamwana, <verse eid="1CH 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 16:6" />nombe ŵambopesi che Benaya ni che Yahalieli, ŵasagulikwe kuŵa ŵakugomba lipenga pangalechela chitema paujo pa Lisanduku lya Lilangano lya Akunnungu. <verse eid="1CH 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 16:7" />Chindu chaandanda chiŵachitesile che Daudi lyele lyuŵa lyo chaliji kwaapa che Asafu ni achinjakwe Ŵalawi masengo ga kwajimbila Ambuje Akunnungu nyimbo sya kwatogolela.<verse eid="1CH 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyimbo sya kwatogolela Akunnungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="PSA 105:1-15">Sabuli 105:1-15</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 96:1-13">96:1-13</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 106:47-48">106:47-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 16:8" />Mwatogolele Ambuje Akunnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:8">nlilape liina lyakwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:8">mwamanyisye ŵandu ukulu wao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:8">mwasalile ŵandu ŵa ilambo yose indu iyaitesile!<verse eid="1CH 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 16:9" />Mwajimbile ŵelewo, mwajimbile nyimbo sya syakwalapa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:9">nnyisale ipanganyo yakwe yakusimosya!<verse eid="1CH 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 16:10" />Nlikusye liina lyao lyalikukundikwa kwa kwapopelela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:10">Ŵakwachimbichisya Ambuje Akunnungu asangalale.<verse eid="1CH 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 16:11" />Mwajaulilanje Ambuje Akunnungu ŵakwete machili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:11">mwapopelele Ambuje Akunnungu moŵa gose.<verse eid="1CH 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 16:12" />Nkumbuchile ipanganyo yakusimosya iŵaitesile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:12">yakusimonjeka yao ni malamusi gaŵalamwile.<verse eid="1CH 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 16:13" />Ŵanyamwe iŵelesi ya che Abulahamu, jwakutumichila jwao</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:13">ŵanyamwe iŵelesi ya che Yakobo, unsagulikwe ni Ambuje.<verse eid="1CH 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 16:14" />Ŵele ni ŵali Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:14">ulamusi wao uli pachilambo pose.<verse eid="1CH 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 16:15" />Ŵele akulikamulichisya lilangano lyao moŵa gose pangali mbesi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:15">akukwanilisya chilanga chao kwa iŵelesi yejinji.<verse eid="1CH 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 16:16" />Akulikamulichisya lilangano lyaŵatesile ni che Abulahamu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:16">ni chilanga chaŵalumbilile che Isaka.<verse eid="1CH 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 16:17" />Akukwanilisya chilanga chiŵatesile ni che Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:17">ni ku Isialeli chiŵe lilangano lya moŵa gose pangali mbesi.<verse eid="1CH 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 16:18" />Ŵatite, “Chinampe mmwe chilambo cha Kaanani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:18">Tichiŵe chenu mwachimisyene.”<verse eid="1CH 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 16:19" />Pamwaliji nganintupe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:19">elo mwanondipe ni kuŵa achalendo mu chilambo cho,<verse eid="1CH 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 16:20" />Mwajendagajendaga kutyochela liuto li mpaka liuto line,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:20">kutyochela ku umwenye umo mpaka wine,<verse eid="1CH 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 16:21" />Akunnungu ngananlechelela mundu jwalijose kummonelanga ŵanyamwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:21">ŵaajamwiche mamwenye kwaligongo lyao,<verse eid="1CH 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 16:22" />“Ngasimwakwaya ŵandu ŵangu ŵanasagwile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:22">ngasimwaulasya ŵakulondola ŵangu!”<verse eid="1CH 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 16:23" />Mwajimbilanje Ambuje Akunnungu pachilambo pose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:23">Njenesye moŵa gose kwa ŵandu ŵane yakuti atukulupwisye uwe.<verse eid="1CH 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 16:24" />Mwasalile ŵandu ŵa ilambo ukulu wakwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:24">mwasalile ŵandu wose indu yakusimwosya yaakuitenda.<verse eid="1CH 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 16:25" />Pakuŵa Ambuje Akunnungu ali ŵakulu, akulapikwa kwannope</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:25">akuŵajilwa kwajogopa kujipunda minungu jose.<verse eid="1CH 16:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 16:26" />Minungu jose ja ŵandu ŵa ilambo ine jangali chindu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:26">nambo Ambuje Akunnungu ŵagumbile kwinani.<verse eid="1CH 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 16:27" />Ukulu ni lumbili yasyungwile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:27">Machili ni uchimbichimbi ili mmakono mwawo.<verse eid="1CH 16:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 16:28" />Mwape Ambuje Akunnungu luchimbichimbi mwanyamwe ŵandu wose ŵa kila chilambo pachilambo pose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:28">elo, mwalape Ambuje Akunnungu kwa ukulu ni machili gao.<verse eid="1CH 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 16:29" />Mwachimbisye Ambuje Akunnungu ligongo lya ukulu wa lina lyao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:29">nnyiche nao mbopesi sya kutisya ni njinjile mu nyuumba jao.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:29">Mwapopelele Ambuje Akunnungu pamalo pakwe pakukundikwa kwa kwapopelela.<verse eid="1CH 16:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 16:30" />Ŵandu ŵa chilambo chose; ntetemele paujo pakwe!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:30">Achilimbikesye chilambo, ngachitinganyika.<verse eid="1CH 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 16:31" />Kwinani ni chilambo isengwe!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:31">Ŵandu papali pose pa chilambo asaleje kuti, “Ambuje Akunnungu akutawala!”<verse eid="1CH 16:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 16:32" />Bahali ni indu yose yaigumbikwe yaili mwelemo yalape ŵelewo!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:32">migunda ni indu yose yaili mwelemo isangalale,<verse eid="1CH 16:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 16:33" />itela yose mwikonde tiijimbe ichisengwaga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:33">katema Ambuje Akunnungu pachaiche kwalamula ŵandu pachilambo.<verse eid="1CH 16:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 16:34" />Mwaatogolele Ambuje Akunnungu pakuŵa ali ŵambone,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:34">unonyelo ŵakwe ukutamilisya moŵa gose pangali mbesi!<verse eid="1CH 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 16:35" />Mwasalile Ambuje Akunnungu, “Ntukulupusye, alakwe Akunnungu ŵa ukulupusyo wetu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:35">ntusonganganye pamo kutyochela ku ilambo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:35">kuti tukombole kulitogolela lina lyenu lyalikukundikwa kwa kwapopelela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:35">tulole ukulu ni yankuti kulapikwa.”<verse eid="1CH 16:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 16:36" />Alapikwe Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵa ku Isilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="1CH 16:36">kutandilila moŵa gose pangali mbesi ni moŵa gose pangali mbesi!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1CH 16:36" />
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 16:36">Nipele ŵandu wose ŵatite “Elo!” Sooni ŵalapile Ambuje Akunnungu.<verse eid="1CH 16:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kupopela ku Yelusalemu ni ku Gibeoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 16:37" />Kwayele, mwenye che Daudi ŵaalesile che Asafu ni Ŵalawi achinjakwe pamalo paŵaliŵisile Lisanduku lya Lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu kwaligongo lya masengo gagakusachilwa gapanganyikwe paujo pa Lisanduku kila lyuŵa. <verse eid="1CH 16:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 16:38" />Che Obedi Edomu, mwanache ju che Yedusuni, pamo ni achinjakwe sitini ni nane ŵaakamwisye. Che Obed Edomu mwanagwao che Yedusuni ni che Osea ŵaliji ŵakulindilila nnango wekulungwa.<verse eid="1CH 16:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 16:39" />Mwenye che Daudi ŵaŵisile jwambopesi che Sadoki ni ŵambopesi achinjakwe aŵe ŵakutumichila mu Lisakasa lya Ambuje Akunnungu lilyaliji pa malo pakwapopelela Akunnungu kwele ku Gibeoni ko, <verse eid="1CH 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 16:40" />kuti ŵaapelechele Ambuje Akunnungu mbopesi sya kutinisya pachanya chilisa cha mbopesi sya kutinisya moŵa gose pangali mbesi kundaŵi ni ligulo, imo ni yose yailembekwe mmalamusi ga Ambuje Akunnungu gaŵalamulile Ŵaisilaeli. <verse eid="1CH 16:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 16:41" />Ŵaŵapanganyisye masengo pamo ni ŵanyao ŵaliji che Emani ni che Yedusuni ni aŵala wose uŵasagulikwe ni kukolanjikwa meena, kuti ŵaatogolele Ambuje Akunnungu pakuŵa unonyelo wao wangagalauka. <verse eid="1CH 16:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 16:42" />Che Emani ni che Yedusuni ŵaliji ni masengo ga kugomba imbeta, ni tugoma twamwana ni kugomba yombo ine ligongo lya nyimbo sya kwalapa Akunnungu. Ŵanache ŵa che Yedusuni ŵasagulikwe kulindilila pannango.<verse eid="1CH 16:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 16:43" />Nipele, ŵandu wose ŵatyosile ni kwaula kumangwawo, nombe che Daudi ŵapite kumangwawo kukwaapa upile ŵamu nyuumba jakwe.<verse eid="1CH 16:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="1CH 17" />
  <para style="s">Utenga wa che Natani ku che Daudi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 7:1-17">2 Samweli 7:1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 17:1" />Mwenye che Daudi paŵatamaga mu likome lya umwenye, lyuŵa limo ŵansalile jwakulondola che Natani, “Nnole, une ngutama mu nyuumba jakusalala jajitawikwe ni itela ya mielezi, nambo Lisanduku lya Lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu likutama mu lisakasa.”<verse eid="1CH 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 17:2" />Che Natani ŵaasalile che Daudi, “Ntende chachili chose chinkuchiganisya muntima mwenu, pakuŵa Akunnungu ali pamo ni mmwe.”<verse eid="1CH 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 17:3" />Nambo chilo pechila, liloŵe lya Ambuje Akunnungu lyannyichilile che Natani, kuti, <verse eid="1CH 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 17:4" />“Njaule nkaasalile jwakutumichila jwangu che Daudi, Ambuje Akunnungu akuti nnyi, ‘Mmwe ngamuundawila nyuumba jakuti ndame mwelemo. <verse eid="1CH 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 17:5" />Kutandilila katema kanalongwesye ŵaisilaeli atyoche ku Misili mpaka lelojino, nganindame mu nyuumba. Naliji jwakusamasama kutyochela mu lisakasa limo mpaka lisakasa line, ni kutyochela malo jimo mpaka malo jine. <verse eid="1CH 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 17:6" />Uli, palipose panaapite ni Ŵaisilaeli, naausisye ŵakulamula ŵao ŵaaliwose ŵanalajisye ŵaagose ŵandu ŵangu, kwachichi nganimuundaŵila nyuumba ja itela ya mielezi?’ ”<verse eid="1CH 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 17:7" />“Kwayele munsalile jwakutumichila jwangu che Daudi kuti, Ambuje Akunnungu ŵa machili gose akuti nnyi ‘Nantyosisye mwitinji kumwachingaga ngondolo, kuti mme jwankulu jwa ŵandu ŵangu Ŵaisilaeli. <verse eid="1CH 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 17:8" />Kutandilila katema ko mele pamo ni mmwe kulikose kumwajawile ni naauleje ŵammagongo ŵenu wose paujo penu. Tinantende mme jwakumanyika mpela achakulu ŵane ŵapachilambo pano. <verse eid="1CH 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 17:9" />None tinaasagulile ŵandu ŵangu Ŵaisilaeli pamalo pakutama, ni tinjatamika kweleko kuti akole malo gawogawope gakutama pangali ŵakwasausya sooni. Ni ŵandu ŵakakatima ntima ŵakutumia machili ngasiŵaalagasya sooni nti kuundanda po, <verse eid="1CH 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 17:10" />kutandilila katema panaasagwile ilongola kwaligongo lya ŵandu ŵangu Ŵaisilaeli, une tinankulupusye ni ŵammagongo ŵenu wose. Kupunda ni yeleyo, une Ambuje Akunnungu nguntangachisya kuti tinantaŵile nyuumba. <verse eid="1CH 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 17:11" />Ndaŵi jitinchiwa, ni pitachinsika mmalembe ga achatati ŵenu, jumo jwa ŵanache ŵenu jutimummeleche mmwe mwasyene tinjintenda mwenye pamalo penu, ni une tinjiulimbikasya umwenye wakwe. <verse eid="1CH 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 17:12" />Jwelejo ni jutachitaŵa nyuumba kwaligongo lya liina lyangu ni chitengu chakwe cha umwenye tinjichilimbisya moŵa gose pangali mbesi. <verse eid="1CH 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 17:13" />Une tinjiŵa atatigwe, nombejo tachiŵa mwanangu; nambo ngasinautyosya unonyelo wangu kukwakwe mpela inatite kuutyosya ku che Shauli mwenye juŵannongolele. <verse eid="1CH 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 17:14" />Nambo tinjintamika mu nyuumba jangu ni umwenye wangu tiuŵe wa moŵa gose pangali mbesi, ni chitengu chakwe cha umwenye tichipunde kulimbangana.’ ”<verse eid="1CH 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 17:15" />Jwakulondola che Natani ŵaasalile che Daudi indu yose malinga iyatite kuunukula Akunnungu.<verse eid="1CH 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mapopelelo ga che Daudi ga kwatogolela Akunnungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 7:18-29">2 Samweli 7:18-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 17:16" />Nipele mwenye che Daudi ŵajinjile mu lisakasa ni kutama paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu, ni kupopelela achitiji, “Alakwe Akunnungu, uneji nduni ni uŵelesi wangu ali ŵani kwampaka muundendele yeleyo yose? <verse eid="1CH 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 17:17" />Pakonjechesya yeleyo, muundendele ine yejinji, mumichile chilanga kwa iŵelesi yangu ya mmbujo alakwe Ambuje Akunnungu! <verse eid="1CH 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 17:18" />Nansalile chichi chakupunda, uneji che Daudi jwakutumichila jwenu, kwa kunjimbikasya kwanti yele? Alakwe muumanyi une jwakutumichila jwenu. <verse eid="1CH 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 17:19" />Alakwe Ambuje Akunnungu, kwaligongo lya jwakutumichila jwenu ni malinga ni usache wenu, ntesile chindu chachikulungwa chi, kuti imanyiche ipanganyo yekulu yose. <verse eid="1CH 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 17:20" />Pangali jwine mpela mmwe, alakwe Ambuje Akunnungu, ni yatukuipikana yose ikulosya kuti pangali Akunnungu ŵane nambo mmwemwe pe. <verse eid="1CH 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 17:21" />Sooni ŵandu chi pachilambo pa ŵaali mpela ŵandu ŵenu Ŵaisilaeli, ŵanyawo pe Akunnungu ni umwakulupwisye kuti aŵe ŵandu ŵenu? Alakwe mwalikusisye liina lyenu mwasyene kwa kupanganya indu yekulungwa ni yakusimosya pamwatopwele ŵandu ŵa ilambo ine paujo pa ŵandu ŵenu umwakopwesye kutyochela ku Misili. <verse eid="1CH 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 17:22" />Mwatesile ŵandu ŵenu Ŵaisilaeli aŵe ŵandu ŵenu moŵa gose pangali mbesi, Nombe alakwe Ambuje Akunnungu, mmele Akunnungu ŵao.”<verse eid="1CH 17:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 17:23" />“Nipele sano, alakwe Ambuje Akunnungu, nlilimbikasye liloŵe lyenu limmechete moŵa gose pangali mbesi kuung'amba une jwakutumichila jwenu ni nkati achalongo ŵangu. <verse eid="1CH 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 17:24" />Ni liina lyenu chiliŵe lyekulu moŵa gose pangali mbesi, nombe ŵandu tajile kuti, ‘Ambuje Akunnungu ŵa machili gose, Akunnungu ŵa ku Isilaeli, elo ali Akunnungu pa Isilaeli!’ Ni achalongo ŵangu, uneji che Daudi jwakutumichila jwenu, tijilimbangane paujo penu. <verse eid="1CH 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 17:25" />Pakuŵa alakwe Akunnungu ŵangu, muumunukulile une jwakutumichila jwenu kuti uŵelesi wangu tachiŵa mamwenye. Nipele une jwakutumichila jwenu ngupopela mwakulimbangana. <verse eid="1CH 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 17:26" />Sambano alakwe Ambuje Akunnungu, alakwe nli Akunnungu, muunanjile une jwakutumichila jwenu, chelechi chindu chambone chi. <verse eid="1CH 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 17:27" />Kwayele nkundile kwapa upile ŵandu ŵamu nyuumba jangu, une jwakutumichila jwenu, kuti jitamilisye moŵa gose pangali mbesi paujo penu, pakuŵa chinkuchipa upile alakwe, chikuŵa ni upile moŵa gose pangali mbesi.”<verse eid="1CH 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="1CH 18" />
  <para style="s">Che Daudi akupunda ku ngondo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 8:1-18">2 Samweli 8:1-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 18:1" />Pakumala yele, mwenye che Daudi ŵaaputile Ŵafilisiti ni kwapunda. Ŵausumwile musi wa ku Gati pamo ni misinda jijasungwile. <verse eid="1CH 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 18:2" />Sooni ŵaapundile Ŵamoabu, nipele Ŵamoabu wo ŵaliji ŵakutumichila ŵa che Daudi ni ŵapelekaga nsongo.<verse eid="1CH 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 18:3" />Sooni che Daudi ŵampundile che Hadadeseli mwenye jwa ku Soba, chilambo chachiŵandikene ni chilambo cha ku Hamati, katema che Hadadeseli paŵajaulaga kuulimbisya utawala. <verse eid="1CH 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 18:4" />Che Daudi ŵansumwile che Hadadeseli mutuka elufu moja, syasikuutambula ni falasi ni ŵangondo elufu saba ŵakwela mu falasi ni ŵangondo ŵakwenda paasi elufu ishilini. Nipele che Daudi ŵakatile mitasi ja makongolo ga kuunyuma ga falasi syose syasikukwekwelemya muutuka sya falasi nambo ŵasisigesye mia moja.<verse eid="1CH 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 18:5" />Nombe Ŵaalamu ŵa ku Damesiki, paŵajawile kukwakamusisya Hadadeseli mwenye jwa ku Soba kuputana ngondo, che Daudi ŵaagunguluchile ni kwaulaga ŵandu elufu ishilini na mbili. <verse eid="1CH 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 18:6" />Sooni che Daudi ŵaŵisile igono ya ŵangondo ku musi wa ku Shamu ja ku Damasiko. Nipele Ŵaalamu ŵaliji ŵakutumichila ŵakwe, ni ŵaliji nkulipa nsongo. Ambuje Akunnungu ŵatendesye che Daudi apunde kwakuli kose kuŵajaulaga. <verse eid="1CH 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 18:7" />Che Daudi ŵaasumwile yakulisiŵila pantima ya madini ga sahabu iŵaijigele ŵangondo ŵa mwenye che Adadeseli, ni kuijausya ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="1CH 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 18:8" />Che Daudi ŵajigele nombe madini ga shaba gamajinji, shaba kutyochela musi wa ku Tibati ni musi wa Kuni jijaliji misi ja mwenye che Adadeseli. Kanyuma che Selemani ŵatumie shaba jo kolochesya nkambo ni njanamila syakwe ni yombo ine ya mu nyuumba ja Akunnungu.<verse eid="1CH 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 18:9" />Che Tou, mwenye jwa ku Hamati paŵapilikene kuti che Daudi ŵaputile ni kujipunda mipingo ja ŵangondo ŵa che Hadadeseli mwenye jwa ku Soba, <verse eid="1CH 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 18:10" />ŵannajisye che Hadolamu nchanda jwakwe ajaule kwa mwenye che Daudi, akaakomasye ni kwalapa ligongo ŵaputile che Hadadeseli ni kwapunda. Pakuŵa che Adadeseli ŵaputene kakajinji ni che Tou. Che Hadolamu ŵanjauchisye che Daudi ntuuka ŵa yombo ya madini ga feza, ni sahabu ni shaba. <verse eid="1CH 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 18:11" />Mwenye che Daudi ŵapeleche mituuka jo kwa Ambuje Akunnungu pamo ni madini ga feza ni sahabu, gaŵagajigele kutyochela ku ilambo ya ku Edomu ni ku Moabu ni ku Amoni ni ku Filisiti ni ku Amaleki.<verse eid="1CH 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 18:12" />Che Abishai mwanache ju Seluya, ŵaauleje Ŵaedomu elufu kumi na nane ku Lichemba lya Njete. <verse eid="1CH 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 18:13" />Nipele ŵaŵisile igono ya mipingo ja ŵangondo kwele ku Edomu ko. Nombe Ŵaedomu wose ŵaliji ŵakutumichila ŵa che Daudi. Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaatendekasisye che Daudi apunde kosekose kuŵajawile.<verse eid="1CH 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 18:14" />Kwayele che Daudi ŵatawele chilambo chosepe cha ku Isilaeli, pangali lusagu, sooni kwa kulungamika. <verse eid="1CH 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 18:15" />Che Yoabu, mwanache jwa che Seluya ŵaaliji jwankulu jwa mipingo ja ŵangondo wose; che Yehoshafati mwanache jwa che Ahiludi ŵaliji ŵakugosa ikumbuchisyo, <verse eid="1CH 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 18:16" />che Sadoki, mwanache jwa che Ahitubu ni che Abimeleki mwanache jwa che Abiasali ŵalinji ŵambopesi ni che Shausha ŵaliji jwakulemba. <verse eid="1CH 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 18:17" />Nombe che Benaya mwanache jwa che Yehoyada ŵaajimilile ŵakulindilila ŵa mwenye che Daudi ŵaŵaliji ŵa lukosyo lwa Ŵakeleti ni Ŵapeleti, ŵanache ŵa che Daudi ŵaaliji maofisa achakulu mu utawala wakwe.<verse eid="1CH 18:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="1CH 19" />
  <para style="s">Che Daudi akwapunda Ŵaamoni ni Ŵaalamu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 10:1-19">2 Samweli 10:1-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 19:1" />Pagapite moŵa che Nahashi, mwenye jwa Ŵaamoni ŵawile, nombe mwanache jwakwe ni ŵatawele pamalo pakwe. <verse eid="1CH 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 19:2" />Nipele, che Daudi ŵatite, “Une chinantendele yambone che Hanuni mwanache jwa che Nahashi, pakuŵa atatigwe ŵaandendele yambone nombe.” Kwayele che Daudi ŵaalajisye ŵandu ajaule akaatulasye ntima kwaligongo lya chiwa cha atatigwe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 19:2">Nombe ŵanyawo ŵapite ku che Anuni ku chilambo cha Ŵaamoni kukwatulasya ntima che Hanuni. <verse eid="1CH 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 19:3" />Nambo ilongola ŵa Ŵaamoni ŵansalile mwenye, “Uli, nkuganisya kuti ligongo lya kusichila kwa atati ŵenu che Daudi ŵaatumile ŵandu ŵa kukuntulasya ntima? Uli ŵanduŵa nganaika kukuchiuchilichisya chilambo kuti akombole kuchijigala?”<verse eid="1CH 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 19:4" />Nipele che Hanuni ŵaajigele ŵandu ŵa che Daudi wo, ŵaamyosile ndeu ni kupapula iwalo yao pambindikati mpaka mmapuluputu, nipele ŵaatopwele ajaule. <verse eid="1CH 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 19:5" />Ŵantenga wo yaatesile soni kuuja kumangwao. Che Daudi paŵapilikene iyatendekweyo ŵatumile ŵandu kuti akaachingamile ni kwasalila kuti ŵaasalile, atamanje ku musi wa Yeliko mpaka pachiimele ndeu syawo, pele aujeje.<verse eid="1CH 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 19:6" />Mwenye che Hanuni ni Ŵaamoni ŵamanyilile kuti apanganyisye yakuŵengana ni che Daudi, nipele mwenye che Anuni ni Ŵaamoni ŵaalajisye ŵandu apeleche ipande elufu nne ya madini ga fedha kuti akakodi mutuka ni ŵakukwela falasi kutyochela ku Mesopotamia, ni ku Alamaaka ni ku Soba. <verse eid="1CH 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 19:7" />Ŵakodishe mutuka sya ngondo elufu salasini na mbili ni mwenye jwa ku Maaka ni ŵangondo, ŵaiche ni kuŵika chigono chiŵandi ni ku Medeba. Ŵaamoni nombe ŵasongangene kutyochela ku misi jao jose, ŵaliŵisile chile kwa ngondo.<verse eid="1CH 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 19:8" />Nombe che Daudi paŵapilikene ngani syo ŵantumile che Yoabu ni mpingo wa ŵangondo wose ŵaali ni machili. <verse eid="1CH 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 19:9" />Ŵaamoni ŵajawile ni ŵalipanjile nsitali pa nnango wakwinjili mmusi, ni mamwenye ŵaŵaiche ŵala ŵaliji achinsyenepe pakulanguka.<verse eid="1CH 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 19:10" />Nipele che Yoabu paiŵaweni ŵammagongo ŵakwe ajimi chammbujo ni chakunyuma kwakwe, ŵaasagwile ŵangondo ŵakwete machili ŵa chi Isilaeli, nipele ŵaŵisile chile kuputana ni Ŵaalamu. <verse eid="1CH 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 19:11" />Ŵakuputana ngondo ŵane uŵasigele ŵala, ŵaŵisile paasi pa che Abishai mpwao, nombe ŵaaŵisile chile kuti akuputane ngondo ni Ŵaamoni. <verse eid="1CH 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 19:12" />Che Yoabu ŵasalile che Abishai, “Naga Ŵaalamu chaambunde machili, chimungamusye, nambo iŵaga Waamoni champunde machili, chinyiche kukunkamusya. <verse eid="1CH 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 19:13" />Nipele nkangamale! Tuputane kwakulimbangana kwaligongo lya kwachenjela ŵandu ŵetu, ni kwaligongo lya misi ja Akunnungu ŵetu; ni Ambuje Akunnungu atutendele yakuiwona ili yambone kukwakwe.”<verse eid="1CH 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 19:14" />Nipele, che Yoabu ni ŵandu ŵakwe ŵajendelechele mbujo kukuputana ngondo ni Ŵaalamu, nombe Ŵaalamu wo ŵautwiche. <verse eid="1CH 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 19:15" />Ŵaamoni paŵaiweni kuti Ŵaalamu autwiche, nombewo ŵammutwiche che Abishai, mpwakwe che Yoabu, ŵajinjile mmusi. Nombe che Yoabu ŵausile ku Yelusalemu.<verse eid="1CH 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 19:16" />Nambo Ŵaalamu paŵaiweni kuti Ŵaisilaeli ŵaapundile, ŵaalajisye ŵantenga ajaule akaajigale Ŵaalamu ŵane uŵatamaga peesi ja lusulo lwa Eufulate, pamo ni che Shobaki, chilongola jwankulu jwa ŵangondo ŵa mwenye che Adadeseli ŵaalongwesye. <verse eid="1CH 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 19:17" />Che Daudi paŵapilikene ngani jo, ŵaasongangenye pamo Ŵaisilaeli wose, ŵajombweche lusulo lwa Yolodani, ŵaajaulile, ŵaŵisile chile ŵangondo ŵakwe kuti aputane ngondo. Che Daudi paŵapanjile misitali kuti aputane ni Ŵaalamu, nombe Ŵaalamu wo ŵaputene nawo. <verse eid="1CH 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 19:18" />Nambo Ŵaalamu ŵaautwiche Ŵaisilaeli. Che Daudi ŵauleje Ŵaalamu ŵakwendesya mutuka elufu saba ni ŵangondo ŵaakwenda wa makongolo elufu alobaini. Sooni ŵammuleje che Shobaki, chilongola jwankulu jwa mpingo wa ŵangondo ŵao. <verse eid="1CH 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 19:19" />Nipele ŵakutumichila ŵa mwenye che Adadeseli paŵaŵeni kuti aputikwe ni Ŵaisilaeli, ŵatesile ujilano wa chitendewele ni che Daudi ni ŵaliji ŵakutumichila ŵa che Daudi. Kwayele Ŵaalamu nganakunda kwakamusya Ŵaamoni sooni.<verse eid="1CH 19:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="1CH 20" />
  <para style="s">Che Daudi akusumula nsinda wa ku Laba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 12:26-31">2 Samweli 12:26-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 20:1" />Kuundanda kwa chaka champya, katema mamwenye paakwaulaga kungondo, che Yoabu ŵaalongwesye mpingo wa ŵangondo ni kusumula chilambo cha Ŵaamoni, sooni ŵajawile ku Laba ni kuusyungula musi wo pamo ni mpingo wakwe wa ŵangondo, ŵaugungumuchile ni kuujonanga, nambo che Daudi ŵasigele ku Yelusalemu ko. <verse eid="1CH 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 20:2" />Nombe che Daudi ŵajigele chindu mpela singwa kutyochela pantwe pa che Milikomu nnungu jwao, nombejo ŵamanyilile kuti chindu mpela singwa cho utopele wakwe waliji kilo selasini na tano sya sahabu ni mu chelecho mwaliji ni madini ga ndalama jekulungwa nnope. Che Daudi ŵaŵisile chindu mpela singwa cho pantwe wakwe. Sooni, ŵajigele indu yejinji kutyochela mmusi wo. <verse eid="1CH 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 20:3" />Sooni ŵaajigele ŵandu ŵa musi wo, ni ŵaaŵisile apanganye masengo kwa kukamula misumeno ni sululu ni maŵago ga chisyano. Yeyeyo ni iŵaitesile che Daudi ku misi jose ja Ŵaamoni. Mbesi jakwe che Daudi ni ŵandu wose ŵausile ku Yelusalemu.<verse eid="1CH 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Daudi akuputana ngondo makammandu ku Filisiti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 21:15-22">2 Samweli 21:15-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 20:4" />Pakumala yeleyo, kwatyochele ngondo ni Ŵafilisiti kwele ku Geseli ko. Che Sibekai jwa kutyochela ku Hushahi, ŵammuleje chikammundu juŵaŵilanjikwe che Sipai juŵaliji jumo jwa uŵelesi wa Ŵalefai, kwayele Ŵafilisiti wo ŵaputikwe.<verse eid="1CH 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 20:5" />Jakopochele sooni ngondo ni Ŵafilisiti. Nombe che Elihanani mwanache ju che Yaili ŵammuleje che Lahimi juŵaliji mpwakwe che Goliati jwa ku Giti, jweleju chikumbu cha mpamba wakwe chaliji chekulungwa mpela mpini wa lijela.<verse eid="1CH 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 20:6" />Sooni jakopochele ngondo kwele ku Gati ko, jwapali chikammundu jumo juŵaliji ni yala sita kila nkono, ni yala sita kila lukongolo, kwayele chikammundu jo jwakwete yala ishilini na nne. Jwelejo nombe jwaliji jwa uŵelesi wa makammandu. <verse eid="1CH 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 20:7" />Mundu jo paŵaatukene Ŵaisilaeli, che Yonatani, mwanache ju che Shimea, mpwakwe che Daudi, ŵammuleje.<verse eid="1CH 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 20:8" />Ŵanyawo ŵaliji ŵa uŵelesi wa Ŵalefai, makammandu ga ku Gati ko, nombe ŵanyawo ŵaulajikwe ni che Daudi pamo ni ŵakutumichila ŵakwe.<verse eid="1CH 20:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="1CH 21" />
  <para style="s">Che Daudi akwaŵalanga ŵandu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="2SA 24:1-25">2 Samweli 24:1-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 21:1" />Achisoka ŵakopochele kuti ŵaalagasye Ŵaisilaeli, ŵaanyenjile che Daudi kuti ŵaaŵalanje ŵandu. <verse eid="1CH 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 21:2" />Kwayele, che Daudi ŵaasalile che Yoabu ni aŵala achakulu ŵane ŵa mipingi ja ŵangondo, “Njaule nkaaŵalanje Ŵaisilaeli, kutandulila ku Beli Sheba mpaka ku Dani. Nipele nyicheje kumuusalile kuti naimanye alinji ŵalingwa.”<verse eid="1CH 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 21:3" />Nambo che Yoabu ŵatite, “Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaajonjechesye Ŵaisilaeli ni ŵaachuluye nnope kupunda yatite sambanojino! Nambo alakwe mwenye ŵangu, ana ŵanyaŵa wose nganaŵa ŵakutumichila ŵenu? Kwachichi nkusaka kupanganya indu ichiyaleŵekasye Ŵaisilaeli?” <verse eid="1CH 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 21:4" />Nambo chaŵechete mwenye chaliji ni machili kwannope kwa che Yoabu. Kwayele, che Yoabu ŵatyosile ŵajawile ku chilambo chose cha ku Isilaeli, nipele ŵausile ku Yelusalemu. <verse eid="1CH 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 21:5" />Che Yoabu ŵapeleche chiŵalanjilo chose kwa mwenye che Daudi. Ku chilambo cha Isilaeli ŵapali achalume milioni moja na laki moja, ŵaakukombola kuputana ngondo, ni ku Yuda ŵapali achalume laki nne na elufu sabini ŵaakukombola kuputana ngondo. <verse eid="1CH 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 21:6" />Nambo che Yoabu nganiŵaŵalanga Ŵalawi ni Ŵabenyamini, ligongo malajisyo ga mwenye gaachimikasisye kwannope.<verse eid="1CH 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 21:7" />Akunnungu ngananonyelwa ni chele chindu cho, kwayele ŵajamwiche Ŵaisilaeli. <verse eid="1CH 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 21:8" />Che Daudi ŵasalile Akunnungu, “Ndesile sambi jekulungwa kwa chele chindu chindesile chi! Nambo chonde munechelesye uneji jwakutumichila jwenu, pakuŵa ndesile yakuloŵela kwa nnope.”<verse eid="1CH 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 21:9" />Nipele, Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaasalile che Gadi, jwakulondola jwa che Daudi, kuti, <verse eid="1CH 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 21:10" />“Njaule nkaasalile che Daudi kuti une Ambuje Akunnungu ngwapa indu itatu. Asagule chimo chakwe chichinaatendele.”<verse eid="1CH 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 21:11" />Kwayele che Gadi ŵanjaulile che Daudi ni kwasalila, “Ambuje Akunnungu akuti nsagule chindu chimo, <verse eid="1CH 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 21:12" />yaka itatu ya sala, pane myesi jitatu ja kuputikwa ni ŵammagongo ŵenu, pane moŵa gatatu Ambuje Akunnungu anjonanje kwa kunnyichisya ilwele yakogoya pa chilambo, ni katumetume jwakwe jwa kwinani ajaule akaajonanje ŵandu pa chilambo chose cha ku Isilaeli. Sambano nsagule, ngaajanje chinauli ŵandumile ŵala?”<verse eid="1CH 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 21:13" />Che Daudi ŵaajanjile che Gadi, “Ngwete lipamba nnope! mbaya anyamuche Ambuje Akunnungu pakuwa ŵelewo akwete chanasa nnope. Nambo ngangusaka kwamukwa ni ŵandu.”<verse eid="1CH 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 21:14" />Nipele, Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaapelechele Ŵaisilaeli ulwele wakogoya, ni Ŵaisilaeli elufu sabini ŵawile. <verse eid="1CH 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 21:15" />Sooni Akunnungu ŵannajisye katumetume jwa kwinani ajaule kukuujonanga musi wa ku Yelusalemu, nambo paŵaŵandichile kupanganya yeleyo, Ambuje Akunnungu ŵagalawisye nningwa wakwe, ni kunsalila katumetume juŵajonangaga ŵandu jo kuti, “Ikwanile!” Katumetume jwa kwinani ŵaajimi chiŵandi ni luŵala lwakuputukulila ngano lwa che Alauna Myebusi.<verse eid="1CH 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 21:16" />Che Daudi ŵalolite, ŵammweni katumetume jwa kwinani jwa Ambuje Akunnungu jo ali ajimi pasikati ja liunde ni lisi, nombejo aulosisye upanga wakwe cha ku Yelusalemu ali chile aujonanje. Pelepo che Daudi ni achachekulu ali ŵawete magunia, ŵagonile maanguku paasi. <verse eid="1CH 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 21:17" />Che Daudi ŵasalile Akunnungu, “Ana, une ngaŵa ni junalajisye kuti ŵandu aŵalanjikwe? Ni une ni junaatesile sambi ni maleŵa ga. Nambo ŵandu ŵa aleŵile chichi? Ngunchondelela, alakwe Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵangu, mungulupusye une pamo ni achalongo ŵangu, choonde au ulwele wakogoya wu waŵambale ŵandu ŵenu.”<verse eid="1CH 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 21:18" />Nipele katumetume jwa kwinani ŵalajisye che Gadi ŵasalile che Daudi ajaule akaataŵile chilisa Ambuje Akunnungu paluŵala lwakukuŵitila ngano lwa che Alauna Myebusi. <verse eid="1CH 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 21:19" />Che Daudi ŵajitichisye malajisyo ga Ambuje Akunnungu, ŵajawile mpela iŵatite kusalilwa ni che Gadi. <verse eid="1CH 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 21:20" />Che Alauna paŵagalawiche ni kunnola katumetume jwa kwinani jula, nipele jwelejo ni achiŵanagwe ncheche ŵaŵaliji pamo nawo ŵalijuŵile. Nombe che Alauna ŵaliji nkuputukula ngano. <verse eid="1CH 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 21:21" />Papopo che Alauna ŵammweni che Daudi ali nkwika, ni ŵaachingamile ni ŵatindiŵele ni kwakotamila mpaka paasi. <verse eid="1CH 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 21:22" />Che Daudi ŵasalile che Alauna, “Mumbe luŵala lwenu lwa kuputukulila ngano kuti naataŵile Ambuje Akunnungu chilisa. Tinampe ntengo wemalile kuti ulwele wa tauni umale.”<verse eid="1CH 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 21:23" />Nombe che Alauna ŵaasalile che Daudi, “Njigale luŵala lu, ambuje ŵangu mwenye, Ambuje atendeleje yakusaka ansyene. Nnole ngutyosya mikambaku ja ng'ombe kwa ligongo lya mbopesi sya kutinisya, ni indu ya kuputukulila iŵe sasu, pamo ni ngano siŵe mbopesi sya yakulya. Yoseyo ngumpa.”<verse eid="1CH 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 21:24" />Nambo mwenye che Daudi ŵaasalile che Alauna, “Ngwamba! Tinjisuma kwa malipilo gakumalila. Ngangwapa Ambuje Akunnungu chindu chachili chenu pane kwapelechela mbopesi sya kutinisya syanganimbanganyichisya masengo.” <verse eid="1CH 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 21:25" />Kwayele, che Daudi ŵaalipile che Alauna kwa kwapimila shekeli mia sita sya sahabu kulipila luŵala lo. <verse eid="1CH 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 21:26" />Nipele che Daudi ŵaataŵile chilisa Ambuje Akunnungu pamalo po ni kwatochesya mbopesi sya kutinisya ni sya chitendewele. Ŵapopelele Ambuje Akunnungu, nombewo ŵajitichisye lipopelo lyakwe kwa kuichisya moto kutyochela kwinani ni kujitinisya ajila mbopesi pachilisa.<verse eid="1CH 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 21:27" />Nipele, Ambuje Akunnungu ŵannamwile katumetume jwa kwinani jwa Akunnungu, nombejo ŵausisye sooni upanga mwigonele mwakwe. <verse eid="1CH 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 21:28" />Katema, che Daudi paŵaiweni kuti Ambuje Akunnungu ajitichisye lipopelo lyakwe paluŵala lwa kuputukulila ngano lwa che Alauna Myebusi, ŵapeleche mbopesi syakutinisya papopo. <verse eid="1CH 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 21:29" />Lisakasa lya Ambuje Akunnungu lilyataŵikwe ni che Musa ku ukweti, ni chilisa cha kupelechela mbopesi sya kutinisya, katema ko syaliji chiŵela sili pa malo pa kupopelela ku Gibeoni ko. <verse eid="1CH 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 21:30" />Nambo che Daudi nganakombola kwaula kweleko kukwausya Akunnungu, pakuŵa ŵaujogopaga upanga wa katumetume jwa kwinani jwa Ambuje Akunnungu.<verse eid="1CH 21:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="1CH 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 22:1" />Nipele che Daudi ŵatite, “Nyuumba ja Ambuje Akunnungu tijiŵe pamalo pa, ni sooni chilisa chakupelechela mbopesi jakutinisya cha Ŵaisilaeli.”<verse eid="1CH 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuŵika chile pakutaŵa Nyuumba ja Ambuje Akunnungu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 22:2" />Nipele, che Daudi ŵalamwile kuti achalendo uŵatamaga pa chilambo cha ku Isilaeli asongangane, ni ŵapele masengo ga kupanganya. Ŵasagwile ŵaumanyilisi wa kutaŵa majumba kuti asepe yambone maganga ga kutaŵila nyumba ja Akunnungu. <verse eid="1CH 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 22:3" />Nombe che Daudi ŵatyosisye isyano yejinji ya kukolosesya nyuumba jo pamo ni misumali ni iugalilo ya mmilango ja nyumba, ni shaba syejinji syangapimika. <verse eid="1CH 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 22:4" />Sooni ŵatyosisye mbao sya mielesi syangaŵalanjikwa, pakuŵa Ŵasidoni ni ŵandu ŵa ku Tilo ŵannyichisye che Daudi mbao syejinji nnope. <verse eid="1CH 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 22:5" />Che Daudi ŵalisalile muntima mwao, “Mwanangu che Selemani bado nganakule ni nganasyoŵelele. Nyuumba jitajitaŵe kwa ligongo lya Ambuje Akunnungu jikusachilwa jiŵe jakusalala nnope, ni jakulapikwa ni pachilambo pose. Kwayele tinjalinganyichisya.” Che Daudi ŵalinganyisye chile akanaŵe kuwa.<verse eid="1CH 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 22:6" />Nipele che Daudi ŵammilasile che Selemani mwanagwao, ŵannajisye ŵataŵile nyumba Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵa ku Isilaeli. <verse eid="1CH 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 22:7" />Che Daudi ŵansalile che Selemani, “Mwanangu, chinduchi chaliji muntima mwangu, kwataŵila nyumba Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵangu kuti napopelele. <verse eid="1CH 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 22:8" />Nambo Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaasalile une, ‘Mmwe mmuleje ŵandu achajinji kwa kuputana ngondo jekulungwa, mmwe ngamundawila nyumba pakuŵa mmuleje ŵandu achajinji paujo pangu pachilambo pa. <verse eid="1CH 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 22:9" />Namose yeleyo, chinkole mwanache, jutachiŵa jwachitendewele ligongo une chinampe chitendewele paujo pa ŵammagongo ŵakwe ŵaali kosekosepe. Lina lyakwe chaŵilanjikwe che Selemani, pakuŵa chinjapa Ŵaisilaeli chitendewele ni kutulala mmoŵa ga utawala wakwe. <verse eid="1CH 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 22:10" />Ŵelewo ni utachindaŵila une nyuumba. Chaŵe mwanache jwangu none chime atatigwe, ni uŵelesi wakwe chiutawale Isilaeli moŵa gose pangali mbesi.’ ”<verse eid="1CH 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 22:11" />Che Daudi ŵajendelechele kusala, “Sambano mwanangu, Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu aŵe pamo ni mmwe kuti nkombole kwataŵila nyuumba mpela yatite kunsalila. <verse eid="1CH 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 22:12" />Ambuje Akunnungu ampe lunda ni umanyilisi, katema patachimmika kuŵa chilongola jwa Ŵaisilaeli, njitichisye malajisyo gao Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu. <verse eid="1CH 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 22:13" />Mwalilolechesyaga pa kutenda indu, ni mwakamulisyaga makanyo gati Ambuje Akunnungu, ŵampele che Musa kwaligongo lya Ŵaisilaeli, indu yenu tiinjendele yambone. Nlimbangane ni kukola ntima wangajogopa. Ngasinjogopa namose ngasimpwa ntima. <verse eid="1CH 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 22:14" />Njalile kwannope kuti najiŵichile mbiko nyuumba ja Ambuje Akunnungu, tani elufu tatu na mia nne ya sahabu ni tani elufu salasini na nne ya madini ga feza. Pamo ni yeleyo, gapali madini ga shaba ni chisyano gangaŵalanjikwa, miisile chilechilepe mbao pamo ni maganga, nambo nkusachilwa njonjechesye. <verse eid="1CH 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 22:15" />Nkwete ŵandu achajinji ŵakupanganya masengo, apali ŵakusepa maganga, ŵakutaŵa majumba, maselemala ni ŵandu ŵali ni umanyilisi wakupisyangana, <verse eid="1CH 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 22:16" />ŵakusyana saabu, madini ga fesa, shaba ni chisyano. Elo, ntande masengo! Ambuje Akunnungu awe pamo ni mmwe!”<verse eid="1CH 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 22:17" />Nipele che Daudi ŵaalajisye ilongola wose ŵa ku Isilaeli ŵaakamusye che Selemani mwanagwe, achitiji, <verse eid="1CH 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 22:18" />“Uli, Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu nganaŵa pamo ni ŵanyamwe? Uli, nganampa chitendeŵe nkati mbande syose? Ŵelewo ŵandendekasisye naapute achinsyene chilambo chino ni kuundenda naatawale, ni sambano jino alinji ŵandu ŵa Ambuje Akunnungu pamo ni ŵandu ŵao. <verse eid="1CH 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 22:19" />Sambano mwatumichile Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu kwa kuchalila ni ntima wose. Njimuchanje nkaataŵile Ambuje Akunnungu malo jajikukundikwa kwa kwapopelela kuti Lisanduku lya Lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu pamo ni yoombo yao yose yaikukundikwa kwa kwapopelela Ambuje Akunnungu yaikutumika pakupopela, iŵichikwe mu Nyuumba jajitawikwe kwaligongo lya Ambuje Akunnungu.”<verse eid="1CH 22:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="1CH 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 23:1" />Che Daudi paŵachekulwipe, ŵantesile che Selemani aŵe mwenye jwa ku Isilaeli.<verse eid="1CH 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Masengo ga Ŵalawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 23:2" />Mwenye che Daudi ŵasongangenye achakulu wose ŵa ku Isilaeli pamo ni ŵambopesi ni Ŵalawi. <verse eid="1CH 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 23:3" />Ŵalawi wose uŵaliji ni yaka salasini ni kupunda ŵaŵalanjikwe. Ŵaliji ŵandu elufu salasini na nane. <verse eid="1CH 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 23:4" />Che Daudi ŵatite ŵandu ishilini na nne elufu pasikati jao tajimilile masengo ga pa Nyuumba ja Ambuje Akunnungu ni ŵandu elufu sita aŵe ilongola ni ŵakulamula, <verse eid="1CH 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 23:5" />ŵandu elufu nne talindilileje mmilango, ni ŵandu elufu nne tachiŵa ŵakwimba, achalapaga Ambuje Akunnungu kwa yombo ya ung'asi inaikolosisye kwa ligongo lya masengo go.<verse eid="1CH 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 23:6" />Che Daudi ŵasapulenye Ŵalawi maunjili gatatu malinga ni mwasiŵelele mitundu ja ngosyo sya Lawi, ntundu wa Gelishoni, ntundu wa Kohati ni ntundu wa Melali.<verse eid="1CH 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 23:7" />Ŵanache ŵa che Gelishoni ŵaliji ŵaŵili. Ŵanache wo ali che Ladani ni che Shimei. <verse eid="1CH 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 23:8" />Che Ladani ŵakwete ŵanache ŵatatu, che Yeieli jwakwitiwo jwao ni che Setamu ni che Yoeli. <verse eid="1CH 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 23:9" />Ŵanache ŵa che Shimei ŵaliji ŵatatu, ŵanache wo ali che Shelomiti ni che Hasieli ni che Halani. Ŵatatu wo ŵaliji ilongola wa ntundu wa che Ladani. <verse eid="1CH 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 23:10" />Ŵanache ŵa che Shimei ŵaliji ncheche ilongolape, che Yahati ni che Sina ni che Yeushi ni che Belia. <verse eid="1CH 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 23:11" />Che Yahasi ŵaliji jwa kwitiwo, ni kukuyaga che Sina. Nambo che Yeushi ni che Belia pakuŵa nganakola ŵanache achajinji, ŵaŵalanjikwe nti ŵa ntundu umo ni kupegwa masengo kwa pamo.<verse eid="1CH 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 23:12" />Ŵanache ŵachilume ŵa che Kohati ŵaliji ncheche, ŵanache wo ali che Amulamu ni che Ishali ni che Hebuloni ni che Usieli. <verse eid="1CH 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 23:13" />Ŵanache ŵachilume ŵa che Amulamu ŵaliji che Haluni ni che Musa. Che Haluni ŵasagulikwe ni uŵelesi wakwe aŵe ŵakuiswejesya indu yaiŵichikwe kwa ligongo lya kutyosya mbopesi paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu ni kwatumichila kwa kwapa upile ŵandu kwa lina lya Ambuje Akunnungu moŵa gose pangali mbesi. <verse eid="1CH 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 23:14" />Ŵanache ŵa che Musa, mundu jwa Akunnungu, ŵaŵalanjikwe nti sehemu ja Ŵalawi. <verse eid="1CH 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 23:15" />Che Musa ŵakwete ŵanache ŵaŵili ŵachilume, ŵanache wo ali che Gelishomu ni che Elieseli. <verse eid="1CH 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 23:16" />Jwakwitiwo ju che Gelishomu ŵaliji che Shebueli. <verse eid="1CH 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 23:17" />Che Elieseli ŵaliji ni mwanache jumo pe liina lyakwe che Lehabia. Nambo che Lehabia ŵakwete ŵanache achajinji nnope.<verse eid="1CH 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 23:18" />Che Ishali mwanache jwaaŵili ju che Kohati ŵaliji ni mwanache liina lyakwe che Shelomiti, jweleju ŵaliji chilongola jwa ntundu. <verse eid="1CH 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 23:19" />Che Hebuloni mwanache jwaatatu ju che Kohati ŵakwete ŵanache ŵachilume ncheche, ŵanache wo ali che Yelia, ni che Amalia ni che Yahasieli ni che Yekameamu. <verse eid="1CH 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 23:20" />Che Usieli mwanache jwancheche ju che Kohati ŵakwete ŵanache ŵachilume ŵaŵili, ŵanache wo ali che Mika ni che Ishia.<verse eid="1CH 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 23:21" />Che Melali ŵakwete ŵanache ŵachilume ŵaŵili, ŵanache wo ali che Mali ni che Mushi. Ŵanache ŵa che Mali ŵaliji ŵaŵili, ŵanache wo ali che Eleasali ni che Kishi. <verse eid="1CH 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 23:22" />Che Eleasali ŵawile pangakola mwanache jwachilume, nambo achiŵali pe. Achiŵali wo ŵalombekwe ni achiŵipwagwe, ŵanache ŵa che Kishi. <verse eid="1CH 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 23:23" />Ŵanache ŵa che Mushi ŵaliji ŵatatu, che Mali, ni che Edeli ni che Yelemoti.<verse eid="1CH 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 23:24" />Welewo ni uŵelesi u che Lawi malinga ni mwajiŵelele mitundu jawo. Mundu jwalijose jwaali ni yaka ishilini ni kupunda, ŵalembekwe liina lyakwe, ni sooni ŵapanganyisye masengo pa Nyuumba ja Ambuje Akunnungu.<verse eid="1CH 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 23:25" />Che Daudi ŵatite, “Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵa ku Isilaeli, ŵapele chitendelewele ŵandu ŵakwe, nombewo chaatame pa Yelusalemu moŵa gose pangali mbesi. <verse eid="1CH 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 23:26" />Kwayele, Ŵalawi ngasaachilwa kulijigala sooni lisakasa lyakusimanila kwaligongo lya Ambuje Akunnungu pane yoombo yakwe yakupopelela.” <verse eid="1CH 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 23:27" />Malinga ni malajisyo gambesi gaŵalajisye che Daudi, Ŵalawi wose ŵakwete yaka ishilini ŵalembekwe kwaligongo lya masengo ga pa Nyuumba ja Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="1CH 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 23:28" />Masengo gao galiji kwakamusya ŵambopesi ŵa ntundu wa che Haluni kupanganya masengo ga pa Nyuumba ja Ambuje Akunnungu, ni kugosa ndeenje ni yuumba, ni koosya yoombo yekundikwe kwa mapopelo yose ni masego gane gagaligose ga pa Nyuumba ja Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="1CH 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 23:29" />Sooni ŵaliji nkuimilila mikate jajikutyosekwa kwa Ambuje Akunnungu, ni utandi wesyajiche yambone kwaligongo lya mbopesi ja utandi ni mikate jangataga amila, mbopesi syakutinisya ni mauta, ni mbopesi sya utandi wewanganye ni mauta, pamo ni yoombo yakupimila winji wa mbopesi, pane ukulu wakwe. <verse eid="1CH 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 23:30" />Kila lyuŵa kundaŵi ni ligulo masengo gawo galiji kwatogolele ni kwalapa Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="1CH 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 23:31" />Ŵasachilwe kutenda yeleyo katema ka kutyosya mbopesi ni pa kila Lyuŵa lya Kupumulila ni paukuwoneka mwesi ni pachindimba chilichose cha chidini. Sooni ŵasachilwe kupanganya masengo pa Nyuumba ja Akunnungu, ni kupanganya kila chindu chachikusachilwa kutendekwa. <verse eid="1CH 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 23:32" />Kwayele, ŵapanganyisye masengo gao pa lisakasa lyakusimanilana kwaligongo lya Akunnungu, pamalo papakundikwe kwa mapopelo, kwa kulongoswa ni achalongo ŵao uŵelesi u che Haluni kwa utumichile wa pa nyuumba ja Ambuje Akunnungu.<verse eid="1CH 23:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="1CH 24" />
  <para style="s">Masengo ga Ŵambopesi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 24:1" />Jeleji ni mipingo ja uŵelesi wa che Haluni. Che Haluni ŵakwete ŵanache ncheche, ŵanache wo ali che Nadabu ni che Abihu ni che Eleasali ni che Itamali. <verse eid="1CH 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 24:2" />Che Nadabu ni che Abihu ŵajasiche atati ŵao ali chiŵela ŵajumi, ni nganakola ŵanache, kwayele che Eleasali ni che Isamali achapwawo ŵaliji ŵambopesi. <verse eid="1CH 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 24:3" />Mwenye che Daudi ŵaaŵisile uŵelesi wa che Haluni mu mipingo malinga ni masengo gawo. Ŵatesile yeleyo kwa ukamusi wa che Sadoki, mwanache ju che Eleasali, ni che Ahimeleki, mwanache ju che Itamali. <verse eid="1CH 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 24:4" />Ilongola achajinji ŵatyochele mu uŵelesi u che Eleasali, kulekangana ni uŵelesi u che Itamali, ŵaŵichikwe malinga mwaŵelele, uŵelesi u che Eleasali ŵakwete ilongola kumi na sita, ni uŵelesi u che Itamali ŵakwete ilongola nane. <verse eid="1CH 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 24:5" />Ŵaŵichikwe pangali lusagu kwa kwapijila kula, pakuŵa kwaliji ni achakulu ŵa peuto papakundikwe kwa kwapopelela Akunnungu ni achakulu ŵa ŵandu ŵa kwapopela Akunnungu pasikati ja uŵelesi u che Eleasali ni che Itamali. <verse eid="1CH 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 24:6" />Nombe jwakulemba che Shemaya mwana ju che Netaneli juŵaliji Mlawi, ŵalembile meena gao paujo pa mwenye che Daudi ni ŵakamusi ŵakwe, che Sadoki jwambopesi, ni che Ahimeleki mwana ju che Abiasali ni ilongola ŵa achalongo ŵao ŵambopesi ni Ŵalawi. Ntundu wa che Eleasali ŵapatile kula jimo, ni ntundu wa che Itamali ŵapatile kula jimo.<verse eid="1CH 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 24:7" />Kula jaandanda ŵapatile che Yehoialibu ni jaaŵili ŵapatile che Yedaya, <verse eid="1CH 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 24:8" />kula jaatatu ŵapatile che Halimu ni jancheche ŵapatile che Seolimu, <verse eid="1CH 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 24:9" />jansano ŵapatile che Malikia ni jasita ŵapatile che Miyamini, <verse eid="1CH 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 24:10" />jasaba che Hakosi ni janane che Abiya, <verse eid="1CH 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 24:11" />jatisa che Yoshua ni jakumi che Shekania, <verse eid="1CH 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 24:12" />jakumi na moja che Eliashibu ni jakumi na mbili che Yakimu, <verse eid="1CH 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 24:13" />jakumi na tatu che Hupa, jakumi na nne 14 che Yeshebeabu, <verse eid="1CH 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 24:14" />jakumi na tano che Biliga ni jakumi na sita che Imeli; <verse eid="1CH 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 24:15" />jakumi na saba che Hesili ni jakumi na nane che Hapisesi, <verse eid="1CH 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 24:16" />jakumi na tisa che Petahia ni jaishilini che Yehesikeli, <verse eid="1CH 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 24:17" />jaishilini na moja che Yakini ni jaishilini na mbili che Gamuli; <verse eid="1CH 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 24:18" />ja ishilini na tatu che Delaya ni ja ishilini na nne che Maasia.<verse eid="1CH 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 24:19" />Ŵelewu ni uwaliji utalati wao uwaŵichikwe wa kupanganya masengo paŵajiinjilaga pa Nyuumba ja Ambuje Akunnungu malinga ni iŵatite kulajiswa ni che Haluni atati ŵao, mpela Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵa ku Isilaeli, iŵatite kwalamula.<verse eid="1CH 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uŵelesi wine wa Ŵalawi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 24:20" />Aŵa ali ilongola ŵa uŵelesi wine wa Ŵalawi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 24:20">Kutyochela ku che Amulamu ŵapali che Shubaeli, ni kutyochela ku che Shubaeli ŵapali che Yedeya.<verse eid="1CH 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 24:21" />Kutyochela ku che Lehabia mwanache ju che Eleasali ŵapali che Ishio juŵaliji jwakwitiwo.<verse eid="1CH 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 24:22" />Kutyochela mu uŵelesi wa che Ishio ŵapali che Shelomiti ni kutyochela ku che Shelomiti ŵapali che Yahati.<verse eid="1CH 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 24:23" />Ŵanache ŵa che Ebuloni ŵaliji, che Yelia mwanache jwa kwitio, che Amalia jwaaŵili, che Yaasieli ŵatatu, che Yakameamu ŵa ncheche.<verse eid="1CH 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 24:24" />Mwanache ju che Usieli ŵaliji che Mika. Kutyochela kuuŵelesi wa che Mika ŵaliji che Shamile.<verse eid="1CH 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 24:25" />Kutyochela mu uŵelesi wa che Ishia mpwakwe che Mika kwaliji che Sekalia.<verse eid="1CH 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 24:26" />Ŵanache ŵa che Melali ŵaliji, che Maili ni che Mushi ni Yaasia, <verse eid="1CH 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 24:27" />che Yaasia ŵakwete ŵanache ncheche, ŵanache wo ali che Beno ni Shohamu ni che Zakuli ni che Ibili. <verse eid="1CH 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 24:28" />Che Mahili ŵakwete ŵanache ŵaŵili, ŵanache wo ali che Eleasali ni che Kishi. <verse eid="1CH 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 24:29" />Che Eleasali nganakola mwanache nambo che Kishi ŵakwete mwanache jumo liina lyakwe che Yelameeli. <verse eid="1CH 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 24:30" />Che Mushi ŵakwete ŵanache ŵatatu, ŵanache wo ali che Mahili, ni che Edeli ni che Yelemoti.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 24:30">Ŵanyao ni uŵelesi wa che Lawi malinga ni mitundu jao.<verse eid="1CH 24:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 24:31" />Nombe ŵanyawo wose ŵapijile kula mpela achalongo ŵao uŵelesi wa che Haluni yatesile, paujo pa che Daudi ni che Sadoki ni che Ahimeleki ni paujo pa ilongola ŵa ulongo wa ŵambopesi ni Ŵalawi. Nnango wa ŵandu achajinji watendelwe yalumo ni nnango wa ŵandu kanandi.<verse eid="1CH 24:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="1CH 25" />
  <para style="s">Ŵakwimba ŵa pa Nyuumba ja Akunnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 25:1" />Mwenye che Daudi ni ilongola ŵa Ŵalawi, ŵasagwile ŵanache ŵampepe ŵa che Asafu, ni ŵa che Hemani ni ŵa che Yedutuni, kuti alongosye masengo ga kulondola kwa ing'wenyeng'wenye, ni inanda ni tugoma twamwana. Gelega ni meena ga aŵala uŵasagulikwe kwalongosya ŵandu kupopela, pamo ni masengo gachigapanganyikwe ni likuga lyalililyose.<verse eid="1CH 25:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 25:2" />Kutyochela kwa ŵanache ŵa che Asafu ŵapali che Sakuli ni che Yosefu ni che Netania ni che Ashalela. Ŵanyawo ŵalongoswaga ni che Asafu juŵalondolaga katema kaŵalongosyaga mwenye.<verse eid="1CH 25:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 25:3" />Ŵanache ŵa che Yedutuni ŵaliji sita, ŵanache wo ali che Gedalia, ni che Seli, ni che Yeshaya, ni che Shimei, ni che Hashabia ni che Matitia. Ŵanyaŵa ŵalongoswaga ni atati ŵao, ŵalondolaga kwa ing'wenyeng'wenye, ni ŵatogolele ni kwalapa Ambuje Akunnungu.<verse eid="1CH 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 25:4" />Ŵanache kumi na nne ŵa che Emani ŵaliji che Bukia ni che Matania ni che Usieli ni che Shebueli ni che Yelemoti ni che Anania ni che Anani ni che Eliata ni che Gidaliti ni che Lomanti Eseli ni che Yoshibekasha ni che Maloti ni che Hotili ni che Mahasioti. <verse eid="1CH 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 25:5" />Akunnungu ŵampele che Emani, jwa kulondola jwa mwenye, aŵa ŵanache kumi na nne ŵachilume, ni ŵatatu ŵachikongwe, mpela iŵatite kulanga kuti ŵakusye. <verse eid="1CH 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 25:6" />Achiŵanagwe wose ŵajimbile nyiimbo kwa tugoma twamwana, ni inanda ni ing'wenyeng'wenye, pa kupopelela pa Nyuumba ja Akunnungu ali nkulongoswa ni atati ŵawo. Che Asafu ni che Yedutuni ni che Hemani ŵalamulilwaga ni mwenye.<verse eid="1CH 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 25:7" />Pamo ni achalongo ŵao Ŵalawi uŵajiganyikwe kwajimbila Ambuje Akunnungu, wosepe uŵakombwele kwimba ŵaliji mia mbili na semanini na nane.<verse eid="1CH 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 25:8" />Achachekulu ni achachanda, ŵakwiganya ni ŵakulijiganya, ŵaapanjile masengo gawo kwa kwapijila kula.<verse eid="1CH 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 25:9" />Yeleyi ni iyatite kwaŵika kwakwapijila kula malina mitundu jao. Kula jaandanda jangwilile che Yosefu jwapaulongo wa che Asafu, ŵaliji kumi na mbili, ni kula jaaŵili jangwilile che Gedalia ni achiŵanagwe pamo ni achalongo ŵakwe, ŵaliji kumi na mbili. <verse eid="1CH 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 25:10" />Jaatatu ŵapatile che Sakuli ni achiŵanagwe pamo ni achalongo ŵakwe, ŵaliji kumi na mbili, <verse eid="1CH 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 25:11" />jancheche ŵapatile che Seli ni achiŵanagwe pamo ni achalongo ŵakwe, ŵaliji kumi na mbili. <verse eid="1CH 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 25:12" />Kula jansano ŵapatile che Netania ni achiŵanagwe pamo ni achalongo ŵakwe, ŵaliji kumi na mbili, <verse eid="1CH 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 25:13" />kula jasita ŵapatile che Bukia ni achiŵanagwe pamo ni achalongo ŵakwe, ŵaliji kumi na mbili, <verse eid="1CH 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 25:14" />kula jasaba ŵapatile che Ashalela ni achiŵanagwe pamo ni achalongo ŵakwe, ŵaliji kumi na mbili, <verse eid="1CH 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 25:15" />kula janane ŵapatile che Yeshaya ni achiŵanagwe pamo ni achalongo ŵakwe, ŵaliji kumi na mbili, <verse eid="1CH 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 25:16" />kula jatisa ŵapatile che Matania ni achiŵanagwe pamo ni achalongo ŵakwe, ŵaliji kumi na mbili, <verse eid="1CH 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 25:17" />kula jalikumi ŵapatile che Shimei ni achiŵanagwe pamo ni achalongo ŵakwe, ŵaliji kumi na mbili, <verse eid="1CH 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 25:18" />kula jakumi na moja ŵapatile che Asaleli ni achiŵanagwe pamo ni achalongo ŵakwe, ŵaliji kumi na mbili, <verse eid="1CH 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 25:19" />kula jakumi na mbili ŵapatile che Hashabia ni achiŵanagwe pamo ni achalongo ŵakwe, ŵaliji kumi na mbili, <verse eid="1CH 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 25:20" />kula jakumi na tatu ŵapatile che Shebueli ni achiŵanagwe pamo ni achalongo ŵakwe, ŵaliji kumi na mbili, <verse eid="1CH 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 25:21" />kula jakumi na nne ŵapatile che Matisia ni achiŵanagwe pamo ni achalongo ŵakwe, ŵaliji kumi na mbili, <verse eid="1CH 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 25:22" />kula jakumi na tano ŵapatile che Yelemoti ni achiŵanagwe pamo ni achalongo ŵakwe, ŵaliji kumi na mbili, <verse eid="1CH 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 25:23" />kula jakumi na sita ŵapatile che Anania ni achiŵanagwe pamo ni achalongo ŵakwe, ŵaliji kumi na mbili, <verse eid="1CH 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 25:24" />kula jakumi na saba ŵapatile che Yoshibekasha ni achiŵanagwe pamo ni achalongo ŵakwe, ŵaliji kumi na mbili, <verse eid="1CH 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 25:25" />kula jakumi na nane ŵapatile che Anani ni achiŵanagwe ni achalongo ŵakwe, ŵaliji kumi na mbili, <verse eid="1CH 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 25:26" />kula jakumi na tisa ŵapatile che Maloti ni achiŵanagwe pamo ni achalongo ŵakwe, ŵaliji kumi na mbili, <verse eid="1CH 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 25:27" />kula jaishilini ŵapatile che Eliasa ni achiŵanagwe pamo ni achango ŵakwe, ŵalji kumi na mbili, <verse eid="1CH 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 25:28" />kula jaishilini na moja ŵapatile che Hotili ni achiŵanagwe pamo ni achalongo ŵakwe, ŵaliji kumi na mbili, <verse eid="1CH 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 25:29" />kula ja ishilini na mbili ŵapatile che Gidaliti; ni achiŵanagwe pamo ni achalongo ŵakwe, ŵaliji kumi na mbili, <verse eid="1CH 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 25:30" />kula ja ishilini na tatu ŵapatile che Maasioti ni achiŵanagwe pamo ni achalongo ŵakwe, ŵaliji kumi na mbili, <verse eid="1CH 25:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 25:31" />kula ja ishilini na nne ŵapatile che Lomamti Eseli ni achiŵanagwe pamo ni achalongo ŵakwe, ŵaliji kumi na mbili.<verse eid="1CH 25:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="1CH 26" />
  <para style="s">Ŵakulindilila ŵapa Nyuumba ja Akunnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 26:1" />Ajino ni mipingo ja Ŵalawi uŵapanganyaga masengo ga kulindilila mmilango. Kutyochela ku ŵandu ŵa panlango wa che Kola, ŵaliji che Meshelemia mwanache jwu che Kole jumo jwakwe nkati ŵanache ŵao che Asafu. <verse eid="1CH 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 26:2" />Jwelejo ŵakwete ŵanache saba, ŵanache wo ali che Sekalia mwanache jwao jwakwitio, che Yediaeli jwaaŵili jwao, che Sebadia jwatatu, che Yasinieli jwancheche, <verse eid="1CH 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 26:3" />che Elamu jwansano jwawo, che Yohanani jwasita ni che Eliehoenai jwasaba.<verse eid="1CH 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 26:4" />Sooni ŵapali che Obedi Edomu, nombeju ŵakwete ŵanache nane, ŵanache wo ali che Shemaya jwakwitio jwawo, che Yeosabadi jwaaŵili jwao, che Yoa jwaatatu, che Sakali jwancheche, jwa Nesaneli jwansano jwao, <verse eid="1CH 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 26:5" />che Amieli jwasita, che Isakali jwasaba ni che Peuletai jwanane.<verse eid="1CH 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 26:6" />Che Shemaya mwanache jwakwitiwo ju che Obedi Edomu ŵakwete ŵanache sita, ŵanache wo ali che Otini, ni che Lafaeli, che Obedi, ni che Elizabadi ni che Eliu ni che Semakia. <verse eid="1CH 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 26:7" />Ŵanyaŵa ŵaliji ŵakuchimbichikwa mu ntundu wao ligongo ŵaliji ŵandu ŵali ni ukombole wekulungwa pa indu yejinji, ŵanache ŵaŵili ŵakuumbesi wo yaani che Eliu ni che Semakia ŵaliji wamachili pa ngondo.<verse eid="1CH 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 26:8" />Wosewo waliji uŵelesi u che Obed Edomu, ŵanyao ni ŵanache ŵao ni achalongo ŵao, ŵaliji ŵandu ŵamachili ga kuputana ngondo pamo ni machili ga kupanganya masengo. Uŵelesi wose wa che Obedi Edomu ŵaliji ŵandu sitini na mbili.<verse eid="1CH 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 26:9" />Nombe che Meshelemia ŵakwete ŵanache ni achalongo ŵakwe uŵaliji ŵamachili pa ngondo, ŵanawose ŵaliji ŵandu kumi na nane.<verse eid="1CH 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 26:10" />Che Hosa jumo jwa ŵanache ŵa che Melali ŵakwete ŵanache ncheche, ŵanache wo ali che Shimuli juŵaŵichikwe chilongola ni atatigwe nachiŵamuno nganaŵa mwanache jwakwitio, <verse eid="1CH 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 26:11" />Che Ilikia jwaŵili, ni che Tebalia jwatatu, che Sekalia jwancheche. Ŵanache wose ŵa che Hosa pamo ni achalongo ŵao ŵaliji kumi na tatu, wose wo ŵaliji ŵakulindilila ŵapa Nyuumba ja Akunnungu.<verse eid="1CH 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 26:12" />Ŵakulindilila mmilango wo ŵagaŵanyiche mipingo nti yautite ulongo ŵao, ni ŵanyao ŵapanganyisye masengo mu Nyuumba ja Ambuje Akunnungu mpela iŵatiji kupanganya Ŵalawi ŵane. <verse eid="1CH 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 26:13" />Ulongo wauliwose, pangaikosya winji wakwe, ŵapijile kula kuti asagule nnango chi uchalindilile. <verse eid="1CH 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 26:14" />Kula jakusagula juchalindilile nnango wa kungopochelo lyuŵa jaagwilile che Shelemia. Sooni ŵapijile kula jine kwaligongo lya che Sekalia mwanagwe, juŵaliji ni nganisyo syakulungamika, ni ŵasagulikwe kulindilila nnango wa cha kumpoto. <verse eid="1CH 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 26:15" />Che Obedi Edomu ŵasagulikwe kulindilila nlango wa cha kulujenda, ni ŵanache ŵakwe ŵasagulikwe kujilindilila ngokwe. <verse eid="1CH 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 26:16" />Che Shupimu ni che Hosa ŵasagulikwe kulindilila nnango wa chakumaswelo lyuŵa, ni nnango wa Shalekesi kulili litala lya kulutando, kulindilila ko kwatendekwe kwa kupisyangana pisyangana. <verse eid="1CH 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 26:17" />Moŵa gose cha kungopochelo lyuŵa kwaliji ni ŵakulindilila mmilango sita, ni cha kumpoto kwaliji ni ŵakulindilila ncheche, ni cha kulujenda ŵakulindilila ncheche, nombe kuungokwe kwaliji ni ŵakulindilila ŵaŵiliŵaŵili. <verse eid="1CH 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 26:18" />Pauli nsana, cha kumaswelo lyuŵa kwaliji ni ŵakulindilila ncheche uŵaliji mwitala, ni ŵaŵili ŵaliji pansana. <verse eid="1CH 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 26:19" />Jeleji ni mipingo ja ŵakulindilila mmilango ŵaŵaliji ŵandu ŵa uŵelesi u che Kola ni uŵelesi u che Melali ŵaŵapanganyaga masengo gakulindilila mmilango.<verse eid="1CH 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Masengo gane ga pa Nyuumba ja Akunnungu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 26:20" />Pasikati ja Ŵalawi, che Ahiya ŵalindililaga ngokwe ja pa Nyuumba ja Akunnungu, ni ngokwe ja indu yaiwichikwe kwaligongo lya Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="1CH 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 26:21" />Che Ladani, jumo jwa ŵandu ŵa ntundu wa Gelishoni, ŵaliji nchekulu jwa achalongo ŵane, nkati mwake ŵaliji isukulu ya ŵanache ŵa che Yehieli. <verse eid="1CH 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 26:22" />Ŵanache ŵane ŵaŵili ŵa che Ladani, che Setamu ni che Yoeli, ŵaliji ŵakugosa ngokwe ja pa Nyuumba ja Ambuje Akunnungu.<verse eid="1CH 26:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 26:23" />Ŵane uŵapanganyisye masengo go ŵaliji ŵandu ŵa uŵelesi wa che Amulamu ni che Ishali ni che Hebuloni ni che Usieli.<verse eid="1CH 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 26:24" />Che Shebueli, jwantundu wa Gelishoni, mwanache ju che Musa, ŵaliji jwankulu jwa pamasengo ga ŵakulindilila ngokwe syo. <verse eid="1CH 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 26:25" />Ni mpwakwe, che Elieseli, uŵaliji atatigwe che Lehabia, juŵammeleche che Yeshaya, juŵammeleche che Yolamu, juŵammeleche che Sikili, juŵammeleche che Shelomiti. <verse eid="1CH 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 26:26" />Che Shelomiti ni achalongo ŵakwe ni uŵaliji ŵakulindilila ngokwe syose syasigosekwe indu iŵaitosile mwenye che Daudi ni ilongola ŵa ngosyo, ni achakulu ŵa mipingo ja ŵangondo elufu moja ni mipingo ja ŵangondo mia moja ni ŵangondo ŵali ni machili kwa Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="1CH 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 26:27" />Indu ine iŵajigele kutyochela kungondo yatyosekwe kwa Ambuje Akunnungu kwaligongo lya kutaŵila Nyuumba ja Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="1CH 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 26:28" />Ni sooni indu iyatyosyekwe ni che Samweli jwakulondola jwa Akunnungu, ni che Shauli mwanache ju che Kishi, ni che Abuneli, ni che Yoabu mwanache ju che Seluya, kwa Ambuje Akunnungu, ŵaigosaga che Shelomiti ni achalongo ŵakwe.<verse eid="1CH 26:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Masengo ga Ŵalawi ŵane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 26:29" />Pasikati ja ŵanache ŵa che Ishali, che Kenani ni achiŵanagwe ŵapegwilwe masengo ga paasa pa Nyuumba ja Akunnungu aŵeje ŵakamusi ni ŵakwalamulila Ŵaisilaeli.<verse eid="1CH 26:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 26:30" />Kutyochela kwa ŵanache ŵa che Hebuloni, che Ashabia ni achalongo achinjakwe elufu moja na mia saba, wose ŵandu ŵamachili pa ngondo, ŵapegwilwe masengo gakwimilila malo ja Ŵaisilaeli jijaliji chakumaswelo lyuŵa kwa lusulo lwa Yolodani. Ŵajimilile masengo gose ga Ambuje Akunnungu ni masengo ga mwenye che Daudi. <verse eid="1CH 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 26:31" />Nkati ŵanache ŵa che Hebuloni, che Yelia ŵaliji chilongola jwa mitundu ja ulongo wose. Pa chaka cha alubaini cha umwenye wakwe mwenye che Daudi, masengo ga kuuchilichisya gapanganyikwe, achalume ŵaali ni umanyilisi wekulungwa ŵapatikene kwele ku Yeseli ku chilambo cha ku Gileadi. <verse eid="1CH 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 26:32" />Mwenye che Daudi ŵaasagwile che Yeliya ni achalongo ŵakwe elufu mbili na mia saba ŵaali ni machili pa ngondo ni ilongola ŵa ngosyo, kuti ajimilile masengo gose ga Akunnungu ni mwenye che Daudi ku malo ja ŵandu ŵa ngosyo sya Lobeni, ni Gadi ni nusu ja ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Manase, uŵatamaga chakungopochelo lyuŵa kwa lusulo lwa Yolodani.<verse eid="1CH 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="1CH 27" />
  <para style="s">Ilongola ŵa ŵangondo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 27:1" />Aga gali meena ga ŵandu ŵa ku Isilaeli ŵaŵaliji ilongola ŵa paulongo wao ni ilongola ŵa mipingo ja ŵangondo elufu moja ni mipingo ja ŵangondo mia moja ni achakulu ŵaŵantumichile mwenye che Daudi pa kupanganya masengo mkupisyangana kwinjila ni kutyoka. Kila mwesi ni kila chaka, mpingo wakupisyangana wa ŵandu elufu ishilini na nne ŵakamulaga samu jakupanganya masengo.<verse eid="1CH 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 27:2" />Mwesi waandanda juŵajimilile mpingo waandanda ŵaliji che Yashobeamu mwanache jwa che Sabudieli. Mpingo wakwe waliji ni ŵangondo elufu ishilini na nne. <verse eid="1CH 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 27:3" />Jweleju ŵaliji jwa uŵelesi wa che Pelesi jwa lukosyo lwa Yuda, nombejo ŵaliji jwankulu jwa ilongola wosepe ŵa ŵangondo pa mwesi waandanda. <verse eid="1CH 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 27:4" />Juŵajimilile mpingo waaŵili pa mwesi waaŵili ŵaliji che Dodai jwa uŵelesi wa che Ahohi. Mpingo wakwe ŵaliji ni ŵangondo elufu ishilini na nne. <verse eid="1CH 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 27:5" />Juŵajimilile mpingo waatatu pa mwesi waatatu ŵaliji che Benaya mwanache jwa che Yehoyada jwambopesi. Jweleju ni juwaliji chilongola jwa mpingo wakwe uwaliji ni ŵangondo elufu ishilini na nne. <verse eid="1CH 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 27:6" />Ajuju ni ajula che Benaya juŵaliji mundu jwamchili pasikati ja aŵala ŵandu selasini, ni sooni ŵaliji chilongo jwa mpingo wo. Ni che Amisabadi mwanagwe ni juŵaliji jwankulu pa mpingo wakwe. <verse eid="1CH 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 27:7" />Juŵajimilile mpingo wancheche pa mwesi wancheche ŵaliji che Asaeli, mpwakwe che Yoabu, che Sebadia mwanagwe ni juŵajimilile pamalo pakwe. Mpingo wakwe waliji ni ŵangondo elufu ishilini na nne. <verse eid="1CH 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 27:8" />Juŵajimilile mpingo wa nsano pa mwesi wansano ŵaliji che Shamuhuti jwa uŵelesi wa Mwisilahi, nombe jweleju mpingo wakwe waliji ni ŵangondo elufu ishilini na nne. <verse eid="1CH 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 27:9" />Juŵajimilile mpingo wa sita pa mwesi wa sita ŵaliji che Ila mwana jwa che Ikeshi, kutyochela ku Tekoa. Mpingo wakwe waliji ni ŵangondo elufu ishilini na nne. <verse eid="1CH 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 27:10" />Juŵajimilile mpingo wa saba pa mwesi wa saba ŵalji che Helesi, jwantundu wa Peloni kutyochela mu lukosyo lwa Efulaimu. Mpingo wakwe waliji ni ŵangondo elufu ishilini na nne. <verse eid="1CH 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 27:11" />Juŵajimilile mpingo nane pa mwesi wa nane, ŵaliji che Sibekai, jwa uŵelesi wa che Sela kutyochela musi wa ku Hushati. Mpingo wakwe waliji ni ŵangondo elufu ishilini na nne. <verse eid="1CH 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 27:12" />Juŵajimilile mpingo wa tisa pa mwesi wa tisa ŵaliji che Abieseli, jwa kutyochela musi wa ku Anatoti lukosyo lwa Benjamini. <verse eid="1CH 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 27:13" />Juŵajimilile mpingo wa likumi pa mwesi wa kumi ŵaliji che Mahalai jwakutyochela ku Netofati. Jweleju jwaliji jwa ntundu wa che Sela, nombe najo mpingo wakwe walji ni ŵangondo elufu ishilini na nne. <verse eid="1CH 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 27:14" />Juŵajimilile mpingo wa kumi na moja pa mwesi wa kumi na moja ŵaliji che Benaya kutyochela ku Pilatoni malo ja ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Efulaimu. Nombeju mpingo wakwe waliji ni ŵangondo elufu ishilini na nne. <verse eid="1CH 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 27:15" />Juŵajimilile mpingo wa kumi na mbili pa mwesi wa kumi na mbili ŵaliji che Helidai jwauŵelesi wa che Otinieli, kutyochela ku Netofati. Nombeju mpingo wakwe waliji ni ŵangondo elufu ishilini na nne.<verse eid="1CH 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ilongola wa ngosyo sya Ŵaisilaeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 27:16" />Aga gali meena ga ŵandu ŵaŵaliji achakulu ŵa ngosyo sya ku Isilaeli. Kwa Ŵalobeni ŵaliji che Eleasali mwanache ju che Sikili, kwa Ŵasimeoni ŵaliji che Shefatia mwanache ju che Maaka, <verse eid="1CH 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 27:17" />kwa Ŵalawi waliji che Hashabia mwanache ju che Kemueli ni kwa Ŵaaluni ŵaliji che Sadoki, <verse eid="1CH 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 27:18" />kwa Ŵayuda ŵaliji che Elihu jumo mwa achapwakwe mwenye che Daudi, ni Ŵaisakali ŵaliji che Omuli mwanache ju che Mikaeli, <verse eid="1CH 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 27:19" />kwa Ŵasabuloni ŵaliji che Ishumaia mwanache ju che Obadia ni kwa Ŵanafutali ŵaliji che Yelimoti mwanache ju che Asilieli, <verse eid="1CH 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 27:20" />kwa Ŵaefulaimu ŵaliji che Hoshea mwanache ju che Asasia ni kwa nusu ja lukosyo lwa Manase ŵaliji che Yoeli mwanache ju che Pedaia, <verse eid="1CH 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 27:21" />kwa nusu ja lukosyo lwa Manase kwele ku Gileadi ko ŵaliji che Ido mwanache ju che Sakalia ni kwa Ŵabenjamini ŵaliji che Yaasieli mwanache ju che Abuneli, <verse eid="1CH 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 27:22" />kwa Ŵadani ŵaliji che Asaleli mwanache ju che Yelohamu. Ŵelewo ni ŵaŵaliji achakulu ŵa ngosyo sya Ŵaisilaeli.<verse eid="1CH 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 27:23" />Mwenye che Daudi nganiŵaŵalanga ŵandu ŵanganaichila yaka ishilini pakuŵapo Ambuje Akunnungu, ŵalanjile kwachuluya Ŵaisilaeli aŵeje achajinji mpela ndondwa sya kumaunde. <verse eid="1CH 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 27:24" />Che Yoabu mwanache ju che Seluya ŵatandite kwaŵalanga ŵandu nambo nganamalisya. Kwaligongo lya kwaŵalanga ŵandu, lutumbilo lwa Akunnungu lwaiche pachanya pa Isilaeli, nombe uŵalanje wo nganiulembekwa mu itabu ya chikumbuchisyo cha mwenye che Daudi.<verse eid="1CH 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŵakwimilila ipanje ya mu umwenye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 27:25" />Mundu juŵajimilile mbiko sya mwenye che Daudi ŵaliji che Asimaweti mwanache ju che Adieli. Che Yonatani mwanache ju che Usia ŵajimilile mbiko jijaliji mmamigunda, mmisi ni mmisinda ni pa likome. <verse eid="1CH 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 27:26" />Juŵaajimililaga ŵamasengo ga kulima mmigunda ŵaliji che Esili mwanache ju che Kelebu. <verse eid="1CH 27:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 27:27" />Juŵajimililaga migunda ja misabibu ŵaliji che Shimei, jwa ku Lamati. Juŵajimililaga kukolosya ni kujigosa divai mmalo mwakwe ŵaliji che Sabidi jwakutyochela ku Shifimi <verse eid="1CH 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 27:28" />Juŵajimililaga migunda ja misabibu ni mikuju ja ku Shefela ŵaliji che Baala Hanani, jwa ku Gedeli. Juŵajimililaga ngokwe sya mauta ŵaliji che Yoashi. <verse eid="1CH 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 27:29" />Juŵajimililaga ilango iyaliji ku Shaloni ŵaliji che Shitilai, jwa ku Shaloni. Juŵajimililaga ilango iyaliji ku iŵata ŵaliji che Shafati mwanache ju che Adilai. <verse eid="1CH 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 27:30" />Juŵajimililaga ngamia ŵaliji che Obili jwa uŵelesi wa Ishimaeli. Juŵajimililaga mbunda ŵaliji che Yedeya, jwa ku Melonoti. <verse eid="1CH 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 27:31" />Juŵajimillaga mipingo ja ngondolo ŵaliji che Yasisi, Mhagali. Ŵanawose wo ni uŵaliji ŵakwimilila ipanje ya mwenye.<verse eid="1CH 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ŵashauli ŵa mwenye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 27:32" />Che Yonatani, njombagwe mwenye che Daudi, ŵaliji mshauli, mundu jwali ni umanyilisi ni jwakulemba. Jweleju ni che Yehieli mwanache ju che Hakimoni ŵaajinganyisye ŵanache ŵa mwenye. <verse eid="1CH 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 27:33" />Che Ahitofeli ŵaliji mshauli jwa mwenye, ni che Hushai jwa ku Aliki ŵaliji mbusangagwe mwenye. <verse eid="1CH 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 27:34" />Che Ahitofeli paŵawile, che Yehoyada mwanache ju che Benaya pamo ni che Abiasali ŵajigele lipesa, ŵaliji ŵashauli ŵa mwenye. Che Yoabu ŵaliji chilongola jwa mipingo jose ja ŵangondo wosepe ŵa mwenye.<verse eid="1CH 27:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="1CH 28" />
  <para style="s">Che Daudi akwasalila che Solomoni mataŵe ga Nyuumba ja Akunnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 28:1" />Mwenye che Daudi ŵalajisye kuti ilongola wosepe wa Ŵaisilaeli asongangane ku Yelusalemu. Kwayele achakulu wosepe ŵa chilambo cha ku Isilaeli, achakulu ŵa ngosyo ni ilongola ŵa mipingo ja ŵangondo ŵaŵantumichilaga mwenye ni ilongola ŵa mipingo ja ŵangondo elufu moja ni mipingo ja ŵangondo mia moja ni ŵakwimilila ipanje yosepe ni ng'ombe sya mwenye, ni achiŵanagwe pamo ni ŵakamusi wa nyuumba ja umwenye, ŵandu ŵakombola kuputana ngondo ni ŵangondo wosepe ŵakumanyika ŵasongangene kwele ku Yelusalemu ko mpela iŵasalilwe.<verse eid="1CH 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 28:2" />Pelepo mwenye che Daudi ŵajimi ni ŵatite, “Mwanya achalongo achinjangu ni ŵandu ŵangu, mumbilikanile. Nalapilile muntima mwangu kujitaŵa nyuumba kwaligongo lya Lisanduku lya Lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu, chitengu chakuŵichila makongolo ga Akunnungu ŵetu, ni naliŵisile chile kutaŵa. <verse eid="1CH 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 28:3" />Nambo Akunnungu ŵanganyisye pakuŵa uneji ndili mundu jwakuputana ngondo ni sooni muleje ŵandu achajinji. <verse eid="1CH 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 28:4" />Nambo Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵa ku Isilaeli ŵasagwile une pasikati ja achalongo wa atati ŵangu me mwenye jwa ku Isilaeli moŵa gose pangali mbesi. Ŵalusagwile lukosyo lwa Yuda lulongosye ni kutyochela mu lukosyo lo ŵausagwile nnango wa atati ŵangu, ni pasikati ja ŵanache ŵa atati ŵangu, ŵanonyelwe ni une ni kuungamula umwenye wa ku Isilaeli jose. <verse eid="1CH 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 28:5" />Ambuje Akunnungu ambele ŵanache achajinji, ni pasikati ja ŵelewo wose, ansagwile mwanache jwangu che Selemani, aŵe mwenye jwa Ŵaisilaeli, mu umwenye wa Ambuje Akunnungu.”<verse eid="1CH 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 28:6" />“Ambuje Akunnungu ŵaasalile une kuti, ‘Mwanache jwenu che Selemani ni jutachindaŵila nyuumba ni ndenje syakwe. Nansagwile jwelejo aŵe mwanangu ni une tinjiŵa atatigwe. <verse eid="1CH 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 28:7" />Tinjiulimbisya umwenye wakwe moŵa gose pangali mbesi, iŵaga tajendelechele kugakamulisya kusyene makanyo gangu ni malajisyo gangu mpela mwakutendela lelojino.’”<verse eid="1CH 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 28:8" />“Nipele sano, paujo pa nsongangano wa Ŵaisilaeli wose wu, mpingo wa ŵandu ŵa Ambuje Akunnungu, ni paujo pa Akunnungu ŵetu, nnolochesye kugakamulichisya makanyo gose ga Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵetu, kuti njendelechele kuchitenda chenu achi chilambo chambone chi, ni kwalechele ŵanache ŵenu chiŵe chawo moŵa gose pangali mbesi.”<verse eid="1CH 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 28:9" />Ni kwa che Selemani ŵatite, “Mwanangu che Selemani, ngunlajisya kuti mumpikanileje Akunnungu jwa atati ŵenu ni kwatumichila ni ntima wenu wosepe ni kwa nningwa wakukunda, pakuŵapo Ambuje Akunnungu akulolesyalolesya mitima ni akumanyilila ukotopasyo ni miningwa ja ŵandu. Mwasosaga ŵeleo, timwawone, nambo mwannekaga nombejo tachinkana mmwejo moŵa gose pangali mbesi. <verse eid="1CH 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 28:10" />Nipele nlilolechesye ni kukumbuchila kuti, Ambuje Akunnungu ansagwile mmwejo mwataŵile Nyuumba jawo. Sambano nlimbe ntima nipele nkamule masengo go.”<verse eid="1CH 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 28:11" />Pelepo che Daudi ŵampele che Selemani mwanagwe lamani ja mataŵe gosepe ga Nyuumba ja Akunnungu, ni majuumba gakwe, ni mbiiko syakwe, ni magolofa gakwe ni yuumba yakwe yamunkanti ni peuto pa chitengu cha kulechelesya sambi. <verse eid="1CH 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 28:12" />Ŵampele lamani ja indu yose iyalapililaga mu ntima nkati ndenje sya Nyuumba ja Ambuje Akunnungu, yuumba ya Akunnungu ni yuumba yakugosela ipanje ya pa Nyuumba ja Akunnungu ni yuumba yakugosela mituuka jepeleche kwa Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="1CH 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 28:13" />Sooni ŵansalile itajile ŵambopesi ni Ŵalawi pakupanganya masengo gawo, ni sooni nkati masengo gosepe ga mu Nyuumba ja Akunnungu ni kugosa yoombo yose ya Nyuumba ja Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="1CH 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 28:14" />Ŵansalile sooni utopele wa sahabu jajikusachilwa pa kukolosya yoombo yosepe ya sahabu yaikutumika palipose, utopele wa feza jajikusachilwa pakolosya yoombo ya feza yaikutumika palipose, <verse eid="1CH 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 28:15" />ni utopele wa yakuŵichila nyali ya sahabu pamo ni nyali syakwe ni utopele wa feza jakolochesya yakuŵichila nyali ya feza ni nyali syakwe malinga ni ichijile kutumika chakuŵichila nyali chilichose, <verse eid="1CH 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 28:16" />ni utopele wa sahabu jakolochesya mesa syakuŵichila mikate jajityosekwe kwaligongo lya Akunnungu, ni sooni utopele wa feza syakolochesya mesa sya feza. <verse eid="1CH 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 28:17" />Sooni ŵansalile nkati utopele wa sahabu jajikusachilwa pakukolosya isyano yakopochesya nyama, mabakuli ni ikombe, sooni utopele wa sahabu ni feza jajikusachilwa pakolosya mabakuli ga sahabu ni ga feza, <verse eid="1CH 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 28:18" />ni utopele wa sahabu jakolochesya chilisa chakututumichisya ubani. Ŵampele sooni chisyasyo cha mutuka ja sahabu ja yepanganyikwe yaili ni mapapiko yetambalukule mapapiko ni kuliunichila Lisanduku lya Lilangano lya Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="1CH 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 28:19" />Yele yose, mwenye che Daudi ŵaiŵisile pangasisika kwa malembo gaŵapegwilwe ni Ambuje Akunnungu. Masengo gose gatendekwe malinga ni jele lamani jo.<verse eid="1CH 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 28:20" />Nipele, mwenye che Daudi ŵansalile che Selemani mwanagwe kuti, “Nlimbangane ni kukola machili, ngatende masengo ga. Nkajogopa namose kukola lipamba. Ambuje Akunnungu, ŵaali Akunnungu ŵangu ali pamo ni mmwe. Ngasanneka nambo tachiŵa ni mmwe mpaka patigamale masengo gose gagakusachilwa pakujitaŵa Nyuumba ja Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="1CH 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 28:21" />Ŵambopesi ni Ŵalawi amasile kwapanjila masengo gachagapanganye pa Nyuumba ja Akunnungu. Ŵamasengo ŵaali ni ukombole wa kila chindu chaŵe chile kunkamuchisya, ni ŵandu wosepe pamo ni ilongola ŵao tachiŵa paasi pa ulamusi wenu.”<verse eid="1CH 28:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="1CH 29" />
  <para style="s">Yakupeleka kwaligongo lya kutaŵila Nyuumba ja Akunnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 29:1" />Pelepo mwenye che Daudi ŵausalile mpingo wose kuti, “Mwanangu che Selemani jwasagulikwe ni Akunnungu, ali jwanchanda jwannondi, ni jwangasyoŵelela nkati kutaŵa nyuumba, ni masengo ga gali gamakulungwa. Nyuumba jitajitaŵe nganijiŵa ja mundu, nambo jili ja Ambuje Akunnungu. <verse eid="1CH 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 29:2" />Nipele limbene indite kukombola kujiŵichila Nyuumba ja Akunnungu ŵangu mbiiko ja sahabu jakolochesya indu ya sahabu, ni feza jakolochesya indu ya feza, ni shaba jakolochesya indu ya shaba, ni chisyano chakolochesya indu ya chisyano, ni itela yakolochesya indu ya itela. Iyoyo peyo misile maganga ga ndalama gagakuŵilanjikwa shohamu kwaligongo lya kugumbalichi mu ikodobwa, ni alumasi ni maganga ga langi jakupisyangana, ni maganga ga ndalama ga uŵele wakupisyangana ni malumalu, yanayose yi yejinji kwannope. <verse eid="1CH 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 29:3" />Sooni, konjechesya pa indu yosepe inapeleche ku Nyuumba ja Ambuje Akunnungu, ngwete sooni chipanje chele chachili changuchangupe cha sahabu ni feza, ni pakuŵapo ngujinonyela Nyuumba ja Akunnungu ŵangu, nguchityosya kwaligongo lya Nyuumba ja Akunnungu ŵangu. <verse eid="1CH 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 29:4" />Tani elufu tatu sya sahabu kutyochela ku Ofili, tani mia mbili alobaini sya feza jesalele jakuunichila likumba lya nyuumba, <verse eid="1CH 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 29:5" />ni kwaligongo lya kolochesya yoombo yakupisyangana ichikolosekwe ni mafundi ni makono. Ng'osile sahabu kwaligongo lya yoombo ya sahabu ni feza kwaligongo lya yoombo ya feza. Ana ŵani ŵachampelechele Ambuje Akunnungu kwakusaka kwakwe kuti alityosye lelo jino kwa Ambuje Akunnungu?”<verse eid="1CH 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 29:6" />Pelepo achakulu ŵa mitundu, ilongola ŵa ngosyo sya ku Isilaeli, ilongola ŵa mipingo ja ŵangondo elufu moja ni mipingo ja ŵangondo mia moja, nombe ŵakamusi ŵakwimilila masengo ga mwenye ŵatyosisye kwakusaka kwawo achinsyene, <verse eid="1CH 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 29:7" />kwaligongo lya masengo ga nyuumba ja Akunnungu. Indu iyatyosile yaliji, tani mia moja na sabini sya sahabu ni tani mia tatu na alobaini sya feza ni tani mia sita na ishilini sya shaba ni tani elufu tatu na mia nne sya chisyano. <verse eid="1CH 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 29:8" />Aŵala ŵaŵakwete maganga ga ndalama ŵagatyosisye gaŵichikwe mu mbiko ja Nyuumba ja Akunnungu, kwa kwimililwa ni che Yehieli, jwauŵelesi wa che Gelishoni. <verse eid="1CH 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 29:9" />Pelepo ŵandu wo ŵasangalele ligongo atyosisye kwakusaka kwawo achinsyene, pakuŵapo kwa ntima wao wose ŵatyosisye kwa Ambuje Akunnungu usache wao achisnyene, nombe mwenye che Daudi ŵasangalele kwannope.<verse eid="1CH 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Che Daudi akwalapa Akunnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 29:10" />Pelepo che Daudi ŵaakusisye Ambuje Akunnungu paujo pa nsongangano wose, achitiji, “Nlapikwe moŵa gose pangali mbesi ni moŵa gose pangali mbesi, Alakwe Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵa atati ŵetu Isilaeli. <verse eid="1CH 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 29:11" />Alakwe Ambuje Akunnungu mmwe nli ŵakulu, ni nkwete machili, nli ŵalumbili, nli ŵakupunda ni nli mwenye, pakuŵa yose yaili kwinani ni pachilambo ili yenu. Alakwe Ambuje Akunnungu, umwenye uli wenu, nomwe nkuchimbichikwa, nli ŵakulu pa indu yosepe. <verse eid="1CH 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 29:12" />Kusichila ni luchimbichimbi ikutyochela kukwenu, nomwe nkutawala pa indu yose, mmakono mwenu nkwete ukombole ni machili, nomwe nkwakusya unkwanonyela, ni kwalimbisya ŵanawose. <verse eid="1CH 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 29:13" />Sambano Alakwe Ambuje Akunnungu ŵetu, tukuntogolela ni kulilapa liina lyenu lyekulu.”<verse eid="1CH 29:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 29:14" />“Nambo uneji nduni, ni ŵandu ŵangu ali ŵani, namose tukombole kumpa chindu? Pakuŵapo indu yosepe ikutyochela kukwenu, tumpele yaili yenu mmwe mwasyene. <verse eid="1CH 29:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 29:15" />Uweji tuli achalendo paujo penu, ni ŵakwendajenda mpela iŵaliji achambuje ŵetu wose. Moŵa getu pachilambo gali mpela mbwilili waukupita, ni ngatukombola kuchitila chiwa. <verse eid="1CH 29:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 29:16" />Alakwe Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵetu, tusongangenye ipanje yose yi kuti tuntaŵile nyuumba kwa kulichimbichisya liina lyenu lyeswela, nambo yose yi ityosile kukwenu, nombe yose yo ili yenu. <verse eid="1CH 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 29:17" />Ngwimanyilila, Akunnungu ŵangu, kuti mmwejo nkuulinga ntima, nomwe nkunonyelwa ni ntima wakulungamika. Indu yose yi ndyosisye kwa kusaka kwangu ni kwa ntima wagoloka. Ni uneji naiweni kwa kusangalala, ŵandu ŵenu ŵaali apano yatiteje kuntyochesya kwa kusaka kwawo achinsyene. <verse eid="1CH 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 29:18" />Alakwe Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵa che Ibulahimu, ni che Isaka ni che Yakobo, achambuje ŵetu, mmiche lungwanu lu mmitima mwa ŵandu ŵenu moŵa gose ni njitende mitima jao jiŵeje ni chikulupilichiko kukwenu. <verse eid="1CH 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 29:19" />Mwatende che Selemani mwanangu akombole kugajitichisya makanyo ni malajisyo ni mashalaiti genu ni kutenda kila chindu kuti ataŵe Nyuumba jenu jele jinajiŵichile mbiko.”<verse eid="1CH 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 29:20" />Nipele, mwenye che Daudi ŵasalile ŵandu wose ŵaŵasongangene kuti, “Mwalape Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵenu.” Ni ŵanawose ŵaŵasongangene ŵaakusisye Ambuje Akunnungu, Akunnungu ŵa achambuje ŵao, ŵatindiŵele ni kukotama mpaka paasi ni kupele luchimbichimbi kwa Ambuje Akunnungu ni kwa mwenye nombe najo.<verse eid="1CH 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 29:21" />Pa lyuŵa lyaaŵili ŵampelechele Ambuje Akunnungu mbopesi jakutinisya, ng'ombe elufu moja ni ngondolo elufu moja pamo ni sadaka sya yakung'wa ni mbopesi syejinji kwaligongo lya Ŵaisilaeli wosepe. <verse eid="1CH 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 29:22" />Nipele, pa lyuŵa lyo ŵalile ni kung'wa kwa sangalala jekulungwa paujo pa Ambuje Akunnungu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 29:22">Ŵankamwile umwenye che selemani mwanache jwa che Daudi, kaaŵili. Ŵanjitilile mauta aŵe mtawala kwa liina lya Ambuje Akunnungu ni che Sadoki aŵe jwambopesi. <verse eid="1CH 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 29:23" />Pelepo che Selemani ŵatemi pa chitengu cha umwenye cha Ambuje Akunnungu, pamalo pa che Daudi atatigwe. Nombejo indu yaajendele yambone, ni ŵandu wose ŵa chilambo cha ku Isilaeli ŵanjitichisye. <verse eid="1CH 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 29:24" />Ilongola wose, ni ŵangondo ŵangajogopa ngondo, ni ŵanache ŵa che Daudi ŵaliŵisile paasi pa mwenye che Selemani. <verse eid="1CH 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 29:25" />Ambuje Akunnungu ŵampele che Selemani lumbili lwambone paujo pa Ŵaisilaeli wose, ŵantesile aŵe jwakupikanika kupunda mwenye julijose juŵatawele Isilaeli che Selemani akanaŵe kutawala.<verse eid="1CH 29:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumbesi kwa utawala wa che Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 29:26" />Nipele che Daudi mwanache jwa che Yese, ŵaliji mwenye pa Isilaeli josepe. <verse eid="1CH 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 29:27" />Ŵatawele Isilaeli kwa yaka alobaini, yaka saba ŵatawele kwele ku Hebuloni ko, ni yaka selasini na tatu ŵatawele kwele ku Yelusalemu ko. <verse eid="1CH 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 29:28" />Ŵawile ali achekulwipe kwannope, ali ni yaka yejinji, ni jwakusichila ni jwakuchimbichikwa. Nipele che Selemani mwanagwe ŵaliji mwenye pamalo pa atatigwe. <verse eid="1CH 29:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 29:29" />Ngani sya mwenye che Daudi kutandilila kuundanda mpaka kuumbesi, silembekwe mu itabu ya ŵakulondola ŵatatu ŵa, che Samweli ni che Natani ni che Gadi. <verse eid="1CH 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 29:30" />Itabu yo ikusala nkati indu yose ya utawala wakwe ni ukombole wakwe ni indu iyaasimene che Daudi wo, ni Ŵaisilaeli ni mwenye syosepe mu chilambo.<verse eid="1CH 29:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 29" />
</usx>